<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id" />
  <para style="h">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow aming tukah dowi chekhai; nachenganchepaw risi Samuel naown kown mih sakowmra uowi. Now arui khin dow 1,000-900 BC takra kowi chekhai. 1 hai 2 Samuel bowih mih auown khe dow pabowih sang chowdiah; tawkche akung kowi dow ta changah pre bowih khai. Mami bowih kowi dow risi Samuel uang dia mih hownia risi iawng hai tara chet mih iawng aia chang lup mih lawnguan, now mang Sawl chowm mang mih lawnguan arui uowi. Mami bowih kowi kowh lang pankri mih maru-uüa dow risi Samuel, mang Sawl hai mang David büah chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Israeluüa dow amatni riaret kowi kowh chenchapuüa iawng amatni kowi nakruitownah kownkow Samuel tut-e kowlü mang khai. Nakhowk khe Israeluüa luk kowi narik chowm mang kownkow Benjamin krungchak hownia Sawl kowi nümnapah kown mih Samuel kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe khai. Tawkche Sawl mih CHAKRAMANG nau iawng chang dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia luk kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kunmarau khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Now akung kowi dow Sawl takcha Israeluüa luk kowi nachowm mang kownkow David kowi nümnapah kown mih Samuel kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe khai. Now Thurai kloah mih David dow Israeluüa luk kowi anowmma hai akürma chowm mang khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi kowh lang pankri mih lawnguan dow Israeluüa kowh mang ching Thurai mih Israeluüa lü mang rakowi auown kowi Saul, now akung kowi David hai aia kowh krungchakuüa rut kowi peah mangra mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi kowh lang pankri mih laiklow dow, “Aia kaah sakowm iawng uowi miuüa kowi dow aia nakhetah reng kown. Nachenganchepaw maru ngakuüa kowi dow iiu dawng kowi aia napiakah kown,” pami chekhai. (2:9)</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Kawngma: Kawngma pami dow tasen khe kowh kowmatia taka müa uanh chekhai. Nami dow lawngha hown chepaw phen hown chepaw tasen khe kowmatia buk towkala müa kowi kowh tawngah mih uanh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Nümnap: Nümnap pami dow tape arah khe kawngmu rirow kowi uowi iawng klai pe sau hanow phuangah mih chekhai. Israeluüa dow amatni nachangah uamow kown mih maru kowi hai nachangah mang kown mih maru kowi klai pe sau hanow nami arah dow ap pe khai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Tangbung khup rah: Tangbung khup rah pami dow anikma uowira nadowi chekhai. Nami dow kua iawng arah iukma panow maru kawmma uowi rah chekhai. Nami dow siphaiuüa cham tasen khe kowh tanungra kim chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Thaulang: Thaulang pami dow tawngpaw akrat pusara hai kramra uowi dowi mih khin kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai. Thaulangma mih khin khe dow maru mih tawng iawng mih akrat pusara paw krum dowi, now takrow takraira paw uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Mukmang: Mukmang pami dow awdara uowima risiuüa hai maru-uüa hown Thurai uang taklang mih chekhai. Aia chowng khe dow Thurai mih maru-uüa hai risiuüa tut-e aia kowh naukrang hai kamrütra mukmang kowi uang phuang pe reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Samuel kowh chownglawng hai lup lawnguan 1:1-8:22</para>
  <para style="io1">Israel pren kowi rik chowm mang mih Sawl kowh chownglawng 9:1-12:25</para>
  <para style="io1">Mangra hownia Sawl kowi Thurai nuata mih 13:1-15:35</para>
  <para style="io1">David kowh chownglawng 16:1-20:42</para>
  <para style="io1">Israel pren mang iawng hai David uanla mih chownglawng 21:1-31:13</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Samuel dia mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1" />Israel chuprek chaprek Efraimuüa kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi Rama marow kowi Elkana pami maru uowi lowk ia. Aia dow Efraim krungchak Jeroham kowh chapa chekhai. Jeroham dow Elihu kowh chapa, Elihu dow Tohu kowh chapa, now Tohu dow Zuf kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 1:2" />Elkana kowh dow masi uowi pre ma. Lowk ia mih ming dow Hanna, now alowk mih ming dow Penina chekhai. Penina dow ka chah chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Hanna dow ka chah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 1:3" />Elkana dow ning towng amatni kowh marow hownia Silo marow kowi kowkowi reng. Aia dow Silo marow kowi kowkowi now lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiiaah reng, now tawncher hown kowh phuchua paw changla reng chekhai. Nami khin khe Silo marow kowi kowh chang uamow lup miuüa dow uamow Eli kowh chapa Hawpni hai Finehas iüah chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 1:4" />Tawncher hown chang phuchua mih ni khe Elkana dow amasi Penina hai aia kowh chauüa maten kowi changla phuchua mih chaknga hownia pela abak chi khai. <verse eid="1SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 1:5" />Tawkche Hanna kowi dow CHAKRAMANG pe kaah chah dowi chepaw lang sakrauah rakowi aia changla phuchua mih chaknga hownia aia peah pre bak khai. <verse eid="1SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 1:6" />Hanna kowi CHAKRAMANG pe kaah chah dowi rakowi aprawimow Penina mih atungma khareah hanow peah saktuak kawm khai. <verse eid="1SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 1:7" />Naiawng Hanna kowi Penina khareah hai peah saktuak kawm mih dow ning towng Silo kowi cham chup Thurai büah mih khin khe chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Hanna dow cha dowi kham dowi kowi hing karta hüah khai. <verse eid="1SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 1:8" />Naiawng uowi mih ahua Elkana khita now Hanna kowi tek pe mih, “Tawng rakowi chow en lang kar rereng? Tawngplawng kowchow tawngpaw en cha en kham dowi? Tawng rakowi chow khowt pat en sak kowi rau? Chapa uowi hamüt ia mih lak-e ang lowk iachow uowi mih lang iung nadowi bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 1:9" />Akat dow Silo marow kowi ki changta phuchua hanow nami phuchua ngar ki chata kung kowi Hanna mih kowchup Thurai khai. Nami khin khe uamow Eli dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh kimplawt re-e chowm rah kowi hawt chowm phülü khai. <verse eid="1SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 1:10" />Nakhowk khe Hanna dow saktuak kawmkratma hown kar se kar se chup Thurai khai. <verse eid="1SA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 1:11" />Aia dow takham se CHAKRAMANG tut-e maiawng awr lü khai, “Aw lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG, ang dow en kowh nar chekhai. Ang kowh saktuak kawm mih mü ang diah, now ang prakowi pela ching diah. Now en che tamata ang dowi kowi pela ang chapa lowk ia khai hanow chownglawng chowng pratma vüi aia kowi ang napeta en kown. Aia kowi dow katpaw nakep pe sam kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 1:12" />Naiawng Hanna chup Thurai mih khin khe uamow Eli mih Hanna nawr prakowi haimüla reng chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 1:13" />Sakdawng hownia Hanna chup Thurai mih chekhai rakowi nawr taih chü lüplüp; aklow dow taah dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Hanna pua mih naown padow Eli ka tuak khai. <verse eid="1SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 1:14" />Naiawng rakowi Hanna kowi Eli tek pe mih, “Apuama mün khowt tak chow en nauowi kown? Hang kham grep tui tham bowt. Ching bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 1:15" />Nakhowk khe Hanna klangah mih, “Aw ang kowh chakramang, ang pua mih nadowi. Lainowmma ang kowh saktuak kawm khai. Iu paw ang kham dowi, arak paw ang kham dowi; ang kowh kawmkrat lawng CHAKRAMANG kowi ang phowk pe mih chowtaih. <verse eid="1SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 1:16" />Ang dow en kowh nar chowtaih. Masiuüa ngakma pami hauang ka tuak ang diah. Lainowmma tuak kawm tuak krat hown ang chup Thurai mih chowtaih,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 1:17" />Nakhowk khe Eli tek pe mih, “En pacham ka sakklamra lah. Israeluüa kowh Thurai tut-e en lüah mih dow aia pacham pe en lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 1:18" />Now Hanna tek pe mih, “Mami narma luk kowi en kowh sanara pacham uowi lah,” pakhai. Naiawng tekla now Hanna dow powt khai, now cha chakkham khai bowt. Nami hownia bowt now aia lumowr kowi dow tuak kawm tuak krat mih powm uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 1:19" />Now auai rau dow murpa awr rü büah hanow kowchupiia Thurai büah khai. Nami kung kowi dow Rama marow kowi kowh amatni kim kowi mang büah khai bowt. Akung kowi dow Elkana mih amasi Hanna hown taphua taiua khai, now CHAKRAMANG dow Hanna awr lü mih ka tuak khai bowt. <verse eid="1SA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 1:20" />Nahanow Hanna dow kum nau khai bowt. Now akhin uang tachi khe dow Hanna mih pen chapa lowk ia khai. Nakhowk khe Hanna tek mih, “Mami chah dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e kowh ang lüah mih chekhai,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi achapa ming dow Samuel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Samuel </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami auan dow lü pami hai Thurai pami chekhai. </char></note> pahai aia rük pe khai.<verse eid="1SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samuel kowi Thurai tut-e apta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 1:21" />Auai ning khe Elkana dow ning towng kowh chang reng iawng kimchakuüa kowi pawla hanow CHAKRAMANG vüi tawncher hown nakowchang phuchua kownkow hai takhamta mih uanap nakowchang kownkow Silo marow kowi kowkowi khai iawk. <verse eid="1SA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 1:22" />Nachenganchepaw nami leng dow amasi Hanna mih tawi tarü dowi chekhai. Ahua kowi Hanna tek pe mih, “Ingcha iawn kham towng khe chiang ingcha hailawm CHAKRAMANG pur kowi ang kowkowi kown. Nakhowk khe dow chownglawng prat nakowi nahing uowi kownkow ingcha kowi ang ta towla kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 1:23" />Nakhowk khe ahua tek pe mih, “En tut-e iung iawng chang towbowt. Ingcha iawn kham towng dowi mowr chawng diah towbowt. CHAKRAMANG dow en takhamta iawng en nowng changla kownkow pacham khowng en lah,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Hanna dow kim kowi ta uowi khai. Aia dow iawn kham towng dowi mowr achapa kowi thumah mawmah khai.<verse eid="1SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 1:24" />Now achapa iawn kham towng khe dow Hanna hai Elkana iüah mih achapa kowi pawla now Silo marow kowi kowh Thurai chup kim kowi kowkowi khai bowt. Nakhowk khe amatchi dow sum ning mih chiala apum, kawmdi hamüt set ngia hai grep tui chak pik im hown pa-im pawla iüah khai. Nami khin khe paw achapa dow asowmchow reng tak chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 1:25" />Nakowi mih amatchi dow ngen chiala hanow CHAKRAMANG kowi phuchuaah khai. Now amatchi kowh chapa kowi dow uamow Eli tut-e kowpawla iüah khai. <verse eid="1SA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 1:26" />Uamow Eli kowi Hanna tek pe mih, “Aw ang kowh chakramang, pre sum ning dowi rawn mami re-e iowng se chup Thurai mih masiuüa kowi en ka tuak reng tak bow? Nami masiuüa dow ang chowbowt. <verse eid="1SA 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 1:27" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowi ang lü mih dow mami chah vüi kowi chekhai. CHAKRAMANG dow ang lüah mih pe ang khai. <verse eid="1SA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 1:28" />Naiawng rakowi ang paw mami chah kowi CHAKRAMANG vüi peta mih chowbowt. Aia sing uowi sak uowi mowr dow CHAKRAMANG kowh towbowt,” pakhai. Nami kung kowi dow amatchi huaiu mih CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiiaah khai.<verse eid="1SA 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1SA 2" />
  <para style="s">Hanna chup Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 2:1" />Hanna dow chup Thurai se tek mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 2:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">“Ang kowh awmrawmra dow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:1">pe awng ang mih dow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">Ransu-uüa pur kowi dow ang ia tek awmrawm meng khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:1">tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow lawng ang khai.<verse eid="1SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 2:2" />CHAKRAMANG iawng <char style="w">chimsai</char> mih miapaw uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:2">aia klen kowi akeng mih Thurai lang uowi dowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:2">A-i kowh Thurai dow Singku Huamang iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:2">aia iawng mih Singku Huamang dow lang uowi dowk chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 2:3" />“CHAKRAMANG dow lowra nowngia tuk mih Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:3">aia dow enni changah mih lup iawng chet enni tara reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:3">Naiawng rakowi hang owrow büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:3">now bawri paw hang kham büa diah.<verse eid="1SA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 2:4" />Tasen kürma miuüa kowh salangba dow aia klowkta pe khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:4">Tawkche tim miuüa kowi dow aia peah kür khai.<verse eid="1SA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 2:5" />Akhawr uowi dowi miuüa dow kawmat khawr khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">amatni dow chakkham rakowi cham kowi sukkri khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:5">Akhawr hown uowi miuüa tarapdow khawr dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">amatni dow aduma ka cha khai bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:5">Chauüa akawmma mih masiuüa kowh dow chauüa uowi dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">Nachenganchepaw atingma mih masiuüa dow ka chah ranit ia khowk chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 2:6" />Singra hai kowngra dow CHAKRAMANG rut kowi chowtaih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:6">tawngbak mih kowi dow aia pe kowngah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:6">tawngbak mih kowi dow kowngra hownia aia awr pe singah khai.<verse eid="1SA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 2:7" />Kurengra hai ngaraira dow CHAKRAMANG rut kowi chowtaih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:7">tawngbak mih kowi dow aia nemah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:7">tawngbak mih kowi dow aia pe chowngah khai.<verse eid="1SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 2:8" />Ngaraima miuüa kowi dow dinchow dawng hownia aia krüngah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">amatni kowi dow mawngchawng dawng hownia aia lümah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">Amatni kowi dow maru iukuüa hown aia pe taiua chowmah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">amatni kowi dow ringkawra uowima mih chowm rah kowi aia pe chowmah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">Tawngplawng kowchow panow lusa chüng maten dow CHAKRAMANG kowh chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">aia dow naiawngün <char style="w">achüng</char> luk kowi lusa mih towah khai.<verse eid="1SA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 2:9" />“Aia kaah sakowm iawng uowi miuüa kowi dow aia nakhetah reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:9">Nachenganchepaw maru ngakuüa kowi dow iiu dawng kowi aia napiakah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:9">Tawngplawng kowchow panow kowmatia kür hown dow tawngpaw nowng chang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 2:10" />CHAKRAMANG kowh ransu-uüa dow napiak nak kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">amatni kowi dow mukuang hownia kaikreng tün hown aia nakingküaah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">CHAKRAMANG dow prenchur nammowt mowr nachet tara kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">aia kowh mang kowi dow aia napeah kür kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">aia nümnapah mih maru kowi dow aia napeah awngra kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 2:11" />Nami kung kowi Elkana hai amasi Hanna iüah mih kim prakowi plan khai bowt. Amatchi kowh kim dow Rama kowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Samuel dow uamow Eli nimkrüa kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh lup tawi ta chang khai bowt.<verse eid="1SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eli chapauüa kowh angak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 2:12" />Eli kowh chapa pre ia dow lainowmma chang angak khai. Amatchi dow CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkaw dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 2:13" />Amatchi dow uamow kangowh chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw amatchi kowh chowm krang uowi krang dow maiawng chekhai. Maru kawmuüa uang changla phuchua mih chaknga butah reng tak khe amatchi dow amatchi kowh nar kowi kowchin reng chekhai. Now nami nar dow chaknga khowng müa chuk pawla lowk khai. <verse eid="1SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 2:14" />Aia dow nami chuk hown chaknga puh kowi kowh chaknga sek mih krawi chukah khai. Now nami chuk kowi uang tawi tachuk mih chaknga dow uamow kowi aia kowpawla pe khai. Naiawng hai amatchi dow Silo marow kowi kowh tawncher hown uang chang phuchua mih Israeluüa kowi hawt changah reng chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 2:15" />Nami klen kowi tawncher sau tikah dowi rawn tak khe uamow kowh nar dow uang pawla phuchua mih maru tut-e uang reng chekhai. Now nami nar tek pe mih, “Akreng müa uamow kowi peah chaknga ne dit. Aia dow chaknga sing chowtaih napaw en kown; abutia nadowi,” pape khai. <verse eid="1SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 2:16" />Nakhowk khe uang pawla phuchua mih maru che, “Ang narik tikta asau tak, nami kung kowi phai en nau mowr paw iang,” pahai uamow kowh nar kowi tek pe khai hanow, “Nadowi iow! Kawmat matmat uaipe! Nadowi now kür hown nami chaknga ang napawla kown,” padow tek pe reng chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 2:17" />Naiawng hai nami uamow pre ia kowh angak dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi lainowmma nga khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh phuchuaah mih uanh maten amatchi dow nü dowi klowk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 2:18" />Nachenganchepaw Samuel dow ngeuüachow chepaw CHAKRAMANG kowh lup tawi chang khai. Aia kowh tawnguat paw uamow khupah iawng mih adipükchow mih la hown kowh kawngah mih ephawd kowrmow chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 2:19" />Samuel u dow ahua hown ning towng Silo marow kowi tawncher hown kowh ningma phuchua uang chang reng chekhai. Nami khin khe aia dow Samuel vüi uang sownla pe kowrmow lowk chi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 2:20" />Now Elkana hai amasi kowi Eli peah prasi mih, “Enchi kowh chapa kowi mih CHAKRAMANG kowi enchi peah khai. Nami takcha kowi CHAKRAMANG dow pacham pe enchi chah küng lah,” pakhai. Nami kung kowi amatchi dow kim prakowi mang iüah khai. <verse eid="1SA 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 2:21" />CHAKRAMANG dow Hanna kowi saksing sanaah khai. Naiawng rakowi Hanna dow kum nau hanow ka chah khai bowt. Aia kowh dow chapa sum ia hai chama pre ia chekhai. Samuel dow CHAKRAMANG lup changra hownia awr iuk awr sown rürü khai bowt.<verse eid="1SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 2:22" />Now Eli dow lainowmma uang lawngtang khai bowt. Aia dow Israeluüa luk kowi kowh achapa pre ia changah mih srui tawi ta khai. Nami klen kowi <char style="w">taklowp taklangra te</char> plawt kowi kowh uang chang lup mih masiuüa hawmh kowi phua iuaah mih laiklow paw aia ta bowk khai. <verse eid="1SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 2:23" />Naiawng rakowi achapa pre ia kowi aia tek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng mih lup enchi tuk chang khai? Enchi chang lup ngak mih laiklow dow naiawngün maru-uüa maten hownia ang ta khowk. <verse eid="1SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 2:24" />Chapauüa low, naiawng mih lup ngak hang chang iüah tham bowt! Enchi lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa naiawng nacham tek naklak kown mih iung dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 2:25" />Maru lala che lowkkowlowk tachang angak khai hanow amatchi vüi dow Thurai naia thawp pe taking tasangra iawk kown taih. Tawkchedow CHAKRAMANG kowi kingküa se chang angak khai hanow amatchi vüi dow mia chow naia thawp pe taking tasangra kown?” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw amatchi dow a-pa kowh lai sünta dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatchi kowi dow nakowngta kown mih CHAKRAMANG khowmta khai bowt.<verse eid="1SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 2:26" />Samuel dow awr iuk awr sown rürü khai, now aia kowi dow CHAKRAMANG hai maru-uüa mih sakrauah khai bowt.<verse eid="1SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eli krungchakuüa ka ripra mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 2:27" />Akat khe risi lowk ia dow Eli tut-e uang khai. Now Eli kowi tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Aigupta pren kowi <char style="w">Faraw</char> nimkrüa kowi en kowh pipu-uüa uowi khe amatni tut-e achingma ang kowtatüng pe khowk nadowi bow? <verse eid="1SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 2:28" />Israel krungchakuüa pungmadawng hownia Leviuüa kowi dow nachang uamow lup kownkow ang lang kloah khai. Amatni dow ephawd kowrmow khup hanow ang pur kowi uang reng chekhai, now amatni dow ang kowh phuchuara kowi nam iungma mih maikhük uang towk büah reng chekhai. Now Israeluüa uang pawla mih tikah mih uanap maten kowi kowh uanh hownia paw amatni krungchakuüa vüi ang pela pe khai. <verse eid="1SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 2:29" />Ang ana pek iawng ang kim kowi kowh uang changah mih tawncher hown kowh phuchua hai akeng mih phuchua dow tawngplawng kowchow enni nüah klowkah dowi? Ang kowi lak-e en chapauüa kowi en lang ringkawah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatchi kowi dow Israeluüa uang ap-ah mih hownia kowh lang iung mih uanh en peah khai,’ pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 2:30" />“Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, ‘En hai en kowh krungchakuüa dow chowngchowng saksakma ang kowh lup nachang kown mih ang rik tekta khowk chowdiah,’ pakhai. Nachenganchepaw kawmat aia tek mih, ‘Nami laikham dow nauowi kown nadowi bowt. Ringkaw ang miuüa kowi dow ang naringkawah kown, now ringkaw ang dowi miuüa kowi dow ang nasuiah kown. <verse eid="1SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 2:31" />Sünta diah, en hai en kowh krungchakuüa kowi ang nachumta kown mih khin uang ting iawlaw khowk. Nakhowk khe dow en krungchakuüa mih lawngtang pat miapaw nasing kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="1SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 2:32" />En kimchakuüa luk kowi piakra uang ting mih en nakhi kown. En krungchakuüa dow lawngtang pat miapaw nasing kown nadowi. Nachenganchepaw akeng mih Israeluüa kowi dow ang napeah iungra kown mih mik ngak hown en namüah kown. <verse eid="1SA 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 2:33" />En krungchakuüa pungmadawng hownia lowk ia kowi dow ang nape singah kown. Aia kowi dow ang nape changah uamow lup kown. Nachenganchepaw aia kowh mik dow nadu kown, now aia kowh saktuak dow nakawm kown. Now en kowh akeng mih krungchakuüa maten dow klanguüa reng tak khe saidawng rut kowi nakowng kown. <verse eid="1SA 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 2:34" />En kowh chapa Hawfni hai Finehas iüah dow ani sang nakowng kown. Nami dow ang kowh laiklow aching chekhai pami en vüi amatra naown kown. <verse eid="1SA 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 2:35" />Ang matia vüi dow kaah sakowmma mih uamow ang naruiah lowk ia kown. Aia dow ang naukrang iawng nachang lup kown. Aia krungchakuüa kowi dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi ang napeah uamow rah kown, now aia dow ang nümnapah mih mang kowi atungma nachang pe lup kown. <verse eid="1SA 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 2:36" />En krungchak hownia kowh ta sing miuüa dow nami ang kowh uamow tut-e nauang kown, now amatni dow krawng kowi tabawk krawm se nami uamow kowi nachupah kown. Now amatni dow natawi ka cha chakkham kownkow nami uamow tut-e lainowmma nalü uamow rah kown,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 2:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1SA 3" />
  <para style="s">Samuel kowi CHAKRAMANG hawah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 3:1" />Uamow Eli chang CHAKRAMANG lup mih kowi Samuel dow tawi khowngah reng chekhai. Nakhowk khe Samuel dow asowmchow reng tak chekhai. Nami khin khe dow CHAKRAMANG laiklow ta mih arama chekhai, now CHAKRAMANG hownia ka <char style="w">mukmang</char> mih paw arama chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 3:2" />Nami khin khe uamow Eli dow lawngtang lai bowt rakowi khi mik kaneu dowi bowt chekhai. Now akat khe dow iak-e aia mawk rah kowi Eli mawk khai. <verse eid="1SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 3:3" />Now Samuel dow Thurai chup kim kowi mawk khai. Nakowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla uowi chekhai. Nakhowk khe Thurai vüi kowi kowh towkla hüah mih maih dow mit dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 3:4" />Nakhowk khe mih Samuel kowi CHAKRAMANG hawah khai. Now Samuel klangah mih, “Mami re-e chaw ang uowi,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 3:5" />Now aia dow Eli tut-e alenma kowkowi hanow kowtek pe mih, “Mow, ang uang khowk chaw. En haw ang nadowi bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:5">Nakhowk khe Eli hawt tek pe mih, “Ang haw en dowi dow. Kowkowi now kowmawk phülü bowt,” pape khai. Now Samuel dow kowkowi now kowmawk phülü khai.<verse eid="1SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 3:6" />Nami kung kowi paw Samuel kowi CHAKRAMANG plan hawah khai iawk. Nakhowk khe paw Samuel dow awr rü now Eli tut-e kowkowi khai. Now Eli kowi aia kowtek pe mih, “Mow, ang uang khowk chaw. En haw ang nadowi bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:6">Nakhowk khe paw Eli hawt tek pe iawk mih, “Ang haw en dowi dow, men. Kowkowi now kowmawk phülü bowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 3:7" />Nami khin khe paw Samuel dow CHAKRAMANG kowi tuk dowi tak chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dowi rawn khe CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowi katpaw klangah dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 3:8" />Kra sangrum now Samuel kowi CHAKRAMANG plan hawah pakat khai iawk. Nakhowk khe paw Samuel dow Eli tut-e kowkowi khai iawk. Now Eli kowi kowtek pe mih, “En haw ang manow; mow ang uang khowk chaw,” pakhai. Nakhowk khe dow Samuel kowi CHAKRAMANG hawah mih chowbowt pami Eli tukta khai bowt. <verse eid="1SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 3:9" />Naiawng rakowi Eli tek pe mih, “Kowkowi now kowmawk diah. Khaleng dow haw en iawk now, ‘Tek bowt CHAKRAMANG, en kowh nar ta khowk,’ padow klangah ba,” pape khai. Now Samuel dow aia mawk rah kowi kowplan mawk khai iawk.<verse eid="1SA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 3:10" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG dow Samuel re-e uangah now uang rik hawah khe kowh iawng uang hawah mih, “Samuel, Samuel,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:10">Nakhowk khe dow Samuel klangah mih, “Tek bowt CHAKRAMANG, en kowh nar ta khowk,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 3:11" />Now Samuel kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Sünta, Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kramra uowima mih lup ang nachang lowk kown. Nami ang nachangah kown mih lup lawnguan dow ta hanow maru maten pikchu narü kown. <verse eid="1SA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 3:12" />Nami ni khe Eli krungchakuüa lawnguan kowi kowh ang tekta mih maten ang nauang pe tachiah kown. <verse eid="1SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 3:13" />Aia kowh chapauüa nü ang klowk ang dowi, now aia kowh chapauüa kowi aia paw pringah hawiah dowi. Naiawng rakowi aia krungchakuüa kowi dow chowngchowng saksakma ang naripah kown mih ang tek pe khowk chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 3:14" />Naiawng rakowi tawncher hown kowh phuchua lah, akeng mih uanap lah, tawng hown paw Eli krungchakuüa kowh angak dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi naia phum pe kown nadowi pami ang takham khowk chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 3:15" />Nami kung kowi dow Samuel mih aia mawk rah kowi uarthowi dowi mowr mawk phülü khai. Now uarthowi khe dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh kimbüng hai tawngpawk ün aia krawi uow khai. Nachenganchepaw mukmang kowi kowh laiklow dow Eli kowi aia uam tek pe dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 3:16" />Nakhowk khe Samuel kowi Eli hawah mih, “Samuel ow,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:16">Now Samuel klangah mih, “Mami re-e chaw ang uowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 3:17" />Now Eli tek pe mih, “Tawng ngai chow Thurai tek en? Tawngpaw hauang it ang diah. Aia tek en mih che en itta ang khai hanow aia dow lainowmma pacham rip en lah,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 3:18" />Nakhowk khe Samuel dow Thurai tek pe mih laiklow maten Eli kowi tekta pe bowk khai; tawngpaw it pe dowi chekhai. Nami tata hanow Eli tek mih, “Aia dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai. Aia tut-e iung iawng aia mih pacham chang lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 3:19" />Naiawng hai Samuel dow awr iuk awr sown rürü khai, now CHAKRAMANG dow aia tut-e tawi uowi pe reng chekhai. Aia tekah mih lai maten CHAKRAMANG dow uang pe tachiah khai. <verse eid="1SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 3:20" />Naiawng rakowi Samuel dow CHAKRAMANG kowh risi chekhai pami Dan krungchakuüa süng hownia Ber-Seba mowr mih Israeluüa maten achima tuk khai bowt. <verse eid="1SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 3:21" />Nami hownia bowt now Silo marow kowi CHAKRAMANG mih uang tatüng reng chekhai, now Samuel kowi aia uang klangah reng chekhai. Now Samuel tekah mih laiklow maten dow Israeluüa maten sünta pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1SA 4" />
  <para style="s">Ransu-uüa rut kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1" />Akat khe Israeluüa dow Filistinuüa kowi kowsenah kownkow kowtarü khai. Amatni dow Ebenezer pami arah kowi kowkhup tangbung khai, now Filistinuüa dow Afek pami arah kowi uang khup tangbung khai. <verse eid="1SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 4:2" />Now Israeluüa kowi nasenah kownkow Filistinuüa dow amatni kowh siphai hawmh kowi krawi towah khai. Now amatni tasen thüm khe Israel siphaiuüa dow Filistin siphaiuüa tut-e sum khai bowt. Naiawng amatni tasen mih khin khe Filistin siphai hawmh dow 4,000 ia ngia Israel siphai hawmh kowi saita pe khai. <verse eid="1SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 4:3" />Now amatni kowh tangbung khup rah kowi Israel siphaiuüa kowplan khe lawngtang aluchowuüa tek mih, “Filistinuüa rut kowi tawngplawng kowchow ani mih CHAKRAMANG tuk pe sum a-i khai? Chu, Silo marow kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla makowi a-i uang pawla lah. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG mih natawi uowila a-i kown towbowt, now ransu-uüa rut hownia aia dow nalawng a-i kown towbowt,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="1SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 4:4" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Silo marow kowi kowchin maru hanow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih kowpe pawah khai. Nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kowi dow <char style="w">Cherup</char> pre buk mih takra kowi lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG uowi reng chekhai. Amatni dow nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla hailawm uamow Eli kowh chapa Hawfni hai Finehas iüah kowi paw uang pawla büah khai.<verse eid="1SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 4:5" />Amatni kowh tangbung khup rah kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla uang tingla büah mih khin khe amatni dow amaisang kowh how mih krawng ia chü chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 4:6" />Nami how klow dow Filistinuüa tawi ta hanow talünta büah mih, “Hebraiuüa kowh tangbung khup rah kowi tawng iawng mih how klow chowbowt chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:6">Now amatni kowh tangbung khup rah kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla Israeluüa uang pawla pami tawi tuk büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 4:7" />Nami tukta büah now Filistin siphaiuüa dow lainowmma takrow khai. Amatni dow tatek mih, “Nga lai bowt kowbow! Israel siphaiuüa kowh tangbung khup rah kowi Thurai uang tawi uowi khowk pe dow. Nami dowi rawn dow naiawng katpaw phaw dowi diah kowbow. <verse eid="1SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 4:8" />Uh! Naiawng khowt kür mih thuraiuüa rut hownia mia chow nalawng a-i bowt kown? Süngrüp süngkangma kowi Israeluüa uowi khe maiow maiow makowng hawi hown Aigupta prenchakuüa kowi saiah mih dow naiawngün thuraiuüa chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 4:9" />Aw Filistinuüa, sakkraingma hown uowi büa diah. Israeluüa kowi senah büa diah. Enni paw kachakuüa ching pami tüng pe büa diah. Naiawng nadowi now Hebraiuüa chowng enni kowh nar iawng enni paw amatni kowh nar nachowng kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 4:10" />Now Filistinuüa dow Israeluüa hown dowk tasen khai bowt. Nakhowk khe Israeluüa dow sum kowh chowlowkkow kim prakowi powt büah khai. Nami tasen kowi Israel siphaiuüa dow maru iun 30,000 ia kowng khai. <verse eid="1SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 4:11" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla paw Filistin siphaiuüa pawla pe khai, now uamow Eli kowh chapa Hawfni hai Finehas iüah kowi paw ransu-uüa saila pe khai.<verse eid="1SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eli kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 4:12" />Naiawng tasen mih ni khe Benjamin krungchak hownia kowh siphai lowk ia dow tasenra hownia powt now Silo marow kowi kowkowi khai. Aia dow aia kowh tawnguat thekta nak khai, now lu kowi paw aia dow phawkla bawn khai. <verse eid="1SA 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 4:13" />Now Silo marow kowi aia kowting khe uamow Eli dow tiama ria kowi kowh chowm rah kowi hawt chowm phülü khai. Tasenra kowi cham pawla mih CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla nacham own naklak pami rakowi aia dow lainowmma tuak krat khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow nami satang ta kown nau kowh naiawng chowm phülü se hawt chawng mih chekhai. Now tasenra hownia kowh uang powt mih Benjamin krungchak maru dow marow kowi uang ting hanow tasenra kowi kowh satang maten marowchakuüa kowi uang phowng pe khai. Nami satang tata hanow marowchakuüa dow karla sawm khai.<verse eid="1SA 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 4:14" />Naiawng marowchakuüa kar sawmlawm mih klow tata hanow Eli dow maru lowk ia kowi lüntaah mih, “Matawng klow chowbowt chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:14">Nakhowk khe tasenra hownia kowh uang powt mih maru dow lenlenma kowkowiah now Eli kowi kowphowngla pe satang khai. <verse eid="1SA 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 4:15" />Nami khin khe Eli dow 98 ning khowk. Aia dow lawngtang lai bowt rakowi khi mik dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 4:16" />Tasenra hownia kowh uang powt mih maru tek pe Eli mih, “Ang dow tasenra hownia ani kowh uang powt mih siphai chowbowt,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:16">Now Eli lüntaah mih, “Chapa ow, satang plang dow tawng iawng chow?” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 4:17" />Nakhowk khe aia klangah mih, “Filistinuüa pur hownia Israeluüa powt bowk khowk. Filistinuüa rut kowi Israeluüa kowng mih nowm khowk, now en kowh chapa Hawfni hai Finehas iüah paw tawi kowng khai bowt. Nami klen kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla paw ransu-uüa pawla tüng khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 4:18" />CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla ransu-uüa pawla tüng khowk pami tata hown krowksang Eli dow aia kung prakowi awr tasia klak hanow chowm rah hownia dowh khai. Aia dow alawngtangma hai akauma rakowi chowm rah hownia dowh now klowkta ngawng khai, now aia dow hing kowng khai. Aia dow 40 ning mowr Israeluüa kowi chet pe tara khai.<verse eid="1SA 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Finehas kowh masi kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 4:19" />Nami khin khe Eli kowh chapa Finehas kowh masi dow kimuowi khin tawn iawlaw khowk chekhai. Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla ransu-uüa pawla mih satang hai atarang hai ahua kowng mih satang tata now aia kowh dow kimuowi mu rau awr tarowng hanow uowi kim khai bowt.<verse eid="1SA 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 4:20" />Now naiawng aia uowi kim mih taklen kung kowi kowng ngialia khe pen sarauüa tek pe mih, “Hangkow kram, kachakuüa chah lowmow en ka,” pape khai. Nachenganchepaw aia dow pen sarauüa kowi klangah dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 4:21" />Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla ransu-uüa rut kowi cham uowi mih rakowi hai atarang hai ahua kowng khai rakowi aia tek mih, “Israeluüa kowh kraingra dow cham powt khai bowt,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow achapa ming Ikabawd<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ikabawd </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami auan dow kraingra uowi dowi bowt pami chekhai.</char></note> padow rük pe khai. <verse eid="1SA 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 4:22" />Aia tek mih, “Israeluüa kowh kraingra dow cham powt khai bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla dow ransu-uüa rut kowi cham uowi khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Filistinuüa tut-e CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 5:1" />Filistinuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih Ebenezer marow hownia Asdawd marow kowi kowpawla büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 5:2" />Now nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla dow amatni kowh Dagawn thurai kim kowi kowpawla khai, now Dagawn thurai rup ria kowi towah büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 5:3" />Now auai rau murpa awr rü hanow Asdawd marowchakuüa mih amatni kowh thurai kim kowi kowkowi büah khai. Nakhowk khe amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla pur kowi krawng kowi tabawk krawm se Dagawn thurai rup takuak hüah mih kowkhi büah khai. Now amatni dow nami Dagawn thurai rup kowi aia kowh aiawng uowi rah kowi plan towah khai iawk. <verse eid="1SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 5:4" />Now auai rau paw murpa awr rü hanow amatni kowh Dagawn thurai kim kowi kowkowi büah khai iawk. Nami leng paw CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla pur kowi krawng kowi tabawk krawm se Dagawn thurai rup takuak hüah mih kowplan khi büah khai iawk. Nachenganchepaw nami leng dow Dagawn thurai rup kowh lu hai bawng pre pra trui taklek kowh kimplawt mawm re-e takuak hüah khai; abuk krowngchow towbowt ta uowi khai. <verse eid="1SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 5:5" />Naiawng rakowi Dagawn thurai kowh uamow hai marowchakuüa dow kawmat pat paw Dagawn thurai kim kowi kowkowi now kimplawt mawm re-e kowuam chawp büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 5:6" />Asdawd marow hai aria aret kowi kowh uowi mih maru-uüa maten kowi CHAKRAMANG dow lainowmma ripah khai. Amatni kowi dow thuaik rawka hown aia towkah ngare khai. <verse eid="1SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 5:7" />Naiawng phaw mih khi büah hanow Asdawd marowchakuüa tek mih, “Israeluüa kowh Thurai dow a-i hai a-i kowh Dagawn thurai kowi rip a-i khai. Naiawng rakowi kowbüah kowh Thurai sangbowk laitawm tawkpla dow a-i tut-e hangkow tow tham bowt,” pabüah khai. <verse eid="1SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 5:8" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow krawi chin maru hanow Filistinuüa kowh kruitown miuüa maten kowi arasang kuaah lawmah khai. Now lüntaah büah mih, “Israeluüa kowh Thurai sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kowi tawng chow anging changah kown?” pabüah khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 5:8">Kruitown miuüa tek pe mih, “Israeluüa kowh Thurai sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih Gat marow kowi pacham pawla lah,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi Asdawd marowchakuüa dow Israeluüa kowh Thurai sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih Gat marow kowi kowpawla khai bowt.<verse eid="1SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 5:9" />Nachenganchepaw nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih Gat marow kowi kowpawla kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG mih nami marowchakuüa kowi paw lainowmma ripah khai. Amatni kowi dow lainowmma aia peah takrow takraira khai. Nami marow kowi kowh aiuk asowm bowkbowk maru kowi mih thuaik rawka aia pe phawah khai. <verse eid="1SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 5:10" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow nami Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih Ekrawn marow kowi kowpawla khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 5:10">Nachenganchepaw Ekrawn marow kowi nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kowting khe marowchakuüa dow atün atünma tek mih, “Nape kowng a-i kownkow Israeluüa kowh Thurai sangbowk laitawm tawkpla a-i tut-e kowbüah uang pawla iawk mih chowbowt,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="1SA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 5:11" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow krawi chin maru hanow Filistinuüa kowh kruitown miuüa maten kowi arasang kuaah lawmah büah khai. Now tek pe büah mih, “Israeluüa kowh Thurai sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih mami marow hownia cham pawla büa diah. Nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla dow aia uowi rah kowi pacham uowi phülü lah. Nadowi now nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih nakowngta anging bowk kown chekhai,” pabüah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Thurai mih nami marowchakuüa kowi paw lainowmma ripah khai. Naiawng rakowi marowchakuüa paw kowng sangrum khowk chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 5:12" />Tawi kowng dowi miuüa kowh paw thuaik rawka tawi phaw bowk chekhai. Naiawng rakowi marowchakuüa kowh kar klow dow kuang prakowi chai lawmlawm khai.<verse eid="1SA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1SA 6" />
  <para style="s">Filistinuüa uang plan sata sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 6:1" />CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla dow ranit la mowr Filistinuüa pren kowi uowi khai. <verse eid="1SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 6:2" />Akung kowi Filistinuüa mih uamowuüa hai hawra sarauüa kowi hawah khai. Now lüntaah büah mih, “CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla hown tawng chow anging changla kown? Sam tek anging madiah, mami kowi aia uowi rah kowi anging nasaah kown mih tawng chow anging napawla pe kown?” pabüah khai.<verse eid="1SA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 6:3" />Nakhowk khe uamowuüa hai hawra sarauüa tek pe mih, “Enni che Israeluüa kowh Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla nasata kown now akhawma hangkow sa büah. Enni kowh aprek sung uanap vüi kowi enni nakrawi sa pe uanh ngengche kown takla. Nahanow enni kowh rawka paw naiung kown towbowt, now tawng rakowi chow aia rip enni rengreng mih paw enni natuk kown towbowt,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="1SA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 6:4" />Nakhowk khe Filistinuüa lüntaah mih, “Aprek sung uanap vüi tawng chow anging nakrawi sa pe kown?” pabüah khai. Now uamowuüa hai hawra sarauüa tek pe mih, “Filistinuüa kowh kruitown mih enni uowi tanga ia chedow kuh hown kowh thawpah mih thuaik rup tanga klüng, now kuh hown kowh thawpah mih utmow rup tanga klüng krawi sa pe büah bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni hai enni kowh kruitown miuüa luk kowi kowh thuaik uang phaw mih dow katsang chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 6:5" />Naiawng rakowi enni buk kowi kowh phaw mih thuaik rup hai piak enni pren mih utmow rup thawpah büa diah, now Israeluüa kowh Thurai kowi rowsiah büa diah. Nahanow enni hai enni kowh thuraiuüa hown enni kowh pren luk kowi aia uang pawla mih ripra dow aia nahenta enni chepaw naia kown. <verse eid="1SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 6:6" />Tawngplawng kowchow Faraw hai Aigupta maru-uüa iawng saktuak akhawtma enni lang changah rereng? Amatni kowi Israeluüa kowh Thurai ripah khowk khe amatni mih Israeluüa kowi alawt nadowi bow takla?<verse eid="1SA 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 6:7" />“Kawmat mih thawp kari sar büah lowk diah. Now achah kham iawn reng tak mih chiama cham paw büah pre pum diah. Nami chiama dow katpaw thawnla laih dowi tak mih naown kown takla. Nami chiama pre pum mih kowi dow pe küngah kari büa diah. Tawkche achah kowi dow chia rum kowi takhuowkla büa diah. <verse eid="1SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 6:8" />Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih nami kari luk kowi towah büa diah. Now aprek sung uanap vüi kowi kowh enni krawi sa pe mih kuh uanh dow thawp pe atowk rah tawkpla lowk hanow nami kowi towah büa diah. Now nami kuh uanh towk rah tawkpla dow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla re-e towah diah. Naiawng hai nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla dow enni nasaah kown. <verse eid="1SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 6:9" />Tawkchedow pela pe ching büah kaneu. Sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küng mih chia che amatni pren kowi kowh Bet-Semes marow prakowi mang khai hanow a-i luk kowi kowh uang kla mih kramra uowima mih hawi dow CHAKRAMANG uang pawla a-i mih chekhai pami tukah büa diah. Nachenganchepaw nami chia che Bet-Semes marow prakowi mang dowi hanow a-i luk kowi kowh uang ting mih hawi dow akeng hownia kowh taih; CHAKRAMANG hownia kowh nadowi pami a-i natukah kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bet-Semes marow kowi sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kowting mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 6:10" />Naiawng rakowi Filistinuüa dow uamowuüa hai hawra sarauüa tek iawng rowprowp chang büah khai bowt. Amatni dow uang pawla chiama pre pum hanow khuowk pe kari khai, now chia chah kowi dow chia rum kowi ta towla büah hüah khai. <verse eid="1SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 6:11" />Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih nami kari luk kowi towah büah khai bowt, now nami ria kowi dow kuh hown kowh thawpah mih thuaik rup hai kuh hown kowh thawpah mih utmow rup towk rah tawkpla tow pe büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 6:12" />Nakhowk khe nami chiama pre pum mih dow hawmlawm lakuai prakowi cham tapleng dowi kowi pula bawlaw se Bet-Semes pra kowh tiama rowkrowk mang khai. Now Filistinuüa kowh kruitown miuüa dow nami kari kung kowi Bet-Semes rihi mowr krawi ta mang khai.<verse eid="1SA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 6:13" />Nami khin khe Bet-Semes marowchakuüa dow <char style="w">lawngrawi</char> kowi hawt ngen püm thüm chekhai. Amatni dow haitang mü pache haikhita sangbowk laitawm tawkpla büah khai, now lainowmma piaw büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 6:14" />Bet-Semes süng kowi uang ting hanow nami kari dow Josua pami maru lowk ia kowh laih kowi kowh huaklu aiukma mih re-e uang tanai khai. Now Israeluüa dow thawpla kari mih singh nachangla phuchua müa sawp kownkow pawah büah khai, now chiama pre pum trui dow CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap changla büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 6:15" />Nami dowi rawn khe Leviuüa mih CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla hai towla kuh uanh mih tawkpla klaah now huaklu aiukma mih luk kowi towah khai. Nami ni khe Bet-Semes marowchakuüa dow CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap hai akeng mih uanap chang büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 6:16" />Now Filistinuüa kowh kruitown mih tanga ia dow Israeluüa chang mih srui müla now nami ni khe Ekrawn marow kowi kutplan mang büah khai.<verse eid="1SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 6:17" />Filistinuüa mih nachangla aprek lawt müa uanap kownkow CHAKRAMANG vüi kuh hown kowh thuaik rup krawi sa pe tanga klüng khai. Naiawngün thuaik rup krawi sa mih dow Asdawd, Gaza, Askelawn, Gat hai Ekrawn marow kowi kowh aluchowuüa chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 6:18" />Now Filistinuüa kowh kruitown mih tanga ia kowh tap uowi mih marow tanga klüng hai naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh tap uowi dowi mih kua maten takcha kowi Filistinuüa mih kuh hown kowh thawpah mih utmow rup krawi sa pe khai. Bet-Semes marow kowi kowh Josua laih kowi huaklu aiukma mih uowi lowk. CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla uang plan khe kari hownia klaah now towah mih dow nami huaklu luk kowi chekhai. Nami huaklu dow kawmat pat nakowi uowi reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiriat-Jearim kowi pawla sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 6:19" />Tawkche Bet-Semes marowchakuüa mih CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla lak kowi kowruata khai rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih amatni kowi saiah khai. Nakhowk khe nakowi kowh maru-uüa kowi dow bowkbowk kowi 50,070 ia mowr CHAKRAMANG saita khai. Naiawng CHAKRAMANG saiah khai rakowi maru kawmuüa dow lainowmma kar büah nguk büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 6:20" />Amatni dow tatek mih, “Naiawng khowt chimsai mih CHAKRAMANG Thurai pur kowi mia chow nakham kown chow? Mami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kowi kawmat dow mami hownia mia tut-e chow a-i cham saah bowt kown?” pabüah khai.<verse eid="1SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 6:21" />Nami kung kowi dow amatni mih Kiriat-Jearim marowchakuüa kowi maiawng nakowtek pe kownkow kowchin maru pre sum ia khai, “CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih Filistinuüa uang sata khowk. Uangah büah now mami CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih uang pawta büah bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1SA 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 7:1" />Naiawng rakowi Kiriat-Jearim marowchakuüa dow Bet-Semes marow kowi uangah now CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih pawla khai bowt. Amatni dow hungh luk kowi kowh amatni kowh marow kowi Abinadab kim kowi nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih towah büah khai. Now nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla naming nakhetla kownkow amatni dow Abinadab kowh chapa Eleazar kowi mih CHAKRAMANG vüi lang kraah büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 7:2" />Kiriat-Jearim marow kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla uowi mih dow pirmi ning khowk chekhai. Nami khin khe Israeluüa dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e nauang plan iawk kown mih lainowmma prüa khai.<verse eid="1SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samuel kruitownra hownia Israeluüa awng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 7:3" />Pakat khe Israeluüa maten kowi Samuel tek pe mih, “Enni che saktuak maiow hown CHAKRAMANG tut-e uang plan kown nau khai hanow enni pungmadawng kowi akeng chenchapuüa kowh thuraiuüa rup maten hai Astarte thurai rup maten kuakta bowk büa diah, now saktuak lowkchow hown CHAKRAMANG kowi phai chupiia büa diah. Nahanow aia mih Filistinuüa rut hownia nalawng enni kown taih,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 7:4" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Israeluüa mih amatni kowh Baal thurai rup hai Astarte thurai rup maten cham kuakta büah bowk khai, now amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowi chowtaih chupiia büah khai.<verse eid="1SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 7:5" />Nakhowk khe Samuel tek pe mih, “Israeluüa maten kowi Mizpa marow kowi kuaah lawmah diah. Nakowi dow enni vüi ang nachup enni Thurai kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 7:6" />Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa maten dow Mizpa marow kowi takua talawm khai. Nami ni khe amatni dow towng tui hanow uanap iawng hai CHAKRAMANG pur kowi khükah büah khai, now <char style="w">khang hawm</char> büah khai. Amatni dow tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG kowi kingküala mih angak anging changta khai,” pabüah khai. Samuel dow Mizpa marow kowi uowiah now Israeluüa kowi chet pe tara khai.<verse eid="1SA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 7:7" />Now Mizpa marow kowi Israeluüa takua talawm mih satang dow Filistinuüa tawi ta khai. Nami laiklow tata hanow Filistinuüa dow Israeluüa kowi nakowsenah kownkow Mizpa marow prakowi tarü büah khai. Filistinuüa uang senah kown pami satang Israeluüa ta hanow lainowmma kram büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 7:8" />Nakhowk khe Israeluüa tek pe Samuel mih, “Filistinuüa rut hownia CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai mih nalawng a-i kownkow en mih kar se amowt uowi dowi kowi chup a-i Thurai diah,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="1SA 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 7:9" />Nakhowk khe Samuel dow kham iawn reng tak mih ruapur chah cham paw pe apum khai, now nami ruapur chah papum mih hown aia dow CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap changla khai. Aia dow Israeluüa vüi kowi CHAKRAMANG tut-e kar se awr lü khowng khai, now CHAKRAMANG paw aia awr lü mih uang klangah khai. <verse eid="1SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 7:10" />CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap Samuel chang thüm khe Israeluüa kowi nauang senah kownkow Filistinuüa dow uang towm khai bowt. Nachenganchepaw nami ni dow kaikreng tün iawng kramra uowima mih tün Filistinuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG chang pe khai. Nahanow Filistinuüa dow kram kowh taset plawt khai. Naiawng rakowi nami ni dow Israeluüa rut kowi sum büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 7:11" />Nakhowk khe Israeluüa mih Filistinuüa kowi saila se Mizpa marow hownia Bet-kar kua re-e kowh rep mowr kawikrawiah khai.<verse eid="1SA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 7:12" />Nami khin khe Samuel dow cham paw pe hua lowk hanow Mizpa marow hai Sen pami arah takra kowi chowkah khai. Nakhowk khe Samuel tek mih, “Kawmat mowr dow CHAKRAMANG khowng anging reng tak chekhai,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow nami hua ming mih Ebenezer (Nami auan dow “Khowng mih hua” pami chekhai) pahai chap pe khai.<verse eid="1SA 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 7:13" />Naiawng hai Filistinuüa dow Israeluüa tut-e khamsum khai bowt. Nami hownia bowt now amatni dow Israeluüa kowh sünghi lak kowi kowkup dowi chekhai. Samuel sing uowi mowr dow CHAKRAMANG mih Filistinuüa kowi kingküaah reng chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 7:14" />Ekrawn marow hownia Gat marow mowr kowi kowh Israeluüa kowh marow hai kua maten Filistinuüa powngta pe mih dow Israeluüa mih plan kata khai iawk. Israeluüa dow naiawngün marow hai kua riaret kowi kowh arah maten paw Filistinuüa rut hownia krawi plan kata khai iawk. Nami khin khe Filistin pren kowi kowh tawi uowi mih Amawruüa hown Israeluüa dow thawp taking tasangra khai.<verse eid="1SA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh tara chet mih Samuel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 7:15" />Now Samuel dow aia sing uowi mowr mih Israeluüa kowi chet pe tara khai. <verse eid="1SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 7:16" />Aia dow ning towng Bethel, Gilgal hai Mizpa marow kowi krawi kowiah now Israeluüa kowi krawi chet pe tara khai. <verse eid="1SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 7:17" />Nami kung kowi dow Rama marow kowi kowh aia kim kowi aia uang plan reng chekhai. Aia dow nakowi paw Israeluüa kowi chet pe tara reng chekhai. Aia dow nakowi mih CHAKRAMANG vüi thawp pe phuchuara lowk chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa lü mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1" />Samuel lawngtang khowk khe aia dow Israeluüa kowh tara chet mih arah achapa pre ia kowi peah khai. <verse eid="1SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2" />Achapa ta mih ming dow Joel, now asawi mih ming dow Abija chekhai. Amatchi dow Ber-Seba marow kowi Israeluüa kowi chet pe tara reng chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3" />Nachenganchepaw amatchi dow amatchi kowh pa iawng chang dowi chekhai. Amatchi dow tangka pawisa prakowi lainowmma lawpha khai. Amatchi dow cha büm hanow anowm kowi paw anowm nadowi iawng changah khai, now anowm nadowi mih kowi paw anowmma iawng changah iüah khai.<verse eid="1SA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4-5" />Naiawng rakowi Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa dow Rama marow kowi takua talawm hanow Samuel kowi tek pe mih, “Sünta diah, en dow lawngtang khai bowt, now en chapa pre ia paw en tiama kowi mang dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi akeng chenchapuüa iawng dow nakruitownla anging kownkow en mih klo anging mang lowk ia diah,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="1SA 8:4-5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6" />Nachenganchepaw Samuel dow naiawng amatni uang lü mang mih sak-ih dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow nami lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr phowk pe khai. <verse eid="1SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Samuel mih, “Maru-uüa tek en iawng chang diah. Amatni dow en kowi kowh nuata en mih nadowi; amatni dow amatni kowh mang iawng ang uowi mih nau büah dowi rakowi nuata ang mih chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 8:8" />Aigupta pren hownia ang uang lawtla mih ni hownia kawmat mowr amatni dow nuata ang hanow akeng thuraiuüa kowi cham chupiia büah khai. Amatni dow ang kowi kowh chang ang iawng en kowi paw chang en mih chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 8:9" />Naiawng rakowi en mih amatni tek iawng chang diah. Tawkchedow amatni luk kowi nauang chowm mang kown mih maru amatni kowi tawng iawng chow nachangah kown mih lawnguan paw tekla pe kaneu diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 8:10" />Now Samuel dow aia tut-e kowh uang awn mang miuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih laiklow maten tek pe khai. <verse eid="1SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 8:11" />Aia tek pe mih, “Enni luk kowi kowh nauang chowm mang kown mih maru dow enni kowh chapauüa kowi kür hown nape changah siphai lup kown: Tawngbak mih kowi dow kawrnga kari te mih lup nape changah kown, tawngbak mih kowi dow kawrnga luk kowi chowm mih siphai lup nape changah kown, now tawngbak mih kowi dow aia kowh kawrnga kari maten pur kowi narik pe iowmah kown mih lup aia nape changah kown. <verse eid="1SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 8:12" />Tawngbak mih kowi dow aiamat vüi 1,000 ia luk kowi kowh siphai aluchow nathawpah kown, now tawngbak mih kowi dow 50 ia luk kowi kowh siphai aluchow nathawpah kown. Tawngbak miuüa kowi dow aia kowh laih lup aia nape changah kown, now tawngbak miuüa kowi dow aia kowh luprak aia nape kuaah kown. Tawngbak miuüa kowi dow tasen müa rutchün khawkleng aia nape thawpah kown, now tawngbak miuüa kowi dow kawrnga kari uanh aia nape thawpah kown. <verse eid="1SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 8:13" />Now enni kowh chamauüa kowi dow paingbawng thawp mih ün, chakkham eng mih ün, kawm thawp mih ün aia nachangla kown. <verse eid="1SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 8:14" />Aia dow enni kowh krawng bawn lang iung mih, grep krum hai kanrawn khang ün napawta enni hanow aia kowh maru iukuüa kowi napeah kown. <verse eid="1SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 8:15" />Enni kowh luprak hai grep uih hownia hamüt bak kowi pabak aia napawta enni kown, now naiawngün dow aia kowh maru iukuüa kowi hai akeng mih lup chang miuüa kowi aia napeah kown. <verse eid="1SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 8:16" />Aia dow enni kowh narma narla, enni kowh klanguüa anang uowima miuüa kowi hai enni kowh tawncher lang iung mih ün napawta enni hanow aia kowh lup chang müa kowi aia natawngah kown. <verse eid="1SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 8:17" />Nami klen kowi enni kowh ruapur hawmh hownia hamüt pum kowi papum mih aia napawta enni kown, now enni dow aia kowh nar nachowng kown. <verse eid="1SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 8:18" />Nami ni dow enni lüah mih mang kowh lup rakowi enni nakar kown. Nachenganchepaw nakhowk khe dow enni haw CHAKRAMANG chepaw aia mih naklang enni kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 8:19" />Nachenganchepaw maru kawmuüa dow Samuel kowh naiawngün laiklow sünta kown nau dowi chekhai. Amatni dow tek mih, “Naiawng chepaw iung taih; anging nau mang lowk ia. <verse eid="1SA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 8:20" />Nahanow a-i paw akeng chenchapuüa iawng natawi own kown towbowt. A-i kowh mang mih nachet a-i tara kown towbowt, now cham tasen khe paw aia dow a-i dowi rawn narik mang kown towbowt,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="1SA 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 8:21" />Maru kawmuüa kowh naiawngün laiklow dow Samuel mih sünta pe bowk khai, now nami laiklow dow CHAKRAMANG kowi aia awr plan phowk pe khai. <verse eid="1SA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 8:22" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Samuel mih, “Maru kawmuüa tek en mih sünta pe diah, now amatni vüi kowi rui pe mang lowk ia diah,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 8:22">Nakhowk khe Israeluüa kowi Samuel tek pe mih, “Enni matia chowlowkkow kim kowi mang büa diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1SA 9" />
  <para style="s">Sawl hai anar iüah krawi cham kawrngaramchükma mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 9:1" />Benjamin krungchak kowi kurengma panow ringkawra uowima mih maru uowi lowk ia. Nami maru ming dow Kis chekhai. Kis dow Abiel kowh chapa, Abiel dow Zerawr kowh chapa, Zerawr dow Bekawrat kowh chapa, now Bekawrat dow Aphiah kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 9:2" />Kis kowh dow Sawl pami chapa uowi lowk ia. Sawl dow klanguüa klangiungma chekhai. Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi dow aia iawng klangiung mih miapaw uowi dowi chekhai, now aia dow maru maten lak-e paw lang kro chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 9:3" />Akat khe Sawl pa Kis kowh mih kawrngaramchükma cham tama khai ne. Naiawng rakowi achapa Sawl kowi Kis tek pe mih, “Hawla nar lowk ia now a-i kowh kawrngaramchükma tama ne mih kowkrawi cham a-i dit snow,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 9:4" />Now Sawl dow hawla nar lowk ia hanow krawi cham kawrngaramchükma kownkow cham tarü khai bowt. Amatchi dow Efraimuüa kowh hungma mawngma süng hai Salisa süng iawng kowkowi iüah khai. Nachenganchepaw amatchi dow kawrngaramchükma hawmh kowi kowkrawi krum iüah dowi chekhai. Nami kung kowi amatchi dow Salim pami süng kowi kowkowi iüah khai. Nachenganchepaw nakowi paw kawrngaramchükma hawmh kowi kowkrawi krum iüah dowi chekhai. Nami kung kowi dow Benjamin krungchakuüa kowh süng kowi kowkowi iüah khai, now nakowi paw kowkrawi krum iüah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 9:5" />Now achur prakowi dow Zuf pami süng kowi kowkowi iüah khai. Nakhowk khe aia hawla mih nar kowi Sawl tek pe mih, “Chu, achi plan lah. Nadowi now kawrngaramchükma hawmh rakowi tuak krat mih lak-e achi rakowi apa nalang tuak krat kown chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 9:6" />Nachenganchepaw aia kowh nar tek pe mih, “Sünta, mami marow kowi Thurai maru uowi lowk ia. Aia kowi dow maru maten ringkawah reng chekhai, now aia tek iawng phaw paw phaw reng chekhai. Chu, aia tut-e achi kowsam kowi madiah sik. Tawng prakowi chow achi kowkowi e nakrum kown mih aia nowng tek achi tarawng,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 9:7" />Nakhowk khe aia kowh nar kowi Sawl tek pe mih, “Nakowi che achi kowkowi now tawng chow achi nakowpawla pe kown? Achi pawla mih chakkham paw achi khowkta bowk khowk. Thurai maru kowi achi napeah kown mih tawngpaw uowi dowi kowbow. Achi kowh tawng chow uowi tak?” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 9:8" />Now aia kowh nar klangah mih, “Mow, ang tut-e tai uowi paiun chaw. Thurai maru kowi mami tai achi peah towbowt, now tawng pra chow kowi e achi nakrum kown mih aia natek achi kown taih,” pape khai. <verse eid="1SA 9:8" /><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="1SA 9:9-10" />Nakhowk khe Sawl klangah mih, “Lainowmma iung; chu, achi kowkowi bowt lah,” pakhai. Nami tekta hanow amatchi dow Thurai maru uowi rah marow kowi kowkowi khai. (Achük alai khe dow lowra sia Thurai maru tut-e kowlünta kown now Israeluüa tatek mih, “Chu, khi mukmang mih tut-e a-i kowkowi lah,” pakhai. Kawmat kowh chowng kowi tek pe risi miuüa kowi alai kowh chowng khe dow, “Khi mukmang mih,” pahai tek pe büah khai).<verse eid="1SA 9:9-10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samuel hai Sawl iüah takrum mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 9:11" />Now marow pra kowh tiama pangchowng kowi awr klown iüah khe masiuüa pre sum ia hown takrum iüah khai. Naiawngün masiuüa hawmh dow cham towng tui kownkow marow hownia uang lawt mih chekhai. Naiawngün masiuüa hawmh kowi lüntaah iüah mih, “Khi mukmang mih maru mami marow kowi uowi bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 9:12" />Nakhowk khe nami masiuüa hawmh klangah mih, “Ow, uowi manow; Han lenchow haimang iüah bowt. Ani mih paimi hungh kowi kowh Thurai chupra kowi marowchakuüa tawncher hown nachang phuchua kown. Naiawng rakowi ani tak anging kowh marow kowi aia uang. <verse eid="1SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 9:13" />Marow kowi enchi kowkup now aia kowi dow enchi nakhi kown towbowt. Aia dow nakowcha pawi kownkow hungh luk kowi nakowpün kown. Aia kowpün dowi mowr dow maru-uüa mih tawngpaw nacha nakham kown nadowi tak. Tawngplawng kowchow panow changla phuchua mih uanh kowi aia nape prasi kown takla chekhai. Aia ki peta prasi khü che pinsüauüa nacha nakham iang. Kawmat awr mang iüah bowt, nahanow aia kowi kawmat enchi kowkrum kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 9:14" />Nami laiklow tata now amatchi dow marow prakowi awr pün iüah khai bowt. Marow kowi kowting iüah khe Thurai chupra hungh prakowi tarü kownkow amatchi prakowi Samuel uaimang mih khita iüah khai.<verse eid="1SA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 9:15" />Sawl uang mih ni dowi rawn kowh ni khe CHAKRAMANG dow Samuel kowi Sawl nauang kown mih laiklow rik tek pe khai. <verse eid="1SA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 9:16" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Samuel mih, “Tharau kowh maiawng khin khe Benjamin krungchakuüa süng hownia ang nauang chin en maru lowk ia kown. Aia kowi dow Israeluüa kowh aluchow nachowng kownkow en hawt nümnapah diah. Filistinuüa rut hownia aia mih Israeluüa kowi nalawngah kown. Ang maru-uüa kowh kar klow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi ang maru-uüa prakowi ang pela ching mih chowbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 9:17" />Now Samuel khita Sawl hown krowksang Samuel kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Nami chowbowt nih ang tek en mih maru. Ang maru-uüa kowi nakruitown kown mih maru nami chowbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 9:18" />Now Sawl dow marow <char style="w">tapplawt</char> re-e Samuel tut-e kowkowiah now lüntaah mih, “Khi mukmang mih maru kowh kim tawng re-e chow? Sakrauma hown tek ang dit snow,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 9:19" />Nakhowk khe Samuel klangah mih, “Ang chowbowt khi mukmang mih maru. Ani dow ang hown enchi natawi cha natawi kham kown. Naiawng rakowi ang dowi rawn Thurai chupra hungh kowi kowrik pün iüa diah. En sak lak kowi kowh tawng chow uowi mih tharau khe ang tek en sow, now tharau khe ang pe mang en sow. <verse eid="1SA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 9:20" />Sum ni dowi rawn khe kowh tama mih kawrngaramchükma hawmh rakowi hangkow tuak krat tham bowt. Naiawngün kawrngaramchükma hawmh dow kata khowk. Israel pren kowi kowh uanh iung maten amia vüi chow? Naiawngün aiungma mih maten en hai en pa krungchakuüa vüi nadowi bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 9:21" />Sawl klangah mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow ang kowi chekhai naiawng en tek ang? Ang dow Benjamin krungchak taih. Benjamin krungchak dow Israel chenchap maten kowi kowh lang sowm mih nadowi bow? Nami klen kowi Benjamin krungchak kowi khowm padow ang kowh machak dow kaah aklowk dowi mih chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 9:22" />Nami kung kowi Samuel dow Sawl hai aia kowh nar kowi pawla now hawm chakra kim kowi kowkowi khai. Now pinsüa 30 ia kowi kowh ringkawra lang uowi mih chowm rah kowi Sawl iüah kowi aia pe chowmah khai. <verse eid="1SA 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 9:23" />Hawm kan eng mih kowi Samuel tek pe mih, “Ang cham lang pe tow en mih chaknga uang pawla madiah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 9:24" />Nahanow nami maru dow athung nga uang pawla now Sawl pur kowi uang towah khai. Now Sawl kowi Samuel tek pe mih, “Mami chaknga en vüi kowi kowh tow en mih chowbowt; cha diah. Ani mih makowi en nauang tawi cha tawi kham kown pami ang tuk chekhai. Naiawng rakowi krawi lai hawm chak thüm khe mami chaknga en vüi nalang towta kownkow ang tek pe khai,” pakhai. Nami ni khe Sawl dow Samuel hown tawi taiua cha hawm kan khai.<verse eid="1SA 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 9:25" />Ki cha ki kham kung kowi dow amatni mih Thurai chupra hungh hownia marow kowi uang plan khai bowt. Nami kung kowi dow Samuel mih aia kimluk kowi Sawl vüi kamrüt pe mawk rah khai. <verse eid="1SA 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 9:26" />Now auai rau khe dow murpa Samuel awr rü hanow Sawl kowi tek pe mih, “Rü now kamrüt bowt; ang tawi sa en khai,” pakhai. Now Sawl hai Samuel iüah dow kamrüt hanow kim hownia lawt iüah khai bowt. <verse eid="1SA 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 9:27" />Marow plawt re-e kowting kown chowbowt khe Sawl kowi Samuel tek pe mih, “En kowh nar kowi rik pe mangah diah, now en dow mami re-e ta iowng nawng diah. Tawng ngai chow Thurai tek mih ang natek en kown,” pape khai. Nahanow Sawl kowh nar dow rik mang khai bowt.<verse eid="1SA 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10" />
  <para style="s">Sawl kowi nümnapah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 10:1" />Nami kung kowi dow Samuel mih sau palang pawah hanow Sawl kowh lu kowi klai pe sau khai. Aia dow Sawl kowi nam pe awm hanow tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG mih aia maru-uüa luk kowi nape chowng en aluchow kownkow <char style="w">nümnap</char> en mih chowbowt. <verse eid="1SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 10:2" />Ani mih ang pur hownia en powt hanow Benjaminuüa kowh sünghi kowi en kowting khe Zelza pami arah kowi Rahel kowh tadupra re-e maru pre ia hown en natakrum kown. Amatchi dow natek en kown mih, ‘En krawi chamah mih kawrngaramchükma hawmh kowi kata khowk. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow kawrngaramchükma hawmh rakowi tuak krat mih towta now en pa mih en rakowi tuak krat thüm khowk. En pa tek mih: Ang chapa rakowi tawng chow ang nachang kown?’ pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 10:3" />“Nami kung kowi dow nami hownia en namang iawk hanow Tabawr süng kowi kowh singh chimsaima mih re-e en kowting khe en nakrum maru sum ia kown. Amatni dow nacham chup Thurai kownkow Bethel marow kowi kowkowi mih chekhai. Amatni pungmadawng kowi lowk ia mih tut-e dow rua chah nauowi sum pum kown, lowk ia mih tut-e dow aiukma mih kawm nauowi sum buk kown, now alowk mih tut-e dow grep tui nauowi pakawng kown. <verse eid="1SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 10:4" />Amatni dow nahawt howr en kown, now nape en kawm pre pah kown. Now nami kawmpah dow amatni rut hownia en napaw pe kown.<verse eid="1SA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 10:5" />“Nami kung kowi dow Gibeah marow kowi kowh Thurai chupra hungh kowi en nakowkowi kown. Nami marow kowi dow Filistin siphaiuüa kowh tangbung khupra uowi lowk chekhai. Now tekla Thurai lai se Thurai chupra hungh hownia uang iu dowm mih risiuüa kowi en nakrum pathum kown. Nami risiuüa pur kowi dow tepla tingteng, sawkchow, taraw hai tumla prui se maru narik mang ne kown. <verse eid="1SA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowh lümla dow nakruitown en kown. Nahanow en paw nami risiuüa hown natawi tek Thurai lai kown. Nakhowk khe dow maru sar iawng en nachowng kown. <verse eid="1SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 10:7" />Naiawngün ang tek en mih matra maten uang tachi khe dow achang takla mih iawng en nachang kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Thurai dow en tut-e natawi uowi kown.<verse eid="1SA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 10:8" />“Ang dowi rawn Gilgal kowi kowrik kowi diah. Tikah mih uanap hai taking tasangra uanap nachang kownkow en tut-e ang nauang kown taih. Ang uang towm dowi mowr nakowi ranit ni mowr en nahawt chawng ang kown takla. Tawng chow en nachang kown mih dow nakowi ang uang ting khe ang natek en kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawl chowng mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 10:9" />Now Samuel hownia napowt bowt kownkow Sawl haitaplan khe dow Sawl kowi Thurai peah saktuak sar khai. Sawl kowi kowh Samuel tek pe mih amatra laiklow maten dow nami ni khe uang tachi khai. <verse eid="1SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 10:10" />Sawl hai aia kowh nar mih Gibeah marow kowi kowting khe amatchi dow risi pathum kowi kowkrum iüah khai. Nakhowk khe Thurai kowh lümla dow Sawl kowi kruitownah khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi Sawl dow naiawngün risiuüa hown tawi tek Thurai lai khai. <verse eid="1SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 10:11" />Sawl tawi tek Thurai lai mih khita hanow Sawl kowi tuk mat miuüa dow maiawng tatek khai, “Kis kowh chapa Sawl tawng chow own? Sawl paw risi chekhai bow?” pabüah khai.<verse eid="1SA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 10:12" />Nakhowk khe nami re-e kowh maru-uüa pungmadawng hownia maru lowk ia tek mih, “Naiawng now pai iawngün risiuüa kowh pa mia chekhai chow? Tawngplawng kowchow Sawl paw nowng phaw risi dowi kown?” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi, “Saul paw risi chekhai bow?” pami dow lai lawt uang chowng lowk chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 10:13" />Thurai pe tekah mih lai ki tekla now Sawl dow Thurai chupra hungh kowi kowpün khai.<verse eid="1SA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 10:14" />Now Sawl hai anar kowi Sawl kowh pahi lüntaah mih, “Tawng hownia chow enchi uang mang?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:14">Nakhowk khe Sawl klangah mih, “Angching cham krawi cham kawrngaramchükma hawmh chowdiah. Tawng kowi paw angching cham krum dowi. Naiawng rakowi Samuel tut-e angching kowkowi mih chowdiah,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 10:15" />Now Sawl kowi apahi tek pe mih, “Tawng ngai chow Samuel tek enchi? Sam tek ang iüa madiah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 10:16" />Now apahi kowi Sawl klangah mih, “Kawrngaramchükma hawmh kowi kata khowk padow achima aia tek angching khai,” pape khai. Nachenganchepaw aia nachowm mang kown mih lawnguan kowi kowh Samuel tek pe mih laiklow dow apahi kowi Sawl tekla pe dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 10:17" />Akung kowi Samuel dow Mizpa marow kowi CHAKRAMANG pur kowi Israeluüa kowi kuaah lawmah khai. <verse eid="1SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 10:18" />Now Samuel tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, ‘Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla enni mih dow ang chekhai, now Aigupta maru-uüa rut hownia hai chang enni nowng miuüa rut hownia lawng enni mih paw ang chowtaih,’ pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 10:19" />Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow enni kowh Thurai mih phih maten hai ngarera maiow hownia lawng enni mih kowi enni nuata khai. Now enni tek mih, ‘Rui anging mang lowk ia diah,’ pakhai. Naiawng rakowi kawmat enni mih chowlowkkow chenchap hai krungchak iawng CHAKRAMANG pur kowi uang büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 10:20" />Now Samuel dow Israel krungchak maten kowi atawnchow hawah khai. Now kuak pe plang hanow Israel chen hownia Benjamin krungchak kowi ruiah büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 10:21" />Nami kung kowi Benjamin krungchak maten kowi hawah khai. Now amatni pungmadawng kowi kuak pe plang hanow Matri machak kowi ruiah büah khai. Naiawng hown achur kowi dow Kis kowh chapa Sawl kowi ruiah büah khai. Nachenganchepaw Sawl kowi Samuel chetah khe Sawl kowi dow kaah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 10:22" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowi maru kawmuüa lüntaah mih, “Tawng kowi chow Saul?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:22">Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Pai iow, uanh thup dawng kowi pai Sawl cham tapet khai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 10:23" />Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa dow kowiowmah now uanh dawng hownia Sawl kowi uang pawla khai. Aia kowi dow maru kawmuüa pur kowi pe iowngah now aia dow maru maten lak-e lang kro khai. <verse eid="1SA 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 10:24" />Nakhowk khe maru maten kowi Samuel tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG kloah mih maru kowi enni khi khowk bow? A-i pungmadawng kowi aia iawng miapaw uowi dowi chekhai,” pakhai. Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa tek mih, “Mangkri dow chowngdawng sakklangma pauowi lah,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 10:25" />Nami khin khe Samuel dow maru kawmuüa vüi kowi kowh mang achang takla mih hai <char style="w">nowng changra</char> lawnguan maru kawmuüa kowi phuang pe khai. Now nami ari aiang dow <char style="w">charam tua</char> kowi ruiah hanow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi aia towah khai. Nami kung kowi dow maru maten kowi chowlowkkow kim prakowi aia pe mangta khai bowt.<verse eid="1SA 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 10:26" />Now Sawl paw Gibeah kowi kowh aia kim kowi kowplan khai bowt. Nami khin khe saktuak kowi kowh Thurai chang pe lup mih tasen kiakma mih siphaiuüa paw Sawl tut-e kowtawi khai. <verse eid="1SA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 10:27" />Nachenganchepaw asung uowi dowi mih maru pre sum ia tek mih, “Nami maru tawng iawng chow naia lawng a-i kown?” pakhai. Amatni dow Sawl kowi nüah klowkah dowi chekhai, now tawng iawng mih <char style="w">awmrawm sung</char> paw Sawl kowi tawi pe büah dowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Sawl dow tawngpaw tek dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 10:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Jabes-Gilead marowchakuüa kowi Sawl lawngah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 11:1" />Akung kowi Nahas dow kowkowiah now Jabes-Gilead marow tapat lut kowkrawi khup tangbung khai. Nahas dow Amawnuüa mang chekhai, now Jabes-gilead dow Israeluüa kowh marow chekhai. Nakhowk khe Nahas kowi Jabes-gilead marowchakuüa tek pe mih, “A-i tatow laikham diah sik. Nahanow en nimkrüa kowi anging nauowi kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 11:2" />Nakhowk khe Nahas tek pe mih, “Israel chen maten kowi ang peah rukrai kown ang nau. Naiawng rakowi enni kowh hawmlawm mik mih enni nalaita bowk kown takla. Naiawng che enni chang hanow enni hown ang natatow laikham kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 11:3" />Nami laiklow tata now Nahas kowi Jabes-gilead marow kowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa tek pe mih, “Naiawng chekhai hanow pe anging akhin ranit nichow diah; Israel pren kowi kowh arah maten kowi anging krawi pe satang tak. Anging krawi pe satang khowk chepaw miapaw uang lawng anging dowi hanow en nimkrüa kowi anging nauowi kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 11:4" />Nahanow Jabes-gilead marowchakuüa dow Sawl uowi rah Gibeah marow kowi kowphowng satang khai. Nami satang tata hanow Gibeah marowchakuüa dow atün atünma karla sawm khai. <verse eid="1SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 11:5" />Nami khin khe Sawl dow dowm hownia aia kowh chia hawmh hown uang mang khai. Now marowchakuüa kowi Sawl lüntaah mih, “Tawng chow own? Tawngplawng kowchow maru kawmuüa tuk kar khai?” pakhai. Nakhowk khe amatni dow Jabes-gilead marowchakuüa uang phowngah mih satang Sawl kowi hawt lawp pe khai.<verse eid="1SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 11:6" />Nami laiklow tata kung kowi Sawl luk kowi dow Thurai kowh lümla uang ting khai, now Sawl dow kunmarau lün pluplup khai bowt. <verse eid="1SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 11:7" />Aia dow kowpaw chia pre pum hanow tawpta naknak khai. Nami kung kowi dow naiawngün chia nga tawp ia mih krawi chin pe maru hanow Israel pren kowi kowh arah maten kowi krawi saah khai. Now aia krawi pe phuangah mih, “Saul hai Samuel iüah hown tawi tarü tasen dowi mih maru kowh chia dow maiawng naphaw kown,” pakhai. Naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG dow Israeluüa kowi peah kramra khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow takrüpah now tawi tarü tasen kownkow uang lawt bowk khai. <verse eid="1SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 11:8" />Amatni kowi dow Bezek marow kowi Sawl rüaah khai. Nakhowk khe kowh aia kaah mih siphai hawmh dow Juda krungchak hownia nget 30,000 ia chekhai, now akeng mih Israeluüa hownia 300,000 ia chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 11:9" />Now Jabes-gilead marow hownia kowh uang phowng satang miuüa kowi Sawl tek pe mih, “Kowmang now enni kowh marowchakuüa kowi kowtek pe diah. Tharau sat downg khe anging nauang lawng enni kown,” pape khai. Nami laiklow dow Jabes-gilead marowchakuüa tata now lainowmma awmrawm khai. <verse eid="1SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 11:10" />Amatni dow Amawnuüa kowh mang Nahas kowi tek pe mih, “Tharau khe enni nimkrüa kowi anging nauowi kown towbowt, enni nau iawng chang anging towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 11:11" />Now auai ni dow Sawl mih aia kowh maru-uüa kowi changah sum thum khai. Nami kung kowi amatni dow uarthowi dowi rawn Amawnuüa kowh tangbung khupra kowi kowkup büah khai, now nami ni sat downg dowi mowr Amawnuüa kowi krawi saiah büah khai. Amawnuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh nowng plai miuüa dow amaisang kowh cham taset mih lowkkowlowk ka tachet tacham büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 11:12" />Nami kung kowi dow maru kawmuüa uangah now Samuel kowi uang tek pe mih, “A-i luk kowi Sawl naia chowm mang kown nadowi pami amia chow tek? Naiawng tek mih maru-uüa kowi uang sam pawla anging madiah. Anging sam saiah matak,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 11:13" />Nachenganchepaw Sawl klangah mih, “Ani dow Israeluüa kowi CHAKRAMANG lawngah mih ni chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ani dow mia iawng mih maru kowi paw enni naia sai kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14" />Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa kowi Samuel tek pe mih, “Chu, Gilgal marow kowi a-i kowkowiah now Sawl chowm mang mih laiklow a-i kowphuang iawk diah sik,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15" />Nahanow maru kawmuüa dow Gilgal marow kowi kowkowi khai, now CHAKRAMANG pur kowi Sawl kowi peah mang rah büah khai. Nakowi mih amatni dow CHAKRAMANG vüi taking tasangra uanap pawi chang büah khai, now Sawl hai Israeluüa maten dow lainowmma piaw büah khai.<verse eid="1SA 11:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1SA 12" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa tut-e Samuel kowh achur laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 12:1" />Nami kung kowi Israeluüa maten kowi Samuel tek pe mih, “Enni tek ang mih srui ang sünta enni khowk. Now enni tekah iawng mang paw ang tow enni lowk ia khowk. <verse eid="1SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 12:2" />Kawmat hownia now nakruitown enni kownkow enni kowh mang uowi lowk ia khowk. Ang dow klanguüa krowngchow hownia ani mowr pat ang kruitownla enni khowk. Kawmat dow ang lawngtang khai bowt, now ang kowh dow sam paw pau bowk khowk chekhai. Nachenganchepaw ang kowh chapauüa dow nachang enni lup reng kown taih. <verse eid="1SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 12:3" />Kawmat makowi ang uowi reng tak khe ang luk kowi enni tek kown nau mih uowi khai hanow CHAKRAMANG hai aia nümnapah mih mang pur kowi tek büa diah. Enni kowh chiala chepaw, kawrngaramchük chepaw kür hown ang pawta enni mih uowi ne bow? Ang chang enni anowng apowng mih uowi ne bow? Ang kuanta enni mih uowi ne bow? Ang paw <char style="w">bümsua</char> kowh ang chet enni tara nowm dowi mih uowi ne bow? Naiawng mih angak ang changta mih uowi khai hanow tek ang büa diah; ang nape paw enni aklai kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 12:4" />Maru kawmuüa tek pe Samuel mih, “Chang dowi chow, en chang anging anowng apowng mih paw uowi dowi, now en kuanta anging mih paw uowi dowi chow. Nami klen kowi en pawta anging uanh mih paw uowi dowi chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 12:5" />Now Samuel tek pe mih, “Enni luk kowi tawng iawng mih angak paw ang chang dowi pami ani enni tek khowk chekhai. Naiawng enni tek mih hownia dow ang kowh aprek uowi dowi pami saksi CHAKRAMANG hai aia phawk pe sau kowh nümnapah mih mang chowbowt,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 12:5">Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa klangah mih, “Ow, CHAKRAMANG dow saksi chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 12:6" />Nami klen kowi Samuel plan tek pe maru kawmuüa mih, “Ow, CHAKRAMANG chowtaih saksi. Aia dow Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi thawpah aluchow khai, now aia dow enni kowh pipu-uüa kowi Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla khai. <verse eid="1SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 12:7" />Kawmat dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi iowng se ririmma sünta büa diah. Enni hai enni kowh pipu-uüa vüi CHAKRAMANG changah mih kraingra lup maten ang nachia enni kown.<verse eid="1SA 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 12:8" />“Jakawb mih aia kimchakuüa hailawm Aigupta pren kowi kowkowi khai, now Aigupta maru-uüa mih amatni kowi dow hawt changah anowng apowng khai. Nami khin khe amatni dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e kar se lü khowng büah khai. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG dow amatni kowi nauang lawngah kownkow Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi uang chin pe khai. Mosi hai Arawn iüah dow enni kowh pipu-uüa kowi Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla hanow mami pren kowi pe uowiah khai. <verse eid="1SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 12:9" />Nachenganchepaw amatni dow CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai kowi tamata khai. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow amatni kowi cham pe uowiah nar kownkow Hazawr marow kowi kowh siphai aluchow Sisera rut kowi, Filistinuüa rut kowi hai Moabuüa kowh mang rut kowi amatni kowi ap-ah khai. Naiawngün ransu-uüa dow enni kowh pipu-uüa hown uang tadowk tasen khai. <verse eid="1SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 12:10" />Nakhowk khe enni kowh pipu-uüa dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr kar mih, ‘Anging changta angak khai bowt; CHAKRAMANG kowi powtta now Baal thuraiuüa kowi hai Astarte thuraiuüa kowi anging cham tawi chupiia khai. Nachenganchepaw kawmat mih ransu-uüa rut hownia lawng anging diah. Nahanow en kowh lup anging nachang kown towbowt,’ pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 12:11" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG dow Gideawn, Barak, Jeftha hai Samuel büah kowi uang chin enni khai, now amatni dow enni riaret kowi kowh ransu-uüa rut hownia uang lawng enni khai. Nami kung kowi dow athaulangma hown enni uowi khai.<verse eid="1SA 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 12:12" />“Nachenganchepaw Amawnuüa kowh mang Nahas uang sen enni mih enni tuk khe dow enni kowh mang CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai uowi khowk chepaw enni uang tek ang mih, ‘Naiawng anging nauta dowi. Anging luk kowi tow anging mang lowk ia diah,’ enni pah ang khai.<verse eid="1SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 12:13" />“Kawmat dow nami chowbowt enni kowh mang. Aia dow enni lüah mih hai enni kloah mih mang chowbowt. Aia dow enni vüi CHAKRAMANG tow enni mih mang chowbowt. <verse eid="1SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 12:14" />Enni che CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram khai, aia kowi che enni chupiia khai, aia kowh ana pek che enni chün khai, now enni kowh mang hailawm CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai nau iawng che enni uowi khai hanow enni vüi naiung kown. <verse eid="1SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 12:15" />Tawkchedow CHAKRAMANG tek iawng che enni chün dowi, now aia kowh ana pek paw enni che kingküa khai hanow aia dow enni pipu-uüa kowi kowh ripah iawng enni kowi hai enni kowh mang kowi paw narip enni kown.<verse eid="1SA 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 12:16" />“Kawmat dow mami re-e iowng büa rimrim diah. Enni pur kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG nachangah kown mih kraingra lup mü büa diah. <verse eid="1SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 12:17" />Kawmat dow püm ngen khin chowbowt; uang khin nadowi bowt nadowi bow? Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG kowi ang naawr tek pe kown, now aia dow muk tün hai uangchak mih nauang pe uangah kown. Nahanow enni lü mang mih dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e mün khowt chow nga khai mih enni natuk kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 12:18" />Nami kung kowi Samuel dow chup Thurai khai bowt. Now CHAKRAMANG mih nami ni khe muk tün hai uangchak uang chin pe khai. Nakhowk khe dow maru maten mih CHAKRAMANG hai Samuel kowi kramah khai bowt.<verse eid="1SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 12:19" />Nakhowk khe maru maten tek pe Samuel mih, “Anging lü mang mih angak dow anging kowh akeng mih angak maten hown tawi tabawng khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi en kowh naruüa anging nakowngla dowi kownkow chup anging Thurai diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 12:20" />Samuel klangah mih, “Hangkow kram büah. Naiawngün lup ngak enni changta khowk chepaw CHAKRAMANG hownia hang cham powt büa diah. Aia kowh lup phai towsak towtaima hown chang büa diah. <verse eid="1SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 12:21" />Asung uowi dowi mih <char style="w">arup aren</char> kowi hang cham chupiia büah diah. Naiawngün dow enni vüi tawngpaw mrawkra uowi dowi, now lawng paw nowng lawng enni kown nadowi. <verse eid="1SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 12:22" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh ming kri kraingma mih rakowi aia maru-uüa kowi tawng nam khe paw nanuata hüah kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia sak nau hown kowh aia maru aia changla enni mih chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 12:23" />Enni vüi chupla Thurai reng mih taingta hai CHAKRAMANG kowi kingküala mih angak dow ang mih hang pacham chang lah. Aiungma hai anowmma mih tiama kowi enni namang kownkow ang natüngsang enni reng kown taih. <verse eid="1SA 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 12:24" />CHAKRAMANG kowi chowtaih ringkawma hown kramah büa diah, now sak maiow hown kaah sakowm iawng aia kowi chupiiaah büa diah. Enni vüi mün khowt chow kraingra uowi mih lup aia chang enni mih tuakah büa diah. <verse eid="1SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 12:25" />Nachenganchepaw enni che chang lup ngak rengreng hanow enni kowh mang hailawm enni mih napiak bowk kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Filistinuüa hown Israeluüa tasen kown mih kamrüt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="1SA 13:1-2" />Sawl dow 30 ning khe Israeluüa pren kowi chowm mang khai. Aia chowm mang mih pre sum ning kung kowi Sawl dow Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia 3,000 ia maru kowi ruiah khai. Naiawngünuüa pungmadawng hownia 2,000 ia maru dow Mikmas hai Bethel marow re-e kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi aia hown tawi uowi khai. Now 1,000 ia mih maru dow Benjaminuüa süng kowi kowh Gibeah pami arah kowi Jonathan hown tawi uowi khai. Now akeng mih Israeluüa maten kowi dow chowlowkkow kim prakowi aia chinta khai.<verse eid="1SA 13:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 13:3" />Now Geba kowi kowh khup tangbung mih Filistin siphaiuüa kowi dow Jonathan thumchakuüa mih kowsenah hanow kownowngta khai, now nami satang dow akeng mih Filistinuüa tawi ta khai bowt. Now Filistinuüa nauang senah kown chekhai pami rakowi Sawl dow Israel pren kowi kowh arah maten kowi krawi chin satang phowng mih khai. Naiawngün maru-uüa kowi Sawl mih krawi pe tumah <char style="w">baw</char> khai, now krawi pe tekah mih, “Hebrai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hebrai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow Israel kowh lai chekhai. Tawngbak khe dow amatni kowh chenchap ming paw na chekhai.</char></note> maten sünta büa diah. Filistinuüa hown nadowk tasen kownkow uang tawi tarü büa diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 13:4" />Nahanow Filistinuüa kowh tangbung khup rah Sawl kowsen hanow nowngta mih dow Israeluüa tukta khai bowt, now amatni kowi Filistinuüa lainowmma suiah mih paw tuk büah khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi maru kawmuüa dow krawi tahaw talai hanow Gilgal kowi Sawl tut-e uang takua talawm khai.<verse eid="1SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 13:5" />Nami khin khe Israeluüa kowi nauang senah kownkow Filistinuüa paw takua talawm khai. Amatni tut-e kowh uowi mih dow kawrnga kari 30,000, kawrnga luk kowi kowh chowm mih siphai 6,000 ia, now khawk hown kowh mang mih siphaiuüa nget sata pang kowi kowh sema nowng rüaah dowi mih iawng chekhai. Amatni dow Bet-Aven marow satlawt pra kowh Mikmas marow kowi uang khup tangbung büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 13:6" />Naiawng khowt mih maru kawm Israel siphaiuüa khita hanow amatni dow kla phih mih chowbowt pami tuk büah khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow kram kowh puk kowi ne, ruih mung kowi ne, hua pheng kowi ne, now kuam kowi ne cham krawi tapet büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 13:7" />Now tawngbak mih Hebraiuüa dow haipown Jawrdan aw hanow Gad hai Gilead süng kowi kowpowt khai. Nachenganchepaw Sawl dow Gilgal kowi ta uowi khai. Nakhowk khe aia hown kowh tawi uowi mih siphaiuüa dow kram kowh chürla kluk khai.<verse eid="1SA 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawl chün lai dowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 13:8" />Sawl dow Samuel towla pe akhin iawng ranit ni mowr Samuel kowi hawt chawngah khai. Nachenganchepaw Samuel mih Gilgal kowi uang dowi chekhai. Now Sawl kowh siphaiuüa dow cham powt bowk khai. <verse eid="1SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 13:9" />Naiawng rakowi Sawl dow tikah mih uanap hai taking tasangra uanap chang müa uanh mih aia tut-e nauang pawla kownkow aia maru-uüa kowi tek pe khai. Nami kung kowi aia matia mih tikah mih uanap pawi changah khai. <verse eid="1SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 13:10" />Now aia ki changta uanap pawi hown krowksang Samuel dow Gilgal marow kowi uang ting khai. Nakhowk khe Sawl mih Samuel kowi nahawt chumah kownkow kowtarü khai.<verse eid="1SA 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 13:11" />Nakhowk khe Samuel tek pe Sawl mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng en tuk chang khai?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:11">Now Sawl klangah mih, “Ang kowh maru-uüa mih towla ang hüah now powtta ang bowk khowk, now en paw akhin khe uang ting dowi chekhai. Nami klen kowi Filistinuüa paw Mikmas kowi uang takua talawm thüm khowk chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 13:12" />Now Filistinuüa dow Gilgal marow kowi nauang sen ang kown chowbowt. Tawkchedow CHAKRAMANG hownia nakala saksing sanara kownkow tawngpaw ang chang dowi tak chekhai padow ang ka tuak khai. Naiawng rakowi chang kown ang nau dowi chepaw tikah mih uanap pawi mih ang changta khai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13" />Nakhowk khe Samuel tek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow bualama mih maru iawng en tuk chang lup khai? CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai pe en mih ana en chün dowi chekhai. En che chün panü dow Israeluüa luk kowi kowh en kowh mangra chowngchowng saksakma aia mih natow en kown taih diah. <verse eid="1SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14" />Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow en kowh mangra mih nalüa chur kown chowbowt. CHAKRAMANG mih aia naukrang iawng mang mih maru kowi kata lowk ia khowk. Nami maru kowi dow aia maru-uüa vüi aia thawpta aluchow khowk chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow aia kowh ana pek chün dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 13:15" />Nami kung kowi dow Samuel mih Gilgal hownia mang khai bowt. Nachenganchepaw akeng miuüa dow siphaiuüa hown nakowtakrum kownkow Benjaminuüa süng kowi kowh Gibeah marow kowi Sawl hown kowtawi khai. Aia tut-e kowh ta uowi miuüa kowi rüaah now maru iun 600 iachow taih Sawl ta ka khai.<verse eid="1SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng uowi dowi mih auan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 13:16" />Nami kung kowi Sawl hai achapa Jonathan dow amatchi hown kowh tawi uowi miuüa hown Benjaminuüa süng kowi kowh Geba marow kowi kowkowi now kowuowi khai. Now Filistinuüa dow Mikmas kowi uang khup tangbung now uang uowi khai. <verse eid="1SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 13:17" />Now Filistinuüa tangbung khup rah hownia kowh siphaiuüa dow uang lawt sum thum khai. Amatni pungmadawng kowi pathum mih dow Ofra marow pra kowh tiama kowi Sawl süng kowi kowkowi khai, <verse eid="1SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 13:18" />alowk mih thumchak dow Bet-Hawrawn prakowi kowkowi khai, now alowk mih thumchak dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh Zebawim lawngrawi hown tatingtang klowk mih hungma mawngma süng kowi kowkowi khai.<verse eid="1SA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 13:19" />Nami khin khe Israeluüa pren kowi dow plamphai uowi dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Hebraiuüa tut-e plamphai che uowi now amatni matia mih saidawng chepaw, reh chepaw nathawp büah kown chekhai padow Filistinuüa mih ka tuak kowh towah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 13:20" />Naiawng rakowi laithawn tim ün, parpa ün, marek ün, sarai hai tangchen ün nasükah kownkow Hebraiuüa mih Filistinuüa tut-e kowkowi takla reng chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 13:21" />Israeluüa mih laithawn tim hai parpa sük sung tai tali gram, now marek, sarai hai tangchen sük sung tai tangka pre gram chi Filistinuüa kowi apek takla khai. <verse eid="1SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 13:22" />Naiawng rakowi cham tasen mih khin khe Sawl hai Jonathan iüah pachow tut-e klen kowi mia iawng mih siphaiuüa tut-e paw reh hai saidawng uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 13:23" />Now Filistinuüa tangbung khup rah kowi kowh siphaiuüa dow uang lawt hanow Mikmas kowi kowkowi büah khai.<verse eid="1SA 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1SA 14" />
  <para style="s">Apa tuk dowi kowi Jonathan cham tasen mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 14:1" />Akat khe Sawl kowh chapa Jonathan mih aia kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng kawt mih klanguüa kowi tek pe mih, “Chu, paipra pown kowi kowh Filistinuüa tangbung khup rah kowi achi kowkowi madiah sik,” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw nami laiklow mih a-pa kowi aia tekla pe dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 14:2" />Nami khin khe Sawl uowi mih dow Gibeah süng kowi kowh Mikrawn pami arah kowi <char style="w">dalim</char> singh krüa kowi chekhai. Nakhowk khe aia hown siphaiuüa tawi uowi mih dow 600 ia chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 14:3" />Now amatni pungmadawng kowi Ahija paw tawi uowi khai. Ahija dow ephawd kowrmow khupma chekhai. Aia dow Ahitub kowh chapa, now Ahitub dow Ikabawd kowh tainau chekhai. Ikabawd dow Finehas kowh chapa, now Finehas dow Eli kowh chapa chekhai. Eli dow Silo marow kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG kowh uamow chekhai. Jonathan cham lawt mih dow miapaw tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 14:4" />Filistinuüa tangbung khup rah pra kowh Jonathan kowtek kowiah mih tiama dow thiabang takra iawng chekhai. Nami tiama dow mapra hai paipra thiabang kangowh chekhai. Mapra kowh thiabang ming dow Bozez, now paipra kowh thiabang ming dow Sene chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 14:5" />Mapra kowh thiabang dow tawngphak pra Mikmas marow pur kowi chekhai, now paipra kowh thiabang dow mrawkphak pra Geba marow pur kowi chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 14:6" />Now aia kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng kawt mih klanguüa kowi Jonathan tek pe mih, “Chu, paipra pown kowi kowh tuk Thurai dowi mih maru-uüa kowh tangbung khup rah kowi achi kowkowi lah. Kowbüah dow hiah khampha uanpik dowi mih chenchap chekhai. CHAKRAMANG pe awng achi tarawng. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow aia nau now achi pre iachow taih chepaw nowng pe awng achi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 14:7" />Nakhowk khe nami klanguüa klangah mih, “En sak kowi uowi iawng chang taih. En tek iawng ang chang sow,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 14:8" />Jonathan tek pe mih, “Naiawng now mang madiah. Paipra pown kowi achi kowkowi now kowbüah tut-e achi kowsam tatüng madiah sik. <verse eid="1SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 14:9" />Kowbüah che, ‘Iowng iüah, enchi tut-e anging uang sow,’ pahai tek achi khai hanow nami re-e achi naiowng kown towbowt; amatni tut-e achi kowpün dowi bowt tak. <verse eid="1SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 14:10" />Nachenganchepaw amatni che, ‘Anging re-e uang awr mang iüa diah,’ pahai tek achi khai hanow amatni tut-e achi nakowpün kown. Naiawng che phaw khai hanow nami dow achi rut kowi amatni kowi CHAKRAMANG apta mih chowbowt pami amatra naown kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 14:11" />Naiawng hai amatchi dow Filistinuüa khi bowk iawng hungh tut re-e kowiowng iüah khai. Nakhowk khe Filistin siphaiuüa hawt tatek mih, “Pai iow sam mü madiah, puk lak kowi kowh cham tapet mih Hebraiuüa uang lawt khowk,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 14:12" />Jonathan hai aia kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng kawt mih klanguüa kowi Filistin siphaiuüa tek pe mih, “Uang awr pün iüa diah, anging tüng enchi kown mih uowi pachap,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:12">Nakhowk khe aia kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng kawt mih klanguüa kowi Jonathan tek pe mih, “Ang kung kowi uang krawi pün ba. Kowbüah kowi mih Israeluüa rut kowi CHAKRAMANG apta mih chowbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 14:13" />Now Jonathan dow aia kowh pre rut pre khawk hown thiabang luk kowi awr pün khai bowt. Now aia kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng kawt mih klanguüa paw aia kung kowi awr tawi pün khai. Jonathan dow aia pur kowi kowh Filistinuüa kowi sai chamang krawi saiah khai, now aia kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng kawt mih klanguüa paw kung hownia kowh uang krawi sen mih Filistinuüa kowi sai chamang saiah khai. <verse eid="1SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 14:14" />Jonathan hai aia kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng kawt mih klanguüa iüah kowsenah khe kowh aklowk rawngchow mih laih kowi Filistinuüa kowng mih dow 20 ia ngia chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 14:15" />Tangbung khup rah kowi kowh siphaiuüa, kangchawng rah kowi kowh siphaiuüa hai tasenra kowi kowh uowi mih siphaiuüa maten luk kowi dow amaisang takrow takraira uang ting khai. Nami klen kowi nami khin khe lihowng paw tawi uang khai. Naiawngün takrow takraira dow Thurai hownia kowh uang pe tingah mih chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filistinuüa kowi Israeluüa nowngta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 14:16" />Now Benjaminuüa süng kowi kowh Gibeah marow kowi uowi mih Sawl kowh siphaiuüa dow Filistin siphaiuüa cham taset plawt mih khita khai. <verse eid="1SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 14:17" />Nami khin khe aia hown kowh tawi uowi mih siphaiuüa kowi Sawl tek pe mih, “Siphaiuüa kowi kuaah hanow sam müah madiah. Amia chow a-i pungmadawng hownia cham lawt mih uowi?” pakhai. Naiawng hai amatni dow takua talawm hanow Jonathan hai aia kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng kawt mih siphai uowi dowi mih dow tuk büah khai.<verse eid="1SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 14:18" />Nakhowk khe Ahija kowi Sawl tek pe mih, “Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kowpaw madiah,” pakhai. (Nami khin khe sangbowk laitawm tawkpla uowi mih dow Israeluüa tut-e chekhai). <verse eid="1SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 14:19" />Now Sawl mih uamow hown taklang mih khin khe Filistinuüa kowh tangbung khup rah kowi takhowk taran klow uang hu ngamlam khai. Naiawng rakowi Sawl plan tek pe uamow iawk mih, “Kowpaw lakke dowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 14:20" />Nami kung kowi Sawl hai aia kowh siphaiuüa dow Filistinuüa kowi kowsenah kownkow kowtarü khai. Nakhowk khe amatni dow Filistinuüa amatni lala tatu tasawtla prung mih kowkhi büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 14:21" />Nami dowi rawn khe kowh Filistin tut-e tawi tabawng mih Hebraiuüa dow uang plan hanow Sawl hai Jonathan iüah pachowh hown kowh Israeluüa hown uang tawi tabawng khai.<verse eid="1SA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 14:22" />Now Efraim hungma mawngma süng kowi kowh tapet mih Israeluüa paw Filistinuüa powt mih satang tata now uang lawt khai. Now amatni paw amatni Israeluüa hown uang tawi tabawng hanow Filistinuüa kowi uang tawi senah büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 14:23" />Amatni dow Bet-Aven marow klen kowi pat krawi senla khai. Naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG dow nami ni khe Filistinuüa rut hownia Israeluüa kowi lawngah khai.<verse eid="1SA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apa kowh laikham Jonathan piakta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 14:24" />Naiawng tasen büah mih ni khe Israeluüa dow lainowmma bowm khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow sat kup dowi mowr, ransu-uüa kowi nowngta dowi mowr tawng chap paw nacha nakham dowi kownkow amatni kowi Sawl pe takhamah khai. Nami dowi rawn cha chakkham mih maru luk kowi dow piati pacham kla lah pami Sawl pe takhamah sawi khai. Naiawng rakowi nami ni dow miapaw cha dowi kham dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 14:25" />Akung kowi amatni dow singh rüm kauche dawng kowi kowkup bowk khai. Nakhowk khe amatni dow nakowi kowkhi kuaiba büah sangrum khai. <verse eid="1SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 14:26" />Naiawngün kuaiba hownia kuai tui iu iat daplap mih khi büah khai. Nachenganchepaw napiakta sawi kham kown mih kram büah rakowi miapaw uam cha kuai tui dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 14:27" />Tawkchedow maru kawmuüa kowi naiawng a-pa pe khamah sawi mih Jonathan tawi tuk dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow aia kowh raitua chem hown nami kuaiba kowi awr sawtah khai, now nami kuaiba dow aia awr pawah hanow cha kuai tui khai. Nahanow aia kowh dow kür uang ting khai. <verse eid="1SA 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 14:28" />Nakhowk khe siphai lowk ia tek pe Jonathan mih, “Siphaiuüa kowi maiawng akhawtma en pa pe khamah sawi khai. En pa tek mih, ‘Ani kowh cha chakkham mih luk kowi dow piati pacham kla lah,’ pakhai. Maru kawmuüa naiawng khowt bowm mih dow naiawng rakowi chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 14:29" />Nakhowk khe Jonathan klangah mih, “Apa dow maru kawmuüa kowi towkah ngare mih chekhai. Mü madiah, mami kuai tui ang chata ditchow pache ang plan ka kür khai. <verse eid="1SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 14:30" />Ransu-uüa hownia kowh kaah mih chakkham che ani maru kawmuüa cha panü dow mün khowt chow iung kown, now Filistinuüa paw nakowng küng tak diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 14:31" />Nami ni khe Israeluüa mih Mikmas marow hownia Aijalawn marow mowr Filistinuüa kowi krawi senah khai. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa mih lainowmma bowm khai bowt. <verse eid="1SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 14:32" />Amatni dow sat kup hown krowksang ransu-uüa hownia kowh kaah mih chia, chia chah hai ruapur ün krawi ngen büah hanow avi hailawm chata büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 14:33" />Nakhowk khe amatni pungmadawng hownia maru pre sum ia dow nami satang Sawl kowi kowphowng pe khai. Sawl kowi kowtek pe büah mih, “Mü madiah, kowbüah bowkbowk dow avi hailawm cha chaknga hanow CHAKRAMANG kowi kingküala mih lup ngak chang büah khai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:33">Nakhowk khe Sawl tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek enni chün dowi chekhai. Kawmat huaklu aiukma mih alenma uang lünla now mami re-e uang pawla büah lowk diah,” pape khai. <verse eid="1SA 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 14:34" />Nami kung kowi Sawl plan tek pe iawk mih, “Maru kawmuüa tut-e kowkowiah now kowtek pe büa diah. Amatni kowh chia, chia chah hai ruapur mih makowi uang pawla now mami huaklu luk kowi pacham ngenah lah, now nami kung kowi phai pacham cha büa lah. Avi hailawm chata chaknga kowh mia iawng mih maru paw CHAKRAMANG kowi kingküala mih angak hang pacham chang lah,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:34">Naiawng rakowi nami iak khe maru kawmuüa dow chowlowkkow kaah mih tawncher uang pawla now nami huaklu luk kowi uang ngenah büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 14:35" />Now nakowi dow Sawl mih CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi thawp phuchuara lowk khai. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh aia rik thawpah mih phuchuara chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jonathan kowi siphaiuüa lawngah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 14:36" />Nami kung kowi Sawl tek mih, “Chu, Filistinuüa kowi uar prowt a-i krawi senah lah, now uar thowi dowi mowr amatni kowi a-i krawi saiah lah. Now amatni kowh uanh maten a-i krawi pawta pe bowk lah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa klangah mih, “En tut-e iung iawng chang diah,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Nachenganchepaw uamow tek pe mih, “Chu diah, Thurai tut-e a-i rik lüntaah diah sik,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 14:37" />Nakhowk khe Thurai kowi Sawl lüntaah mih, “Filistinuüa kowi ang krawi sen kown bow? Amatni kowi dow Israeluüa rut kowi en naap-ah kown bow?” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw nami ni dow aia kowi mih Thurai klangah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 14:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 14:38" />Naiawng rakowi Sawl tek mih, “Siphai aluchowuüa low, mami re-e uang büa diah. Ani kowh angak tawng iawng chow phaw mih a-i sam chetah madiah sik. <verse eid="1SA 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 14:39" />Israeluüa kowh lawng miia masing CHAKRAMANG ming hown ang takham khowk. Mami angak chang mih che ang kowh chapa Jonathan chekhai chepaw aia dow nakowng ngengche kown takla,” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw maru kawmuüa dow rarimma uowi khai.<verse eid="1SA 14:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 14:40" />Nakhowk khe Israeluüa maten kowi Sawl tek pe mih, “Enni bowkbowk paipra kowi iowng büa diah, now ang hai ang chapa Jonathan mih mapra kowi angching naiowng kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:40">Now maru kawmuüa klangah mih, “En tut-e iung iawng chang diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 14:41" />Nakhowk khe Sawl chup Thurai mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai, sakrauma hown mia chow chang ngak mih hai mia chow chang ngak dowi mih uang tüng anging diah. Ang hai Jonathan che changta angak khai hanow Urim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Urim </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hai Thumim lawnguan kowi dow Uown lawt 28:30 uan kowi arui uowi chekhai. </char></note> pami hua pacham tatüng lah, now Israeluüa che changta angak hanow Thumim pami hua pacham tatüng lah,” pakhai. Nami kung kowi Urim hua uang tatüng hanow Sawl hai Jonathan iüah pachowh kowi dowkah khai, now akeng miuüa dow khalat khai. <verse eid="1SA 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 14:42" />Nami kung kowi Sawl plan tek mih, “Ang hai ang chapa Jonathan angching kowi kuak angching plang madiah,” pakhai. Now nakhe kowh plang cha mih dow Jonathan ming kowi chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 14:43" />Nakhowk khe Sawl tek pe Jonathan mih, “Tawng chow en changta mih tek ang madiah?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:43">Now Jonathan tek pe a-pa mih, “Ang kowh raitua chem hown ang awr sawt kuaiba now ang chata kuai tui khai ditchow. Naiawng rakowi ang nakowng kown takla khai bow?” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 14:44" />Now Sawl tek pe mih, “Ow Jonathan, en nakowng ngengche kown takla. En che kowng dowi now Thurai mih pacham kowngta ang ngengche lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 14:45" />Nachenganchepaw Sawl kowi maru kawmuüa tek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow Jonathan nakowng kown? Ani kowh Israeluüa ka lawngra mih Jonathan rakowi nadowi bow? Masing CHAKRAMANG ming hown anging takham khowk, mapaw Jonathan nakowng kown nadowi; aia kowh sam paiangchow khowm padow krawng kowi nadowh kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ani kowh aia changah mih maten dow Thurai tawi uowila kowh aia chang mih chekhai,” pabüah khai. Naiawng hai maru kawmuüa dow Jonathan kowi lawngah khai, now Jonathan kowi dow kowngta dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 14:46" />Nami kung kowi dow Sawl mih Filistinuüa kowi krawi senah dowi bowt, now Filistinuüa paw amatni pren prakowi plan khai bowt.<verse eid="1SA 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 14:47" />Sawl dow Israeluüa luk kowi uown chowm mang kung kowi amatni kowh pren riaret kowi kowh ransu-uüa maten hown krawi tasenla khai. Naiawng aia krawi senah mih ransu-uüa dow Moabuüa, Amawnuüa, Edawmuüa, Zoba marow manguüa hai Filistinuüa chekhai. Nakhowk khe aia cham krawi senah mih ransu-uüa maten kowi aia nowngta reng chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 14:48" />Aia dow tasen akiakma mih iawng Amalekuüa kowi senah now nowngta khai. Now amatni kowh ransu-uüa maten hownia Israeluüa kowi lawngah khai.<verse eid="1SA 14:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawl kowh kimchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 14:49" />Sawl kowh dow Jonathan, Isboset hai Malkisua pami chapa uowi sum ia, now chama paw uowi pre ia chekhai. Achama ta ming dow Merab, now achama sawi ming dow Mikal chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 14:50" />Now aia kowh masi ming dow Ahinoam chekhai. Ahinoam dow Ahimaz kowh chama chekhai. Now Sawl kowh siphai aluchowuüa kowh lang kri mih ming dow Abner chekhai. Abner dow Sawl kowh pahi Ner kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 14:51" />Sawl kowh pa Kis hai Abner kowh pa Ner iüah dow Abiel kowh chapa chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 14:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 14:52" />Aia chowm mang mih khin khe Sawl dow Filistinuüa hown lainowmma tasenla khai. Nami khin khe akürma mih maru hai sakkraingma mih maru kowi khi hanow Sawl mih aia kowh siphai changla khai.<verse eid="1SA 14:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1SA 15" />
  <para style="s">Sawl kowsen Amalekuüa mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 15:1" />Akat khe Sawl kowi Samuel tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG mih aia kowh maru Israeluüa luk kowi nape chowm en mang kownkow nanümnap en kown mih uang chin ang khai. Naiawng rakowi kawmat mih CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow sünta diah. <verse eid="1SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 15:2" />Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa uang lawt mih khin khe Amalekuüa dow Israeluüa kowi hawt kingküaah khai. Naiawng rakowi Amalekuüa kowi dow ang naripah kown. <verse eid="1SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 15:3" />Kawmat mih Amalekuüa kowi kowsenah diah, now amatni kowh uowi mih srui piakta pe diah. Amatni kowi dow masiuüa hai kachakuüa, kham iawn reng tak mih ngeu-uüa, chia hai ruapur, <char style="w">ut</char> hai kawrngaramchük ün saila pe bowk diah,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 15:4" />Nami laiklow tata now Sawl dow maru kawmuüa kowi Telaim marow kowi kuaah now rüaah khai. Nakhowk khe Israel siphaiuüa dow 200,000 ia, now Juda krungchakuüa hownia kowh siphaiuüa dow 10,000 ia chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 15:5" />Now Sawl hai aia kowh siphaiuüa dow Amalekuüa kowh marow prakowi kowtarü khai bowt. Amatni dow Amalekuüa kowi nasenah kownkow marow re-e kowh lawngrawi kowi kowtapet khai. <verse eid="1SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 15:6" />Nakhowk khe Sawl mih Amalekuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh tawi uowi mih Kenuüa tut-e kowchin pe maru khai. Now aia krawi tek pe mih, “Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa uang lawt khe enni dow kowbüah kowi hawt sanaah khai. Naiawng rakowi kawmat mih Amalekuüa hownia cham lang tahen büa diah; naiawng nadowi now Amalekuüa hown enni kowi paw ang napiakla enni kown chekhai,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Kenuüa dow Amalekuüa hownia cham lang tahen khai.<verse eid="1SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 15:7" />Nakhowk khe Sawl dow aia kowh siphaiuüa hown Havila marow hownia Sur marow mowr Amalekuüa kowi senah now nowng sumta khai. Sur marow dow Aigupta pren satlawt prakowi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 15:8" />Aia dow Amalekuüa kowh mang Agag kowi asing khümah khai, now akeng miuüa kowi dow saila bowk chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 15:9" />Nachenganchepaw Sawl hai aia kowh siphaiuüa mih Amalekuüa kowh mang Agag kowi dow kowngta dowi chekhai, now chia hai ruapur paw kow iungma mih maten kowi dow kowngta dowi chekhai. Naiawngün kowi dow nakowngta büah kown mih nauta büah dowi. Tawkche kow ngakma hai arawngma mih chia hai ruapur maten dow saila büah bowk khai.<verse eid="1SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawl kowi CHAKRAMANG nuata mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 15:10" />Nakhowk khe Samuel kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="1SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 15:11" />“Saul kowi ang pe chowmah mang mih ang kowh sak ngara chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow ang hownia cham dang khai, now ang kowh ana pek chün dowi chekhai,” pakhai. Nami laiklow tata hanow Samuel dow Sawl luk kowi kunmarau khai, now aia dow uar prowt CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr kar khai.<verse eid="1SA 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 15:12" />Now Samuel dow auai rau murpa awr rü hanow Sawl hown kowtakrum kownkow tarü khai. Nakhowk khe Samuel kowi maru uang tek pe mih, “Saul mih aia nakala ringkawra kownkow Karmel hungh kowi kowchowk hua lowk khai. Nami kung kowi dow Sawl mih Gilgal marow kowi mang khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 15:13" />Nakhowk khe Samuel mih Sawl tut-e kowkowi khai. Samuel kowi Sawl hawt tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG pacham pe en prasi lah. CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek ang chün khowk,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 15:14" />Now Samuel tek pe mih, “Naiawng now tawngplawng kowchow ruapur plak klow ang param kowi uang tuk ting khai? Tawngplawng kowchow chia puk klow ang ta khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 15:15" />Sawl klangah mih, “Naiawngün dow Amalekuüa hownia kowh siphaiuüa uang pawla mih chowbowt. CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai vüi nachangla phuchua kownkow naiawngün kow iungma mih chia hai ruapur dow siphaiuüa towah mih chowbowt. Tawkche kow ngakma hai arawngma mih tawncher dow anging saila bowk khowk,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 15:16" />Nakhowk khe Sawl kowi Samuel tek pe mih, “Hauang tek ang tham bowt. Maiak kowh CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih phai sünta chaw,” pakhai. Sawl tek pe mih, “Sam tek madiah,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 15:17" />Samuel tek pe mih, “Akat khe dow en matia kowi achap sowmchow mih maru en tatuakla khai. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow Israel krungchak maten kowi kowh aluchow nadowi bow en phaw? Israel pren kowi nape chowm en mang kownkow CHAKRAMANG dow nümnap en khai. <verse eid="1SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 15:18" />Aia dow nape chang en lup lowk kownkow cham chin en khai. Now aia tek en mih, ‘Kowkowiah now maru ngak Amalekuüa kowi kowsaita bowk dit. Amatni mih chum bowk dowi mowr kowsenah dit,’ pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 15:19" />Tawngplawng kowchow CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek en chün dowi? Tawngplawng kowchow cham rupah mih uanh luk kowi en tuk lawpha khai? Tawngplawng kowchow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup en tuk chang khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 15:20" />Nakhowk khe Sawl tek pe mih, “Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek ang chün khowk dow. CHAKRAMANG kowpe chang ang mih lup ang changla khowk dow. Amalekuüa kowi ang saila bowk khowk, now amatni kowh mang Agag kowi paw ang uang khümla khowk chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 15:21" />Tawkche napiakta kownkow khowmta bowkta mih uanh hownia aiuk akauma mih tawncher dow siphaiuüa uang pawla khai ne. Naiawngün dow Gilgal marow kowi CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai vüi naia changla phuchua kownkow siphaiuüa uang pawla mih chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 15:22" />Nakhowk khe Samuel tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 15:22" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">“Aia kowh ana pek chün hanow CHAKRAMANG dow lainowmma awmrawm chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:22">tikah mih uanap hai tawncher hown kowh phuchua dow naiawng khowt aia awmrawm dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">Tawncher phuchua lak-e aia ana pek chün mih lang iung,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:22">ruapur sau lak-e aia kowh lai chün mih lang iung chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 15:23" />CHAKRAMANG kowi kingküa mih dow mü hawra mih angak hown katsang chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:23">now chang bawri mih dow chup arup mih angak hown katsang chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:23">En dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek en nuata khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:23">Naiawng rakowi aia paw en kowh mangra hownia nuata en khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawl lü lawt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 15:24" />Nakhowk khe Sawl tek pe mih, “Ang changta angak khai. CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek hai en kowh ana pek ang üata khai. Naiawngün lup dow maru kawmuüa kowi ang kram kowh amatni tek iawng ang changta khai. <verse eid="1SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 15:25" />Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow sakrauma hown ang kowh angak lawtta ang diah. Now CHAKRAMANG kowi ang naia chupiiala kownkow ang hown tawi diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 15:26" />Nakhowk khe Samuel tek pe mih, “En hown ang natawi kown nadowi. CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek en nuata khai rakowi CHAKRAMANG paw Israeluüa luk kowi kowh en kowh mangra mih nuata en khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 15:27" />Naiawng ki tekla now Samuel dow napowtta kownkow kung prakowi taplan khai. Nakhowk khe Sawl mih Samuel kowh kowrmow kowi krawi dowkah now krawi küngah khai, nahanow Samuel kowh kowrmow dow tathek khai. <verse eid="1SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 15:28" />Nakhowk khe Samuel tek pe mih, “Ani mih CHAKRAMANG dow Israeluüa kowh pren paw maiawng rupta en khai bowt. En kowh mangra dow en lak-e kowh iung mih en prenchak maru lowk ia kowi aia peta khai bowt. <verse eid="1SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 15:29" />Israeluüa kowh kri kraingra dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai. Aia dow katpaw tek dai lai dowi, now saktuak paw katpaw taklowi dowi chekhai. Aia dow lusa maru nadowi. Naiawng rakowi aia kowh saktuak dow katpaw nataklowi kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 15:30" />Now Sawl tek pe mih, “Ang changta angak khai. Nachenganchepaw sakrauma hown ang kowh chenchap lawngtang aluchowuüa hai Israeluüa pur kowi ang kowh ringkawra town ang diah. CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai kowi ang naia chupla kownkow ang hown tawi diah,” pape khai. <verse eid="1SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 15:31" />Naiawng rakowi Samuel dow Sawl hown kowtawi khai, now Sawl mih CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiiaah khai.<verse eid="1SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Agag kowi Samuel saita mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 15:32" />Akung kowi Samuel tek mih, “Amalekuüa kowh mang Agag kowi ang tut-e uang pawla madiah,” pakhai. Nami laiklow tata now Agag dow awmrawmma hown talek lawlaw se Samuel tut-e uang haimang khai. Nakhowk khe aia dow khalat kowng mih chowbowt padow ka tuak khai.<verse eid="1SA 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 15:33" />Nachenganchepaw Samuel tek pe mih, “En kowh saidawng mih maru akawmma kowi krawi saita khai. Masiuüa akawmma kowi chauüa khawma en changah khai. Nami powm iawng en u paw chauüa khawma nauowi kown,” pakhai. Nami laiklow ki tek pe hanow Samuel mih Gilgal marow kowi CHAKRAMANG pur kowi mang Agag kowi dungta naknak khai.<verse eid="1SA 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 15:34" />Nami kung kowi Samuel dow aia uowi rah Rama marow kowi uang plan khai, now Sawl paw aia uowi rah Gibeah marow kowi kowplan khai bowt. <verse eid="1SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 15:35" />Nami kung kowi dow Samuel mih aia sing uowi mowr Sawl hown katpaw kowtakrum dowi bowt chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Samuel dow Sawl rakowi lainowmma sak piak khai. Now CHAKRAMANG dow Israeluüa luk kowi Sawl kowi pe chowmah mang mih rakowi sak nga khai.<verse eid="1SA 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16" />
  <para style="s">David kowi Samuel nümnapah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1" />Akung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Samuel mih, “Saul rakowi mün khowt tak chow en kowh sak napiak kown? Aia kowi dow Israel pren mangra hownia ang nuata mih chowbowt. Naiawng rakowi kawmat mih pawla kanrawn sau hanow Bethlehem marow kowi kowkowi diah. Nakowi dow Jese chapauüa pungmadawng kowi ang vüi nachowng mang kown mih ang ruita lowk ia khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2" />Samuel tek pe mih, “Ang ia kowi dowi tham. Ang kowkowi mih laiklow ta hanow Sawl nakowngta ang kown chekhai,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:2">Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “En tarü khe en napawla chia iia apum kown. Now, ‘CHAKRAMANG vüi ang uang chang phuchua mih chaw,’ padow en nakowtek kown. <verse eid="1SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3" />Nami phuchua pawi kowi dow Jese kowi en nahawla kown. Nami kung kowi tawng chow achang takla mih ang tek en sow. Ang tek en mih maru kowi ang vüi alu kowi en naklai pe sau hanow en nanümnapah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4" />Now Samuel dow CHAKRAMANG tek pe iawng chang khai bowt. Bethlehem marow kowi aia kowting now nakowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa dow aia hown uang takrum khe kram kowh chürla kluk khai. Now amatni hawt lüntaah mih, “Saktuak thaulangma bow en uang?” pabüah khai.<verse eid="1SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5" />Nakhowk khe Samuel klangah mih, “Ow, saktuak thaulangma ang uang mih chekhai. CHAKRAMANG vüi tawncher hown nachang phuchua kownkow ang uang mih chowtaih. Naiawng rakowi tachim tasai büah hanow ang hown nami pawi tawi sun büa diah,” pape khai. Naiawng ki tek pe now aia dow Jese hai achapauüa kowi chimsaiah khai, now nami pawi tawi sun kownkow hawla khai.<verse eid="1SA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6" />Akung kowi Jese kowh chapauüa uang ting mih khin khe Eliab kowi khita now Samuel ka tuak mih, “CHAKRAMANG nümnapah kown mih maru nami naown bowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7" />Nachenganchepaw Samuel kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Apowm hai akro kowi hangkow mü diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow ang ruiah mih maru nadowi. Ang dow lusa maru mü iawng ang mü dowi chekhai. Lusa maru dow apowm kowi mü reng. Nachenganchepaw ang dow sak kowi chekhai mü reng,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8" />Nami kung kowi dow Jese mih achapa Abinadab kowi Samuel pur kowi kowpe kowiah khai. Nakhowk khe Samuel tek mih, “Mami paw CHAKRAMANG kloah mih maru nadowi,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9" />Nami kung kowi dow achapa Samma kowi Samuel pur kowi Jese kowpe kowiah khai. Nakhowk khe paw Samuel tek mih, “Nami paw CHAKRAMANG kloah mih maru nadowi,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10" />Naiawng hai Jese dow achapa ranit ia kowi Samuel pur iawng kowpe mangah khai. Nachenganchepaw Samuel tek pe mih, “Kowbüah dow lowk ia paw CHAKRAMANG kloah mih maru nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11" />Nami kung kowi Samuel tek pe Jese mih, “Kowbüah klen kowi en kowh chapa uowi dowi bowt bow?” pakhai. Now Jese klangah mih, “Lang sawi nowm nowm mih David uowi lowk ia tak; aia dow cham thing ruapur khai,” pape khai. Nakhowk khe Samuel tek pe mih, “Aia kowi nauang hawla kownkow kowchin maru diah. Makowi aia uang ting dowi mowr a-i nacha nakham kown nadowi tak,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12" />Naiawng rakowi Jese mih kowchin pe maru hanow achapa David kowi uang hawla khai. David kowh dow kow iungma, amik paw klangiungma, now apowm paw klangiungma chekhai. David uang ting hown krowksang CHAKRAMANG tek pe Samuel mih, “Rü now nami kowi nümnap bowt. Nami chowbowt ang ruiah mih maru,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13" />Nakhowk khe Samuel mih sau towk müa nang pawah now ataimowuüa pur kowi David kowi nümnapah khai. Nami ni hownia CHAKRAMANG kowh lümla dow David luk kowi uang uowi khai bowt. Nami kung kowi dow Samuel mih Rama marow kowi plan khai bowt.<verse eid="1SA 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawl kowh taraw tep mih David</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowh lümla dow Sawl kowi powtta khai bowt, now CHAKRAMANG uang chinah mih lümla ngak dow uangah hanow Sawl kowi lainowmma uang towkah ngare khai. <verse eid="1SA 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 16:15" />Nami khita hanow aia kowh naruüa tek pe Sawl mih, “Thurai uang chinah mih lümla ngak uangah now lainowmma uang towk en ngare khai. <verse eid="1SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 16:16" />Naiawng rakowi aw anging kowh chakramang, taraw tep akiakma mih maru kowi nakrawi cham en lowk ia kownkow pe anging ana diah. Thurai uang chinah mih lümla ngak uang towk en ngare mih khin khe aia dow pacham tep en taraw lah. Nahanow en naiung kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 16:17" />Nakhowk khe anaruüa kowi Sawl tek pe mih, “Naiawng now taraw tep akiakma mih maru kowi krawi cham büa diah, now aia kowi dow ang tut-e uang pawla büa diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 16:18" />Nakhowk khe anaruüa pungmadawng hownia lowk ia mih tek mih, “Bethlehem marow kowi Jese kowh chapa taraw tep akiakma mih ang tuk lowk ia. Aia dow sakkraingma mih siphai chekhai, now sangprowk laitek paw atukma. Nami klen kowi aia dow apowm paw klangiungma, now CHAKRAMANG paw aia tut-e tawi uowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 16:19" />Naiawng rakowi Sawl dow Jese tut-e kowchin maru hanow krawi tek pe mih, “En kowh chapa ruapur thing mih David kowi ang tut-e uang krawi chin ang diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 16:20" />Nami satang tata now Jese mih chak pik im kowi grep tui pa-im, rua chah papum hai kawm sangrumchow kawrngaramchük luk kowi krawi tang pe hanow achapa David kowi Sawl tut-e kowchinah khai.<verse eid="1SA 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 16:21" />Sawl tut-e kowting hanow David dow Sawl kowh lup mih uown chang pe khai bowt. Aia kowi dow lainowmma Sawl sakrauah khai, now aia dow Sawl kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng kawt mih chowng khai. <verse eid="1SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 16:22" />Akung kowi Sawl mih Jese tut-e kowchin pe maru hanow krawi tek pe mih, “David luk kowi lainowmma ang sak-ih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi sakrauma hown en chapa David kowi ang tut-e pe uowiah towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 16:23" />Now Thurai uang chinah mih lümla ngak Sawl luk kowi uang ting mih khin khe David dow tep pe taraw reng chekhai. Nahanow nami lümla ngak dow Sawl hownia powt reng chekhai, now Sawl dow kutplan iung reng chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1SA 17" />
  <para style="s">Israel siphaiuüa kowi Goliat toah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 17:1" />Akat dow Israeluüa kowi nakowsenah kownkow Filistinuüa mih kuala siphaiuüa now Juda krungchakuüa süng kowi kowh Soko marow kowi kowtarü khai. Amatni dow Soko marow hai Azeka marow takra kowi kowh Efes-Damim pami arah kowi uang khup tangbung khai. <verse eid="1SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 17:2" />Now Sawl hai Israeluüa dow takua talawm now Ela lawngrawi re-e kowh hungh kowi kowkhup tangbung khai, now Filistinuüa kowi nasenah kownkow amatni dow amatni kowh siphaiuüa kowi krawi towah khai. <verse eid="1SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 17:3" />Ela lawngrawi mapra kowh hungh kowi uowi mih dow Israel siphaiuüa chekhai, now paipra kowh hungh kowi uowi mih dow Filistin siphaiuüa chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 17:4" />Filistin siphaiuüa hownia aming Goliat pami dow tangbung khup rah hownia uang lawt hanow Israeluüa kowi uang toah khai. Aia dow Gat marowchak chekhai. Aia dow tasen kiakma mih maru, now akro paw taruk muk hown pakar chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 17:5" />Aia dow kri hown kowh lukruk krukma, now dam lip iawng thawpah mih kri kowrmow khupma chekhai. Nami kowrmow dik dow 55 set ngia chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 17:6" />Aia klowng kowi dow kungh hownia klingnik mowr kri hown tabamlut chekhai, now aia pangkawt kowi dow kri reh tauai hüah chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 17:7" />Aia kowh reh pung dow li iawng aiukma chekhai. Nami lawngha reh chem dik dow taruk set hown 800 gram chekhai. Aia kowh <char style="w">kawngma</char> dowk mih maru dow aia pur kowi rik mang reng chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 17:8" />Goliat dow iowngah now atünma Israeluüa kowi uang tek pe mih “Tawngplawng kowchow nadowk tasen kownkow enni uang tuk kamrüt khai? Ang dow Filistin siphaiuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh tasen kiakma mih siphai chaw; enni dow Sawl kowh nar chowtaih. Enni pungmadawng kowi rui maru lowk ia now ang tut-e uang haichin madiah. <verse eid="1SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 17:9" />Aia che ang hown tadowk tasen kowh nowng kowngta ang khai hanow enni kowh nar anging nachowng kown. Tawkchedow aia kowi che ang nowng kowngta khai hanow anging kowh nar enni nachowng kown takla. <verse eid="1SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 17:10" />Enni Israel siphaiuüa kowi dow mapaw ang hing kram dowi. Ang hown nauang dowk tasen kownkow uai chin ang maru lowk ia büah madiah,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 17:11" />Nami Goliat kowh laiklow tata now Sawl hai aia kowh siphaiuüa dow lainowmma kram khai.<verse eid="1SA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tasenra kowi Jese kowchin David mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 17:12" />Sawl chowm mang mih khin khe David kowh pa Jese dow lawngtangma khowk chekhai. Jese uowi mih dow Judauüa süng kowi kowh Bethlehem-Efrat marow kowi chekhai. Aia kowh dow chapa uowi raiat ia chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 17:13" />Aia kowh chapa ata mih sum ia dow Sawl hown tawi dowk tasen khai. Nami sum ia kowi lang ta mih dow Eliab, nami dak kowi dow Abinadab, now nami dak kowi kowh dow Samma chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 17:13" /><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="1SA 17:14-15" />Aia kowh chapauüa pungmadawng kowi lang sawi mih dow David chekhai. David kowh taimow sum ia dow Sawl kowh siphaiuüa tut-e tawi hing uowi khai. Nachenganchepaw David dow mang Sawl hownia Bethlehem kowi apa kowh ruapur thingra kowi khin khin kowmang reng chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 17:14-15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 17:16" />Goliat dow rau-e hai iak prakowi ni towng Israel siphaiuüa pur kowi uang tatüng reng chekhai. Naiawng hai aia dow 40 ni mowr Israel siphaiuüa kowi uang toah reng chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 17:17" />Akat khe David kowi a-pa tek pe mih, “En taimowuüa vüi mami püm ngai ia 18 set hai mami kawm hamüt pah mih pawla now siphaiuüa tangbung khup rah kowi alenma kowkowi diah. <verse eid="1SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 17:18" />Now mami iawn tui bawi keu hamüt dung mih dow 1,000 ia siphaiuüa luk kowi kowh aluchow vüi pawla pe dit. En taimowuüa tawng iawng chow uowi mih kowmü madiah, now amatni iung reng tak pami amatra uang pawla pachap diah. <verse eid="1SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 17:19" />Kawmat Sawl hai en taimowuüa hown Israel siphaiuüa maten uowi mih dow Ela lawngrawi kowi chekhai. Amatni dow Filistin siphaiuüa hown tasen thüm,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 17:20" />David dow murpa awr rü hanow aia kowh ruapur hawmh nata khet pe kownkow akeng mih ruapur thing mih lowk ia kowi ta pela pe kurdik khai. Nami kung kowi aia dow apa kowh ana pek iawng uanh maten pawla now tarü khai bowt. Tangbung khupra re-e aia kowting khe Israel siphaiuüa mih kowtadowk tasen kownkow hekla plala se arui alengma uang lawt thüm chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 17:21" />Israeluüa hai Filistinuüa dow natadowk tasen kownkow amatni kowh siphaiuüa kowi tatingtang klowk towah büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 17:22" />Nakhowk khe David dow aia uang pawla mih uanh maten uanh mingkhet mih tut-e ta towla now alenma siphaiuüa pungmadawng kowi kowkup khai, now aia dow ataimowuüa kowi kowpawah satang khai. <verse eid="1SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 17:23" />Now ataimowuüa hown David taklang thüm khe Gad marow hownia kowh Filistin siphai Goliat dow amatni kowh siphaiuüa pungmadawng hownia uang lawt khai iawk. Now ni towng kowh aia uang tek reng iawng Israel siphaiuüa kowi uang tek pe khai iawk. Nami laiklow dow David mih tawi ta khai.<verse eid="1SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 17:24" />Nakhowk khe Israel siphaiuüa maten dow Goliat kowi khita now kram kowh powt bowk khai. <verse eid="1SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 17:25" />Israel siphaiuüa tatek mih, “Paimi uang lawt rengreng mih maru kowi enni khi bow? Aia dow Israeluüa kowi uang toah reng chekhai. Paimi kowi nowng kowngta mih maru kowi dow dawngthawnguan ahuma napeah kown mih mang takham khai. Nami klen kowi paimi kowi nowng kowngta mih maru kowi dow aia kowh chama hown aia pe tachawngah kown pe, now nami maru kowh kimchak kowi dow tawng iawng mih mangmu paw aia napaw pe kown nadowi pe,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 17:26" />Nakhowk khe aia re-e kowh iowng miuüa kowi David lüntaah mih, “Paimi Filistin maru kowi nowng kowngta kowh Israeluüa kowh rukraira nowng henta mih maru kowi tawng chow napeah kown? Paimi hiah khampha uanpik dowi mih Filistin mia chekhai chow? Masing Thurai kowh siphaiuüa kowi natoah kown mih tawng tuk ka tuak khai,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 17:27" />Nahanow nami re-e kowh maru-uüa dow Goliat kowi nowng kowngta mih maru kowi tawng ngai chow napeah kown mih amatni rik tatek khe kowh iawng David kowi tek pe khai.<verse eid="1SA 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 17:28" />David kowh taimow Eliab dow naiawng maru hown David talawp mih tata hanow lainowmma kunmarau khai. David kowi aia tek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow makowi en uang tuk uang khai? Süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh en kowh ruapur hawmh mia tut-e chow en cham towla? En kowh bawri krang hai kiang ngak krang ang aiawng tuk. Makowi en uang tawi mü tasen iawk khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 17:29" />Nakhowk khe David klangah mih, “Tawng chow ang changta khai? Tawngpaw ang ia lünta dowk ü?” pape khai. <verse eid="1SA 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 17:30" />Naiawng tekla pe hanow David dow akeng miuüa tut-e nami lawnguan kowi krawi lünta khai iawk, now akeng miuüa paw nami powm iawng hawt tek pe khai iawk. <verse eid="1SA 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 17:31" />Now David tekah mih laiklow tata hanow akeng miuüa dow Sawl kowi kowphowng pe khai. Nakhowk khe Sawl dow David kowi aia tut-e nauang pawla kownkow kowchin maru khai.<verse eid="1SA 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 17:32" />Now David tek pe Sawl mih, “Paimi Filistin siphai kowi khi hanow hangkow nen sak büa diah. En kowh nar ang mih aia hown kowtasen sow,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 17:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 17:33" />Nakhowk khe Sawl tek pe mih, “Tawng iawng chow paimi Filistin hown en kowtasenah kown? En dow mani maiak kowh chah tak. Paimi Filistin dow asowmchow hownia kowh tasen akiakma mih siphai pai iow,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34-35" style="v" sid="1SA 17:34-35" />Sawl kowi David tek pe mih, “Ang dow apa kowh ruapur thing mih chowtaih. Tawkche khin khin ang cham thing ruapur khe krangsi ün, tawm ün uang mak ang ruapur hanow cham pawla reng chekhai. Nakhowk khe ang kawikrawiah now krangsi nawr hownia lah, tawm nawr hownia lah ang kowh ruapur kowi ang krawi lawngah reng chekhai. Nami khin khe krangsi hai tawm che namak ang kownkow uang chawm ang hanow angawng kowi ang hawt dowk pe now kowng pat ang bawpah reng chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 17:34-35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 17:36" />Mami en kowh nar rut kowi krangsi paw kowng khowk, now tawm paw kowng khowk chekhai. Paimi hiah khampha uanpik dowi mih Filistin paw naiawng dow ang rut kowi nakowng kown taih. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow masing Thurai kowh siphaiuüa kowi to mih chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 17:37" />Nami klen kowi David plan tek mih, “Krangsi hai tawm rut hownia kowh lawng ang reng mih CHAKRAMANG dow paimi Filistin rut hownia paw nalawng ang kown taih,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:37">Nakhowk khe David kowi Sawl tek pe mih, “Naiawng now kowtarü bowt. CHAKRAMANG dow pacham tawi uowila en reng lah,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 17:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 17:38" />Naiawng tek pe hanow Sawl mih aiamat kowh tasen tawnguat David kowi khup pe khai. Aia dow dam lip iawng mih kri kowrmow David kowi khup pe khai, now kri lukruk aia kruk pe khai. <verse eid="1SA 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 17:39" />Now nami tawnguat khupta kung kowi David mih Sawl kowh saidawng uaila now chaing mang khai. Naiawng mih tawnguat nami dowi rawn katpaw aia khup dowi tak rakowi aia dow tuk mang dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:39">Naiawng rakowi aia tek pe Sawl mih, “Maiawng mih tawnguat katpaw ang khup dowi tak chekhai. Naiawng rakowi maiawngün tawnguat khupma hown ang tuk mang dowi,” pape khai. Naiawng ki tek now aia dow naiawngün tawnguat klüpta khai. <verse eid="1SA 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 17:40" />Nami kung kowi dow aia kowh ruapur thing müa raitua dowkla now awchawng kowi cham kowi khai. Now huaklu chah alümpüchow kangowh mih aia cham lüm tanga klüng khai. Naiawngün dow aia cham thing ruapur khe kowh aia uaila reng mih chak pik im kowi aia phangah khai. Now aia kowh iaiba pawla now aia dow Goliat prakowi kowtarü khai bowt.<verse eid="1SA 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Goliat kowi iaiba hown David kowngta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 17:41" />Now Goliat paw David prakowi uang haimang khai. Goliat kowh kawngma dowk mih dow aia pur kowi rik mang khai. <verse eid="1SA 17:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 17:42" />Goliat dow David prakowi haimü hanow David kowi toah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow David dow kow iungma hai apowm klangiungma mih klanguüa tadowklowtchow mih taih tak chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 17:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 17:43" />Now David kowi Goliat tek pe mih, “Tawng en uang tuk pawla müa khai? En nüla ang kui bow?” pakhai. Now aia dow aia kowh thuraiuüa ming hown David kowi peah piati khai. <verse eid="1SA 17:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 17:44" />Nami klen kowi David kowi aia plan tek pe mih, “Uang haimang. Ani dow en kowh nga mih uakling uaber hawmh hai kaurawng uaramchak hawmh kowi ang pe chaah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 17:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 17:45" />Nakhowk khe Goliat kowi David tek pe mih, “Ang tut-e en uang mih dow saidawng hai reh ün dowkma chekhai. Nachenganchepaw en tut-e ang uang mih dow en toah reng mih lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG, Israel siphaiuüa kowh Thurai ming hown chowtaih. <verse eid="1SA 17:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 17:46" />Ani dow CHAKRAMANG mih ang rut kowi naapta en kown. Ani dow ang nasai en hanow ang nadungta en lu kown. Ani dow Filistin siphaiuüa kowh uak mih uakling uaber hawmh hai kaurawng uaramchak hawmh kowi ang nape chaah kown. Nami khi hanow Israel pren kowi Thurai tawi uowi chekhai pami lusa kowi kowh maru maten natuk bowt kown. <verse eid="1SA 17:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 17:47" />Now CHAKRAMANG dow aia maru-uüa kowi nalawngah kownkow saidawng hai reh lakke dowi chekhai pami ani kowh mami re-e uowi mih maten paw natuk bowt kown. Ani mih aia dow anging rut kowi naap enni kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow mami tasen dow CHAKRAMANG kowh tasen chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 17:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 17:48" />Now aia kowi nauang senah kownkow Goliat uang haimang thüm khe David paw Goliat prakowi haiiowm khai. <verse eid="1SA 17:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 17:49" />Now aia kowh im hownia iu paw huaklu lowk hanow aia kowh iaiba hown Goliat kau kowi awr ap-ah khai. Nami huaklu dow Goliat kau kowi kowkak hown krowksang Goliat dow tim krum khai. <verse eid="1SA 17:49" /><verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="1SA 17:50-51" />Nakhowk khe David mih alenma kowiowmah now Goliat ria kowi kowiowng khai. Now Goliat kowh saidawng kawp hownia iu howk saidawng hanow aia mih Goliat kowi dungta pe lu khai. Naiawng hai David mih iaiba hai huaklu lowkchow hown Goliat kowi nowngta khai. Aia rut kowi saidawng uowi dowi chepaw aia dow Goliat kowi nowng kowngta khai. Now amatni kowh tasen lang kiak mih kowng khai bowt mih khita hanow Filistin siphaiuüa dow tarowng powt khai bowt.<verse eid="1SA 17:50-51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 17:52" />Nakhowk khe Israeluüa hai Judauüa mih hekla plala se Gat hai Ekrawn marow tapplawt mowr Filistinuüa kowi kawikrawiah khai. Nakhowk khe Filistin siphai ka arau miuüa hai kowng miuüa uak dow Saraim hownia Gat hai Ekrawn marow mowr patiama rawng takuakla pan khai. <verse eid="1SA 17:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1SA 17:53" />Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih Filistinuüa kowi kawikrawi mih towta hanow Filistin siphaiuüa kowh tangbung khup rah kowi uang paw uanh büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 17:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1SA 17:54" />Akung kowi Goliat kowh lu dow Jerusalem marow kowi David uang pawla khai, now Goliat kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng hai tasen tawnguat dow aiamat kowh tangbung kowi David towah khai.<verse eid="1SA 17:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1SA 17:55" />Goliat hown kowtasen kownkow David tarü mih khita now aia kowh siphai aluchow Abner kowi Sawl lüntaah mih, “Abner, paimi klanguüa mia kowh chapa chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:55">Now Abner klangah mih, “Mangkri, en ming hown ang takham khowk, paimi klanguüa kowi ang tuk dowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 17:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1SA 17:56" />Nakhowk khe mang tek pe Abner mih, “Paimi klanguüa mia chapa chünchü krawi paw satang madiah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 17:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="1SA 17:57" />Now Goliat kowi kowngta kung kowi David uang plan khe Abner mih David kowi Sawl tut-e kowpawla khai. Nakhowk khe David dow Goliat kowh lu dowkla kawlaw chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 17:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1SA 17:58" />Now David kowi Sawl lüntaah mih, “Klanguüa, mia chapa chow en?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:58">Now David tek pe mih, “Ang dow Bethlehem marow kowi kowh en kowh nar Jese kowh chapa taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 17:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1SA 18" />
  <para style="s">Jonathan sakrau David mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="1SA 18:1-2" />Nami ni hownia bowt now Sawl mih David kowi aia tut-e towla khai, now a-pa tut-e pe mangah dowi bowt chekhai. Akung kowi Jonathan hai David iüah dow talek klowk chekhai. Jonathan dow David kowi lainowmma sakrauah khai. <verse eid="1SA 18:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 18:3" />Naiawng rakowi amatchi dow nata-auiua reng kownkow takham iüah khai. <verse eid="1SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 18:4" />Jonathan mih aia khupah mih kowrmow athawngma mih klüpah now David kowi peah khai. Nami klen kowi aia kowh tasen tawnguat, saidawng, <char style="w">leba</char> hai kekawm paw David kowi aia peah khai.<verse eid="1SA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 18:5" />David dow Sawl cham chinah mih arah maten kowi cham kowi reng chekhai, now aia dow cham awng reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow akeng mih siphaiuüa luk towah aluchow khai. Naiawng siphai aluchow rah David ka mih dow siphaiuüa hai maru maten paw tawi awmrawm pe khai.<verse eid="1SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">David kowi saita kownkow Sawl chang prengia mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 18:6" />Filistin siphai Goliat pami kowi David kowngta kung kowi dow siphaiuüa mih amatni kowh marow kowi uang plan khai bowt. Nakhowk khe Israel pren kowi kowh marow towng hownia masiuüa hawmh mih Sawl kowi uang chumah khai. Naiawngün masiuüa hawmh dow tekla awmrawm meng now plai se plai se uang tarü khai. Nami klen kowi sawkchow hai towmmow chah paw tepla büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 18:7" />Amatni dow plai se plai se tek meng mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 18:7">“Saul sai ransu-uüa mih dow athawng athawng ia chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 18:7">David sai ransu-uüa mih dow tasawng tasawng ia chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 18:8" />Nami meng tata hanow Sawl dow lainowmma kunmarau khai. Aia dow sak-ih dowi rakowi tek mih, “David sai ransu-uüa mih dow tasawng tasawng ia, now ang sai ransu-uüa mih dow athawng athawng iachow pami meng tawngplawng kowchow kowbüah tuk tek khai? Nami kung kowi dow David kowi nape chowmah mang kown mih klen kowi tawng chow uowi tak?” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 18:9" />Nami khin hownia bowt now Sawl mih David kowi hing irsita hüah chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 18:10" />Now auai ni khe dow Thurai hownia kowh lümla ngak mih Sawl tut-e uang uowi khai. Nahanow aia dow aia kim kowi thur burlur khai. Nakhowk khe David mih akeng ni khe kowh iawng aia pur kowi uangah now uang tep pe taraw khai. Nakhowk khe Sawl rut kowi dow reh uowi apung chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 18:11" />Aia dow kimbang kowi tadan klap mowr David kowi nasawtah kown mih sakdawng kowi tatuak khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow reh hown David kowi hürah pre kat khai. Nachenganchepaw David mih ia taplengta pe khai.<verse eid="1SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 18:12" />CHAKRAMANG dow David tut-e tawi uowi reng chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Sawl kowi dow CHAKRAMANG powtta khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi Sawl mih David kowi kramah khai. <verse eid="1SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 18:13" />Naiawng rakowi Sawl mih aia hownia David kowi akeng kowi cham chinta khai bowt, now siphai 1,000 ia kowi kowh aluchow thawpah khai. Nahanow David dow siphaiuüa hown cham tarü tasen khai. <verse eid="1SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 18:14" />Now aia tut-e CHAKRAMANG tawi uowi reng rakowi aia changah mih lup maten chawn reng chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 18:15" />Naiawng David kowh lup chawn reng mih khita hanow Sawl dow David kowi kramah ngamlam khai. <verse eid="1SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 18:16" />Nachenganchepaw David dow siphaiuüa kowi klangiungma kruitownah khai rakowi aia kowi dow Israeluüa hai Judauüa maten sakrauah khai.<verse eid="1SA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawl chama hown David tachawng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 18:17" />Pakat khe David kowi Sawl tek pe mih, “Ang kowh chama ta Merab hown ang pe tachawng en kown. Nami takcha kowi en mih sakkhawtma hai sakkraingma CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi ransu-uüa hown natasen kown takla,” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw Sawl kowh saktuak dow David kowi aia saiah dowi kowi Filistinuüa rut kowi nape kowngah kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 18:18" />Sawl kowi David tek pe mih, “Tawng iawng chow mang kowh mawkchow ang naia chowng kown chow? Ang hai ang kimchak dow tawngpaw nadowi chekhai,” pape khai. <verse eid="1SA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 18:19" />Nachenganchepaw David hown Merab iüah kowh tachawng khin uang ting khe dow Mehola kuachak Adriel hown Merab kowi Sawl pe tachawngta tüng khowk chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 18:20" />Nachenganchepaw Sawl kowh chama Mikal pami dow David kowi naukhi-ah khai. Nami laiklow mih Sawl kowi maru kowtekla pe hanow Sawl dow awmrawm khai. <verse eid="1SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 18:21" />Now aia ka tuak mih, “Ang kowh chama mih David kowi ang napeah kown. Nahanow David kowi Filistinuüa nakowngta kown mih tiama ang naka kown towbowt,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi David kowi aia tek pe iawk mih, “Ang kowh mawkchow chowng kown mih en plan ka khai iawk,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 18:22" />Aia kowh naruüa kowi Sawl peah ana mih, “Kukpa David hown kowtalawp büah madiah. Enni natek pe kown mih, ‘Sünta, mangkri mih en luk kowi lainowmma awmrawm chekhai, now aia kowh naruüa maten paw sak-ih en chekhai. Naiawng rakowi khaleng dow mang kowh mawkchow chowng towbowt,’ pape diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 18:23" />Naiawngün laiklow maten Sawl kowh naruüa ki tek pe David kung kowi David tek mih, “Mang kowh mawkchow nachowng kown mih iawngpa mih lup pabow enni ka tuak? Ang dow ngaraima hai iawngpa mih maru chowtaih,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 18:24" />David tekah mih srui Sawl kowh naruüa mih Sawl kowi uang tek pe khai. <verse eid="1SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 18:25" />Nakhowk khe anaruüa kowi Sawl tek pe mih, “David kowi enni natek pe kown mih, ‘Achama sung Filistinuüa kowh khampha uanpik 100 chowtaih pe mangkri nau. Nami klen kowi tawngpaw aia nau dowi pe,’ pape diah,” pakhai. Naiawng aia kük mih dow Filistinuüa rut kowi David pacham kowng lah pakowh chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 18:25" /><verse number="26-27" style="v" sid="1SA 18:26-27" />Sawl kowh naruüa mih nami laiklow David kowi kowtek pe hanow David dow awmrawm khai, now Sawl kowh mawkchow nachowng kown mih nauta khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi David mih Sawl tow pe akhin mih chi dowi rawn pawla siphaiuüa now Filistin 200 ia kowi kowsaita khai. Now Sawl kowh mawkchow nachowngla kownkow Filistinuüa kowh khampha uanpik mih hiala now Sawl kowi uang pawla pe khai. Nahanow Sawl mih achama Mikal kowi David hown pe tachawngah khai.<verse eid="1SA 18:26-27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 18:28" />David tut-e dow CHAKRAMANG tawi uowi reng, now achama Mikal paw David kowi sakrauah pami akung kowi Sawl tuk khai bowt. <verse eid="1SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 18:29" />Nakhowk khe Sawl dow David kowi lang kramah ngamlam khai. Naiawng hai aia kowng dowi mowr Sawl dow David kowh ransu chowngla khai.<verse eid="1SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 18:30" />Nami kung kowi Filistin siphaiuüa kowh aluchowuüa dow Israeluüa hown uang dowk tasen kownkow uang lawt khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni atungma sum büah khai. David dow akeng mih siphaiuüa lak-e Filistinuüa kowi lang saiah khai. Naiawng rakowi David kowh dow aming anang uang tahowng ngamlam khai.<verse eid="1SA 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1SA 19" />
  <para style="s">David kowi saita kownkow Sawl pe ana mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 19:1" />Akat khe David kowi nasaita kownkow Sawl mih achapa Jonathan hai aia kowh naruüa kowi peah ana khai. Nachenganchepaw Sawl kowh chapa Jonathan dow David kowi lainowmma sakrauah khai. <verse eid="1SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 19:2" />Naiawng rakowi Jonathan tek pe David mih, “Apa nasaita en kownkow kamrüt thüm khowk. Naiawng rakowi tharau mih uowiah kaneu diah. Tawng mih dowm kowi chünchü cham tapet diah. <verse eid="1SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 19:3" />Now en cham tapetah mih dowm kowi tharau khe apa kowi ang nauang pawla kown. Nakowi mih aia hown en lawnguan kowi ang natalawp kown, now tawng ngai chow aia natek kown mih akung kowi ang ta tek en sow,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 19:4" />Now auai rau dow David tapetah mih dowm kowi Jonathan mih a-pa kowi kowpawla khai bowt. Now a-pa kowi Jonathan tek pe mih, “Apa, en kowh nar David kowi kingküaah hai hangkow chang angak diah. Aia dow en luk kowi tawng iawng mih angak paw chang dowi chekhai; aia changta mowr kowi dow lainowmma en vüi iung chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 19:5" />Aia dow kowng kown tuakla dowi kowi Filistin siphai Goliat kowi kowsenah now saita khai. Now CHAKRAMANG mih Israeluüa maten kowi kri kraingma pe awngah khai. Naiawngün khi hanow en awmrawm chowdiah mowna. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow auan uowi dowi matchang aprek uowi dowi mih David kowi saita hanow tawngplawng kowchow nachang angak kown mih en tuk kamrüt khai?” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 19:6" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Sawl tek mih, “Masing CHAKRAMANG ming hown ang takham khowk, David kowi mih ang saiah kown nadowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 19:7" />Akung kowi dow Jonathan mih David kowi hawah now naiawngün laiklow maten tek pe khai. Now aia kowi dow a-pa Sawl tut-e Jonathan mih kowpawla khai. Nahanow David dow auown khe kowh iawng Sawl tut-e tawi plan uowi khai bowt.<verse eid="1SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 19:8" />Akat khe Filistinuüa hown Israeluüa dow plan tasen khai iawk. Nakhowk khe David mih Filistinuüa kowi sai chamang krawi saiah khai. Naiawng rakowi Filistinuüa dow aia pur hownia apowt takla khai.<verse eid="1SA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">David kowi amasi Mikal lawngah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 19:9" />Pakat khe CHAKRAMANG uang chinah mih lümla ngak dow Sawl luk kowi uang plan uowi khai iawk. Nakhowk khe Sawl dow aia kim kowi reh dowkma chowm phülü khai, now David mih tawi tep pe taraw khai. <verse eid="1SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 19:10" />Nakhowk khe aia dow kimbang kowi nadanta krap kownkow David kowi reh hown hürah chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw David taplengta pe khai rakowi reh mih kimbang kowi kowtaphük chak khai. Nami iak dow nami hownia David powt now ia plai khai.<verse eid="1SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 19:11" />Now auai rau khe David kowi nasaiah kownkow nami iak khe David kim kowi Sawl kowchin maru sangrum khai. Nachenganchepaw nami iak khe David kowi amasi Mikal tek pe mih, “Aiak che en powt dowi hanow tharau dow maru nasai en kown chowbowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 19:12" />Now amasi Mikal mih tawngpawk hownia David kowi iu klaah khai, now David dow cham powt hanow ia plai khai. <verse eid="1SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 19:13" />Nakhowk khe Mikal mih aia kim kowi kowh arup aren krawi pawah now David mawk rah kowi kowtowah khai, now iüaluk kowi dow rua pawi hown kowh lungüa tow pe khai. Nami kung kowi dow naiawngün mih uan hown aia mumta khai.<verse eid="1SA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 19:14" />David kowi nakhümah kownkow Sawl kowchinah mih maru-uüa kowi Mikal hawt tek pe mih, “Ang hua arau uowi khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 19:15" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Sawl dow David kowi nauang pawla kownkow naiawngün maru-uüa kowi kowchinah khai iawk. Aia krawi tek pe mih, “David kowi mawk rah hailawm uang pawla büah. Aia kowi dow ang nakowngta kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 19:16" />Now naiawngün maru-uüa mih David kim lak kowi kowkup hanow mawk rah kowi arup aren hai rua pawi hown kowh lungüa kowkhi khai.<verse eid="1SA 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 19:17" />Nami kung kowi Sawl tek pe Mikal mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng en tuk kuan ang khai? Tawngplawng kowchow ang kowh ransu kowi en pe powtta khai?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:17">Nakhowk khe Mikal klangah mih, “Aia tek ang mih, ‘Pe powt ang diah. Nadowi now ang nasaita en kown,’ pah ang khai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawl hai aia maru-uüa luk kowi Thurai Lümla uang uowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 19:18" />David dow aia kim hownia powt hanow Rama marow kowi Samuel tut-e kowkowi khai, now aia kowi Sawl nakowngta kownkow kamrüt mih lawnguan Samuel kowi aia tek pe khai. Nami kung kowi dow David hai Samuel iüah mih Naiawt pami arah kowi kowuowi khai. <verse eid="1SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 19:19" />Now Rama marow kowi kowh Naiawt pami arah kowi David uowi mih satang dow Sawl tawi ta khai bowt. <verse eid="1SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 19:20" />Sawl dow nami satang tata hanow David kowi nakowkhüm kownkow kowchin maru khai. Naiawngün maru-uüa dow Naiawt pami arah kowi kowting hanow Samuel nimkrüa kowi tek Thurai lai mih risiuüa kowi kowkrum pathum khai. Nakhowk khe Sawl kowh maru-uüa luk kowi paw Thurai Lümla uang ting hanow amatni paw risi iawng hai tawi tek Thurai lai khai. <verse eid="1SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 19:21" />Nami satang dow Sawl kowi maru uang phowng pe hanow Sawl dow kowplan chin maru pathum khai iawk. Nachenganchepaw naiawngün maru-uüa paw risi iawng hai kowtawi tek Thurai lai khai. Nami kung kowi paw Sawl mih kowplan chin maru pathum khai iawk, now nami maru-uüa paw risi iawng hai kowtawi tek Thurai lai khai iawk. <verse eid="1SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 19:22" />Achur kowi dow Sawl matia mih Rama marow kowi kowtarü khai bowt. Now Seku pami arah kowi kowh tuikuam aiukma mih re-e aia kowting khe nakowi kowh maru kowi aia lüntaah mih, “Samuel hai David iüah tawng kowi chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:22">Nakhowk khe maru lowk ia klangah mih, “Rama marow kowi kowh Naiawt pami arah kowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 19:23" />Naiawng rakowi Sawl dow Rama marow kowi kowh Naiawt pami arah prakowi tarü khai. Nachenganchepaw aia luk kowi paw Thurai Lümla mih uang ting khai. Nahanow aia dow Naiawt pami arah kowi ting dowi mowr patiama rawng risi iawng hai tekla Thurai lai khai. <verse eid="1SA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 19:24" />Aia dow aia kowh tawnguat klüpla now Samuel pur kowi risi iawng hai kowtek Thurai lai khai. Aia dow ni chut uar prowt tengiow tengklaima krawng kowi mawk khai. Naiawng rakowi maru-uüa tatek mih, “Naiawng now Sawl paw risi chekhai bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 19:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1SA 20" />
  <para style="s">David kowi Jonathan khowngah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 20:1" />Nami kung kowi dow David mih Rama marow kowi kowh Naiawt hownia powt now Jonathan tut-e kowkowi khai. Now Jonathan kowi aia tek pe mih, “Tawng chow ang changta khai? Ang kowh atawi ama tawng chow? En pa luk kowi tawng angak chow ang changta khai? Tawngplawng kowchow nasaita ang kownkow en pa tuk kamrüt khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 20:2" />Nakhowk khe Jonathan klangah mih, “Mapaw apa kowngta en dowi tham iow! Apa dow tekla ang dowi matchang tawng lup paw chang dowi chekhai. Now tawng rakowi chow nakowngta en kown mih laiklow apa naitta ang kown?” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 20:3" />Nachenganchepaw David tek pe Jonathan iawk mih, “En sakrau ang mih achima en pa tuk chekhai. Naiawng rakowi en sak kowi rau lai pakowh aia nasai ang kown mih lawnguan tekla en dowi tham chepaw naia. Tawkchedow masing CHAKRAMANG ming hai en ming lüklaula se ang tek khowk, ang kowh dow nakowng kown mih khin atawnchow towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 20:4" />Nakhowk khe Jonathan tek pe mih, “Naiawng now en vüi tawng chow ang chang en kown mih tek ang diah. En tek ang iawng ang chang en kown towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 20:5" />Now David tek pe mih, “Tharau dow Lacher Pawi chowbowt. Nami pawi kowi mangkri hown ang tawi taiua cha chakkham kown mih laiklow uowi. Nachenganchepaw en mih pe powt ang diah. Thowi iak mowr dow dowm kowi ang cham tapet tak. <verse eid="1SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 20:6" />En pa che chet ang khai hanow en natek pe kown mih, ‘David mih amatni marow Bethlehem kowi nakowkowi dowkchow kownkow ang tut-e uang lü ana khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni marow kowi aia kowh krungchakuüa mih tawncher hown ningma phuchua pawi chang thüm pe,’ pape diah. <verse eid="1SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 20:7" />Nakhowk khe aia che, ‘Iung towbowt,’ pakhai hanow nami dow ang vüi iung chekhai. Tawkchedow aia che lainowmma kunmarau khai hanow aia nachang ang angak kownkow aia kamrütta hüah pami tukah diah. <verse eid="1SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 20:8" />Naiawng rakowi en dow ang kaah sakowm iawng uowi ang diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG kowi towla saksi khükhü achi dow takham khowk chekhai. Ang che en pa kowi kingküala mih angak ang changta khai hanow en matia ngengche mih sai ang diah; en pa rut kowi ap ang kla dowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 20:9" />Now Jonathan tek pe David mih, “Naiawng mapaw hangkow tuak. Nachang en angak kownkow apa kamrüt mih che ang tuk khai hanow ang natek en ngengche kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 20:10" />Nakhowk khe David tek pe mih, “En pa kunmarau khai hanow mia chow nauang tek ang kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 20:11" />Now Jonathan tek pe mih, “Chu, dowm kowi achi kowkowi diah sik,” pakhai. Now amatchi dow dowm kowi kowkowi khai.<verse eid="1SA 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 20:12" />Now Jonathan tek pe David mih, “Mami laiklow mih CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai kowi towla saksi khükhü ang tek khowk. Tharau nadowi now thowirau kowh maiawng khin khe apa hown ang natalawp kown. Nakhowk khe aia che nachang en aiung kown mih laiklow tek khai hanow ang nauang chin en maru now ang tek en sow. <verse eid="1SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 20:13" />Nachenganchepaw apa che nachang en angak kown mih laiklow tek khai, now nami lawnguan ang tek en dowi hai thaulangma ang pe powt en dowi kowh chalow now CHAKRAMANG mih rip chamang pacham rip ang lah. CHAKRAMANG dow apa tut-e tawi uowi khe kowh iawng en tut-e paw pacham tawi uowi lah. <verse eid="1SA 20:13" /><verse number="14-16" style="v" sid="1SA 20:14-16" />Ang uowi mowr dow CHAKRAMANG kowh sakraura achur uowi dowi mih iawng en paw sakrau ang diah. CHAKRAMANG mih en kowh ransu-uüa maten kowi chumta en kung kowi ang kowng khai bowt chepaw ang krungchakuüa kowi en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hown sakraula reng diah. Achi takham mih dow katpaw hang pacham piak lah; en che piakta khai hanow CHAKRAMANG mih pacham rip en lah,” pape khai. <verse eid="1SA 20:14-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 20:17" />Jonathan dow David kowi aiamat tasakrau iawng sakrauah khai. Naiawng rakowi David paw aia kowi nasakrauah kownkow David kowi pe takhamah khai.<verse eid="1SA 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 20:18" />Nami kung kowi David kowi Jonathan tek pe mih, “Tharau dow Lacher Pawi chowbowt. Mangkri hawm chakra kowi en kowh chowm rah akhawma mih khita now en uowi dowi mih dow natuk kown towbowt. <verse eid="1SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 20:19" />Naiawng rakowi en kowrik tapetah mih dowm kowi thowirau khe alenma kowkowi diah, now nakowi kowh huaklu aiukma mih ria kowi hawt chawng ang diah. <verse eid="1SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 20:20" />Nakowi mih ang nauangah hanow chaing lakman mih iow ang nachang kown. Nami huaklu ria kowi leba sek sum sek ang nauai ap kown. <verse eid="1SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 20:21" />Nakhowk khe ang nauai chin ngeuüa chah lowk ia kown. Aia kowi ang natek pe kown mih, ‘Kowkowi now paimi leba sek kowkrawi cham dit,’ ang pape kown. Now aia kowi che, ‘Leba sek nami re-e ni. Kowlüm now uaipawla dit’ pahai ang tek pe khai hanow en mih uaimang towbowt. Tawngpaw kaah kram dowi. Masing CHAKRAMANG ming hown ang tek khowk. <verse eid="1SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 20:22" />Nachenganchepaw nami ngeuüa kowi che, ‘Leba sek pai kowi tak pai,’ pahai ang tek pe khai hanow en mih powt towbowt. CHAKRAMANG pe powt en mih chowbowt padow ka tuakah towbowt. <verse eid="1SA 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 20:23" />Achi takham mih kowi kowh saksi dow chowngchowng saksakma pat CHAKRAMANG chekhai pami sak kowi towah diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="1SA 20:24-25" />Nami kung kowi dow David mih dowm kowi kowtapet khai bowt. Now Lacher Pawi uang tauown hanow mang dow nacha chakkham kownkow chang Lacher Pawi reng khe kowh iawng kimbang ria kowi aia kowh chowm rah kowi chowm khai. Nakhowk khe Jonathan dow a-pa hown tatingtang klowk chowm khai, now Abner dow Sawl ria kowi chowm khai. Nachenganchepaw David kowh chowm rah dow akhawma chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 20:24-25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 20:26" />Nami ni dow David uowi dowi chepaw Sawl mih tawngpaw tek dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow tawng chü own kowh tasür talawk kowh naown David uang tawi towm dowi mih padow aia ka tuak khai. <verse eid="1SA 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 20:27" />Nachenganchepaw auai ni khe paw David kowh chowm rah dow akhawma rengreng chekhai. Nakhowk khe dow achapa Jonathan kowi Sawl lüntaah mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow Jese kowh chapa David uang tawi cha chakkham dowi? Mani paw uang dowi, ani paw uang dowi kowbow?” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 20:28" />Jonathan klangah mih, “Bethlehem marow kowi nakowkowi kownkow David mih ang tut-e lainowmma uang lü ana khai. <verse eid="1SA 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 20:29" />Aia tek ang mih, ‘Sakrauma hown Bethlehem marow kowi pe kowi ang diah. Ang kowh krungchakuüa mih marow kowi chang phuchua pawi thüm, now nakowi ang kowtawi uowi ngengche kownkow ang taimowuüa krawi ma ang khai. Naiawng rakowi en che saksing sana ang khai hanow ang taimowuüa hown kowtakrum kownkow pe ang ana diah,’ pakhai. Naiawng rakowi chowbowt aia mih mangkri kowh pawi kowi uang tawi ia towm dowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 20:30" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Sawl dow achapa Jonathan luk kowi lainowmma kunmarau khai. Aia tek pe Jonathan mih, “Aw iang chang mih masiuüa kowh iang chah ow! Jese kowh chapa kowi en tawi tangila mih ang tuk dowi pabow? En hai en u luk kowi en uang pawla rukraira mih ang tuk dowi pabow? <verse eid="1SA 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 20:31" />Lusa kowi Jese kowh chapa sing uowi mowr dow mapaw en ka chowm mang kown nadowi pami en tuk tak bow? Naiawng rakowi kawmat alenma kowchin maru hanow aia kowi mih ang tut-e uang pawla diah. Aia dow nakowng ngengche kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 20:32" />Now a-pa kowi Jonathan tek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow aia akowng takla khai? Tawng angak chow aia changta khai?” pape khai. <verse eid="1SA 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 20:33" />Nakhowk khe Sawl mih Jonathan kowi nakowngta kownkow reh hown hürah khai. Nami hownia Jonathan dow David kowi nakowngta ngengche kownkow a-pa kamrüt ching pami tuk khai bowt.<verse eid="1SA 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 20:34" />Now Jonathan dow kunmarau lai kowh hawm chakra hownia rü now powt khai. Nakow ni dow pawi kowi kowh chakkham mih tawngpaw aia tawi chala dowi chekhai. Naiawng David kowi a-pa changah angak kown pami rakowi aia kowh dow lainowmma sak kowi rau khai.<verse eid="1SA 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 20:35" />Now David hown aia kowh laikham uowi iawng Jonathan dow auai rau lawt hanow dowm kowi kowkowi khai bowt. Now ngeuüa chah kowi paw aia pawla lowk ia khai. <verse eid="1SA 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 20:36" />Nami ngeuüa chah kowi aia tek pe mih, “Hai iowm madiah, ang haiapah kown mih leba sek kowlüm now uang pawla madiah,” pakhai. Now nami ngeuüa chah haiiowm thüm khe aia dow ngeuüa chah hown alakma haiap leba sek lowk khai. <verse eid="1SA 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 20:37" />Now leba sek dowh rah re-e nami ngeuüa chah kowting khe Jonathan tek pe mih, “Leba sek pai kowi tak pai,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 20:38" />Nami kung kowi dow atünma aia tek pe mih, “Alenma haiiowm diah, hangkow tanai,” pakhai. Now nami ngeuüa chah dow lümla leba sek now Jonathan tut-e uang plan khai. <verse eid="1SA 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 20:39" />Nachenganchepaw naiawngün auan mih nami ngeuüa chah dow tuk dowi chekhai; Jonathan hai David iüah chowtaih tuk. <verse eid="1SA 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 20:40" />Nami kung kowi dow Jonathan mih aia kowh leba hai leba sek nami ngeuüa chah kowi ap pe now tek pe mih, “Maiawngün pawla now marow kowi kowplan towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 20:41" />Now nami ngeuüa chah mang kung kowi dow David mih mrawkphak pra kowh hua ria hownia uang awr pün khai. Aia dow Jonathan pur kowi uangah now tabawk krawm se Jonathan kowi chupah sum kat khai. Nami kung kowi amatchi dow tanam awm hanow kar iüah khai, nachepaw lang kar mih dow David chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 20:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 20:42" />David kowi Jonathan tek pe mih, “Thaulangma hown powt towbowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow achi hai achi kowh krungchakuüa chowngchowng saksakma natasakrau kownkow achi takham mih dow CHAKRAMANG saksi chowbowt,” pakhai. Nami kung kowi dow David mih powt khai bowt, now Jonathan paw marow prakowi plan khai bowt.<verse eid="1SA 20:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1SA 21" />
  <para style="s">David cha Chimsaima mih kawm mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 21:1" />Jonathan pur hownia powt hanow David dow Nawb marow kowi kowh uamow Ahimelek tut-e kowkowi khai. Nakhowk khe Ahimelek mih kram kowh chur klukluk se David pur kowi uang khai. Now David kowi aia lüntaah mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow en malowkchow? En hown miapaw uang tawi dowi bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 21:2" />Nakhowk khe David kuanah mih, “Nachang pe lup lowk kownkow mang uang chin ang mih chowbowt. Aia kowh lup dow maru tawi tuk dowi iawng aia uang pe chang ang mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi akung kowi ang maru-uüa hown natakrum kownkow amülüng mih arah ang khowm pe khowk. <verse eid="1SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 21:3" />En tut-e chakkham uowi ne dowi bow? En ia pe ang kawm tanga pah kown bow? Nadowi now akeng mih chakkham chepaw pe ang ne dit,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 21:4" />Now uamow tek pe mih, “Ang tut-e dow iawngpa mih kawm uowi dowi kowbow! CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowh towah mih chimsaima mih kawm taih uowi. En kowh maru-uüa che masiuüa hown cham taphua taiua dowi hanow nami kawm enni naia cha kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 21:5" />Nakhowk khe David tek pe mih, “Mapaw dai dowi, tawng iawng mih masiuüa hown paw anging taphua taiua dowi. Iawngpa mih lup cham chang kownkow cham kowi khe khowm padow masiuüa hown ang kowh maru-uüa taphua taiua dowi chekhai. Mami ngam padow apankrima mih lup chedow mapaw ang kowh maru-uüa tasür talawk dowi chekhai,” pape khai. <verse eid="1SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 21:6" />Naiawng rakowi naiawngün kawm mih David kowi uamow peah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün kawm klen kowi dow tawng kawm paw aia tut-e uowi dowi chekhai. CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowh kawm prim henta hanow naiawngün kawm den dow nami ni kowh towah mih tak chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 21:7" />(Nami ni khe Edawm prenchak Doeg pami Sawl kowh nar paw nakowi uowi lowk ia. Aia dow Sawl kowh tawncher thing miuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh lang kri mih chekhai. Aia dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e takhamta mih iawng nauang chang kownkow nakowi uang mih chekhai).<verse eid="1SA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 21:8" />Ahimelek kowi David lüntaah mih, “Makowi en tut-e reh chepaw, saidawng chepaw uowi ne dowi bow? Mang kowh ana pek den lai rakowi ang matia kowh saidawng hai ang kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng tawngpaw ang ia pawla dowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 21:9" />Nakhowk khe uamow tek pe mih, “Ela lawngrawi kowi kowh en saiah mih Filistin siphai Goliat pami kowh saidawng makowi uowi apung. Nami saidawng dow ephawd kowrmow kung prakowi uan hown duata hüah. En che nau now nami saidawng en ia paw. Nami klen kowi dow tawng iawng mih saidawng paw uowi dowk chekhai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 21:9">David tek pe mih, “Nami saidawng lak-e lang iung mih uowi dowi bowt. Nami saidawng pe ang bowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">David chang thuk iow mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 21:10" />David dow kram Sawl kowh nami ni khe nami hownia kutplan powt hanow Gat marow kowi kowh mang Akhis tut-e kowkowi khai. <verse eid="1SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 21:11" />Nakhowk khe Akhis kowh maru iukuüa tek pe Akhis mih, “Aia pren kowi chowm mang mih David nami chowbowt nadowi bow?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 21:11" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 21:11">“‘Saul sai ransu-uüa mih dow athawng athawng ia chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 21:11">David sai ransu-uüa mih dow tasawng tasawng ia chekhai,’ pahai plai se maru tek meng mih aia lawnguan kowi chowbowt nadowi bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 21:12" />David dow naiawngün laiklow sak kowi towah khai, now aia dow mang Akhis kowi lainowmma kram khai. <verse eid="1SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 21:13" />Naiawng rakowi aia dow amatni pur kowi uowi mowr mih chang thuk iow khai. Aia dow athukma mih iawng tapplawt büng kowi krawi ke naklak khai, now aia kowh mawmpawi luk kowi kriapawp talowi chualua changah khai.<verse eid="1SA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 21:14" />Nakhowk khe aia kowh maru iukuüa kowi Akhis tek pe mih, “Nami maru athukma mih enni khi khowk nadowi bow? Tawngplawng kowchow nami maru kowi ang tut-e enni uang tuk pawla khai? <verse eid="1SA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 21:15" />Athukma mih maru kowi ang khawr mih nowm pabow? Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng athuklama mih kowi ang kim kowi enni uang tuk pawla khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 21:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1SA 22" />
  <para style="s">Adulam marow re-e kowh puk kowi David kowtapet mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 22:1" />Gat marow hownia powt hanow David dow Adulam marow re-e kowh puk kowi kowtapet khai. Nami satang tata hanow ataimowuüa hai a-pa kimchakuüa mih aia tut-e kowkowi khai. <verse eid="1SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 22:2" />Nami klen kowi kla phih miuüa, nowng sat lowi dowi rakowi kham ngare miuüa hai sak kowi ta-ihra uowi dowi miuüa maten paw David tut-e kowkowi khai. Naiawng hai David tut-e kowtakua talawm mih maru iun dow 400 ia ngia chekhai, now David dow amatni kowh aluchow chowng pe khai.<verse eid="1SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 22:3" />Nami kung kowi David mih nami hownia Moab pren kowi kowh Mizpe marow kowi kowkowi khai. Now Moab pren mang kowi aia tek pe mih, “Thurai naukrang ang tuk dowi mowr sakrauma hown a-u hai apa iüah kowi en tut-e towla diah snow,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 22:4" />Nami laiklow mang nauta pe hanow aia dow a-u a-pa iüah kowi uang pawla khai, now Moab pren mang tut-e uang towah khai. Akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim kowi David cham tapet mowr amatchi dow Moab pren mang tut-e tawi uowi khai.<verse eid="1SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 22:5" />Akung kowi Gad pami risi lowk ia tek pe David mih, “Mami akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim kowi hang uowi tham bowt. Judauüa süng kowi kowkowi bowt,” pakhai. Nahanow David mih nami hownia powt now Heret pami kaurawng kowi kowkowi khai.<verse eid="1SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uamowuüa kowi Sawl saita mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 22:6" />Now David hai aia kowh maru-uüa kowi khita khowk pami satang akung kowi Sawl ta khai bowt. Nakhowk khe Sawl dow Gibeah marow re-e kowh hungh kowi painglang singh tut re-e chowm phülü khai. Nami khin khe aia dow reh dowkma chekhai, now aia kowh maru iukuüa maten dow aia riaret kowi iowngla rim chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 22:7" />Aia kowh maru iukuüa kowi Sawl tek pe mih, “Benjamin krungchakuüa low, sünta büa diah. Enni bowkbowk kowi krawng bawn hai grep krum Jese kowh chapa nape enni kown pabow? Enni bowkbowk kowi 1,000 ia siphai luk kowi kowh aluchow chepaw, 100 ia siphai luk kowi kowh aluchow chepaw aia nathawp enni kown pabow? <verse eid="1SA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 22:8" />Naiawng now tawng rakowi chow enni bowkbowk kingküa ang kown mih enni tuk sangkrang khai? Jese kowh chapa hai ang chapa iüah tatow sangbowk laitawm mih enni tek ang dowi chekhai. Nami klen kowi kawmat ang kowh nar David kowi ang chapa tawi pe pe kür mih paw enni tekla ang dowi chekhai. Ang vüi kowi miapaw enni tuak dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 22:9" />Nami khin khe Edawm prenchak Doeg paw Sawl kowh maru iukuüa ria kowi tawi uowi chekhai. Now Doeg tek mih, “Jese kowh chapa mih Nawb marow kowi kowh Ahitub chapa Ahimelek tut-e kowkowi mih ang khi. <verse eid="1SA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 22:10" />Tawng chow David achang takla kown mih natukla kownkow CHAKRAMANG tut-e Ahimelek awr lünta pe khai. Nami klen kowi chakkham hai Filistin siphai Goliat kowh saidawng paw David kowi aia peah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 22:11" />Nami laiklow tata hanow mang Sawl dow Ahitub kowh chapa uamow Ahimelek kowi hai Nawb marow kowi kowh chang uamow lup mih a-pa kimchakuüa maten kowi nakowhaw kownkow kowchin maru khai. Nahanow Ahimelek hai a-pa kimchakuüa maten dow Sawl tut-e uang khai bowt. <verse eid="1SA 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 22:12" />Nakhowk khe Sawl hawt tek pe mih, “Sünta, Ahitub kowh chapa,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 22:12">Now Ahimelek klangah mih, “Tek bowt mangkri,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 22:13" />Now Sawl tek pe mih, “Nasaita ang kownkow Jese chapa enchi tawngplawng kowchow tuk sangkrang ang khai? Aia kowi dow kawm hai saidawng en peah khai, now aia lawnguan kowi tawng chow Thurai nau changah kown mih paw en awr lünta pe khai. Kawmat mowr pat nowng kingküala ang kownkow hai nanowng pawmla ang kownkow aia kowi en tawi khowngah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 22:14" />Nakhowk khe Ahimelek klangah mih, “Mangkri, en kowh naruüa maten kowi en kowh mawkchow David iawng kaah sakowm mih maru mia chow uowi? Aia dow kawmat paw en kowh chawng mih siphaiuüa kowh aluchow chekhai, now en kimchakuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh ringkawra uowima mih mawkchow chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 22:15" />Tawng chow achang takla mih natukla kownkow Thurai tut-e David vüi ang awr lünta pe mih dow khaleng akatchow nadowk chekhai. David saita en kown nau mih lawnguan kowi tawngpaw ang tuk dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aw mangkri, ang hai ang kimchakuüa luk kowi hauang tang anging aprek diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 22:16" />Nachenganchepaw mang tek pe iawk mih, “Ahimelek, en hai en kimchakuüa maten nakowng ngengche kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 22:17" />Nami kung kowi mang dow aia riaret kowi kowh uowi mih siphaiuüa kowi tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG kowh uamowuüa maten kowi kowkowiah now kowsaita büa diah. Kowbüah dow David prakowi tawi tangi mih maru chekhai. Now David powt mih paw tuk büah chekhai. Tawkchedow naiawngün lawnguan kowi tek ang büah dowi chekhai,” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw mang kowh siphaiuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowh uamowuüa kowi natang rut kown mih miapaw nauta dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 22:18" />Naiawng rakowi Edawm prenchak Doeg pami kowi mang tek pe mih, “Naiawng now uamowuüa kowi en phai kowsai bowt,” pakhai. Nami ni khe Doeg dow 85 ia uamow kowi saita khai. Naiawngün uamowuüa dow adipükchow mih la hown kowh ephawd kowrmow khupma kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 22:19" />Nami kung kowi Sawl dow uamowuüa kowh uowi rah Nawb marow kowi kowkowiah now nakowi kowh uowi mih maten saita bowk khai. Naiawngün dow masiuüa kachakuüa, ngeuüa hai ingrikchow, now chia, kawrngaramchük hai ruapur uowi mih maten chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 22:20" />Nakhowk khe Ahimelek kowh chapa Abiathar dow David tut-e kownowng powt khai. Ahimelek kowh pa dow Ahitub chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 22:21" />Now aia dow CHAKRAMANG kowh uamowuüa kowi Sawl saita bowk mih satang David kowi kowphowng pe khai. <verse eid="1SA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 22:22" />Nami satang tata hanow David tek pe Abiathar mih, “Makha enni kowh marow kowi ang uang khe Edawm prenchak Doeg kowi ang khi hownia aia dow Sawl kowi kowtek pe ngengche kown pami ang ka tuak khai. En kimchakuüa kowng mih dow ang rakowi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 22:23" />Ang tut-e tawi uowi towbowt, kaah kram dowi. Nasaita en kown kamrüt miuüa dow ang kowi paw nasaita ang kown kamrüt khai. Nachenganchepaw ang tut-e dow thaulangma en naia uowi kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 22:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1SA 23" />
  <para style="s">David kowlawng Keila marow mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 23:1" />Akat khe David kowi maru-uüa uang tek pe mih, “Keila marow kowi Filistinuüa uang senah thüm, now kuata thowi mih luprak krawi rup büah thüm,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 23:2" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG kowi David lüntaah mih, “Filistinuüa kowi ang kowsenah kown bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:2">Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG klangah mih, “Ow, kowsen bowt. Filistinuüa kowi kowsenah now kowlawng Keila marow diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 23:3" />Nachenganchepaw aia kowh siphaiuüa tek pe David mih, “Mami Judauüa süng kowi khowm padow Sawl kowi kram se a-i uowi mih chekhai. Nami luk kowi Keila marow kowi Filistinuüa kowi a-i kowsen kown mih kramra lang uowi ngamlam nadowi ü?” pabüah khai.<verse eid="1SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 23:4" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowi David plan lüntaah khai iawk. Now CHAKRAMANG plan klangah mih, “Keila marow kowi kowkowi diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Filistinuüa kowi mih en rut kowi ang naap en bowt kown,” pape khai. <verse eid="1SA 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 23:5" />Nami laiklow tata now David mih aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi pawla now Keila marow kowi kowkowi khai, now Filistinuüa kowi kowsenah khai. Nakhowk khe amatni dow Filistinuüa kowi akawmma saila khai, now amatni kowh tawncher mih ahuma uang pawla pe khai. Naiawng hai Keila marowchakuüa kowi David lawngah khai.<verse eid="1SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 23:6" />Ahimelek kowh chapa Abiathar mih Keila marow kowi David tut-e uang powt khe ephawd kowrmow uang pawla khai. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG kowh naukrang natukla kownkow aia uang pawla mih chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawl kawikrawi David mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 23:7" />Keila marow kowi David uowi pami satang tata now Sawl tek mih, “Khaleng dow David kowi ang rut kowi CHAKRAMANG ap-ah mih chowbowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow tap uowi mih marow kowi aia kowkup hanow kowtakhang mih chowbowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 23:8" />Sawl dow Keila marow kowi kowkowi hanow David hai aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi rumta lut now nasenah kownkow aia kowh siphaiuüa maten kowi kuaah lawmah khai.<verse eid="1SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 23:9" />Sawl uang senah kownkow kamrüt mih tukta now uamow Abiathar kowi David tek pe mih, “En kowh ephawd kowrmow mami re-e uang sam pawla madiah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 23:10" />Now David tek mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai, makowi ang uowi mih rakowi Keila marow nauang piakta kownkow Sawl sangkrang mih achima ang tuk chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 23:11" />Keila marowchakuüa mih Sawl rut kowi naapta ang kown bow? Ang taah mih iawng Sawl nauang chang nowm kown bow? Aw CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai, achima pe tuk ang diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:11">Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG klangah mih, “Ow, aia nauang kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 23:12" />Now David plan lüntaah mih, “Now ang hai ang kowh maru-uüa kowi Sawl rut kowi Keila marowchakuüa naap anging kown bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:12">CHAKRAMANG klangah mih, “Ow, naap enni kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 23:13" />Nami laiklow tata hanow David mih maru iun 600 ia ngia kowi pawla now Keila marow hownia cham powt khai. Amatni dow mapra lai, paipra lai cham powt panglang khai. Now Keila marow hownia David powt khai bowt pami satang tata hanow Sawl dow Keila marow kowi kowkowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 23:14" />David dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim kowi hai Zif marow re-e kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi cham krawi uowi khai. Nami khin khe Sawl dow ni towng aia kowi krawi chamah reng chekhai. Nachenganchepaw aia kowi mih Sawl rut kowi Thurai ap-ah dowi.<verse eid="1SA 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 23:15" />Now pakat dow Zif marow re-e kowh Hawres pami arah kowi aia uowi khe David mih aia kowi Sawl nasaiah kownkow uang lawt mih satang ta khai. <verse eid="1SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 23:16" />Nachenganchepaw Sawl kowh chapa Jonathan dow Hawres pami arah kowi David tut-e kowkowi khai, now Thurai luk kowi neplawng nesak kownkow David kowi aia peah sakkraingra khai. <verse eid="1SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 23:17" />David kowi Jonathan tek pe mih, “Hangkow kram diah. Mapaw apa naka khüm en kown nadowi. Akat ni dow Israeluüa luk kowi en nachowm mang kown, now en dak kowi kowh lang kri mih en natow ang kown mih apa tuk chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 23:18" />Nahanow amatchi dow CHAKRAMANG kowi towla saksi khükhü tatow sangbowk laitawm khai. Nami kung kowi dow Jonathan mih kim kowi mang khai. Tawkchedow David dow Hawres kowi ta uowi khai.<verse eid="1SA 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 23:19" />Zif marowchakuüa mih Gibeah marow kowi kowkowiah now kowtek pe Sawl mih, “David tapet mih dow anging kowh süng kowi taih. Aia dow Hakila pami hungh kowi akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim kowi krawi uowi khai. Nami hungh dow Hawres re-e kowh Jesimawn mrawkphak prakowi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 23:20" />Mangkri, en nau khe uang diah. David kowi mang rut kowi naap-ah kown mih anging kowh lup chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 23:21" />Nakhowk khe Sawl klangah mih, “Enni dow saksing sana ang khai. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG pacham pe enni prasi lah. <verse eid="1SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 23:22" />Kowplan büah now achima kowkrawi paw satang büah akat diah; tawng kowi chow aia uowi mih hai mia chow aia kowi khi mih krawi paw satang büa diah. Aia dow lainowmma chanlai pe pami ang ta. <verse eid="1SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 23:23" />Aia cham tapetra maten krawi cham büa diah. Satang chima enni uang pawla kung kowi chiang enni hown ang tawi kown. Aia che pren lak kowi uowi khai hanow Juda süng maten kowi aia kowi dow ang nakrawi chamah kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 23:24" />Naiawng rakowi naiawngün maru-uüa mih Sawl dowi rawn Zif marow kowi kowrik mang khai. Nakhowk khe David hai aia kowh siphaiuüa uowi mih dow Maawn süngrüp süngkangma kowi chekhai. Nami dow Jesimawn mrawkphak pra kowh Arabai lawngrawi kowi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 23:25" />Akung kowi Sawl hai aia kowh siphaiuüa dow David kowi krawi chamah khai. Nachenganchepaw nami satang tata now David hai aia kowh siphaiuüa dow nami hownia powt khai, now Maawn süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh hua kangowh mih hungh kowi kowtapet büah khai. Nami satang tata hanow Sawl dow nami hungh kowi David kowi kowkrawiah khai.<verse eid="1SA 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 23:26" />Nachenganchepaw hungh mapra kowi Sawl krawi chamah khe David hai aia kowh siphaiuüa dow hungh paipra kowi powtta pe khai. Amatni dow Sawl hownia nowngia powtla kownkow sakkrowng sakkrangma mang büah khai. Mapra kowi Sawl hai aia kowh siphaiuüa dow David hai aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi naka khümla kownkow krawi uanah khai. <verse eid="1SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 23:27" />Nami khin tangtang khe maru lowk ia mih uangah now Sawl kowi uang phowng pe satang mih, “Filistinuüa uang sen a-i pren thüm khowk. Naiawng rakowi alenma uang mang diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 23:28" />Nami satang tata hanow Sawl dow kawikrawi David mih towta now Filistinuüa kowi kowsenah kownkow kowmang khai. Naiawng rakowi nami re-e kowh arah ming dow Plaira Huamang pahai maru chap pe khai. <verse eid="1SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 23:29" />Nami kung kowi dow nami hownia powt hanow David mih En-Gedi pami akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim kowi tapet khai.<verse eid="1SA 23:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1SA 24" />
  <para style="s">Sawl kowi David sanaah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 24:1" />Filistinuüa hown ki tasen kowh Sawl uang plan khe Sawl kowi maru uang phowng pe satang mih, “David dow En-Gedi pami süngrüp süngkangma kowi uowi khai,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 24:2" />Nami satang tata hanow Sawl dow Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia klo maru 3,000 ia khai. Now David hai aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi nakrawi cham kownkow Kaurawng Rua huamang pami arah re-e kowkowi khai.<verse eid="1SA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 24:3" />Amatni dow mang mang hanow ruapur tung uowi pre sum tung mih arah re-e kowting büah khai. Nami arah re-e dow puk paw uowi lowk chekhai. Now Sawl mih nacham uat kownkow nami puk kowi kowkup khai. Nachenganchepaw nami puk alak nowm nowm kowi dow David hai aia kowh siphaiuüa uowi khai. <verse eid="1SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 24:4" />Sawl uang uat mih khita now David kowi aia kowh siphaiuüa tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek en mih, ‘En kowh ransu kowi en rut kowi ang naap en kown, now aia luk kowi dow en tut-e iung iawng changah diah,’ pah en khai. Nami laiklow dow ani uang tachi mih chowbowt,” pakhai. Nakhowk khe David mih asachow asachow kowkowiah now Sawl khupah mih kowrmow kowhiah pe pasek khai.<verse eid="1SA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 24:5" />Nachenganchepaw Sawl kowh kowrmow ki hiata pasek kung kowi dow David mih mapaw sak sowr uowi dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 24:5" /><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="1SA 24:6-7" />Naiawng rakowi aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi David tek pe mih, “Hang klawk uailai büa diah! Sawl kowi a-i nachangah naklak kown nadowi. Aia dow ang kowh mangkri chekhai. CHAKRAMANG mih aia nümnapah mih mang kowi nachangah angak kown mih alow mapaw hauang pacham pe ang lah,” pakhai. Naiawng hown David dow Sawl kowi nakowngta dowi kownkow aia maru-uüa kowi hangah khai. Nami kung kowi Sawl dow puk hownia lawt hanow tarowng mang khai bowt.<verse eid="1SA 24:6-7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 24:8" />Now David paw puk hownia uang lawt hanow Sawl kowi atünma krawi hawah khai. Now Sawl uaidang khe dow David mih krawng kowi tabawkah krawm se chupah khai. <verse eid="1SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 24:9" />David tek pe Sawl mih, “David krawi chang en angak kown pahai maru tek en mih tawng en tuk owm khai? <verse eid="1SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 24:10" />Ani dow amatni kowh laiklow dai taih pami en tuk khowk chekhai. Tawngbak mih ang kowh siphaiuüa dow nasaita en kown mih tek ang khai. Nachenganchepaw ang sana en khai. Naiawng rakowi ang tek pe mih, ‘Ang kowh chakramang luk kowi ang ia tang rut dowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow CHAKRAMANG nümnapah mih maru chekhai,’ ang pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 24:11" />Aw apa, ang rut kowi kowh kowrmow sek sam mü madiah. Mami kowrmow sek dow kawmat kowh en khupah mih kowrmow hownia kowh ang hia-ah mih chekhai. Ang nau panü dow ang nowng sai en kown tai diah. Nachenganchepaw ang sai en dowi. Nami hownia ang chang en angak kown ang nau dowi pami achima en tuk khowk. En luk kowi ang changta angak mih tawngpaw uowi dowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw nasaita ang kownkow en krawi hing kramta ang hüah khai. <verse eid="1SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 24:12" />Achi pre ia kowi mia chow tawi mih CHAKRAMANG pacham chet achi tara lah. En chang ang angak kownkow en kamrüt mih rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow narip en chepaw naia kown. Nachenganchepaw ang dow en luk kowi mapaw natang rut kown nadowi. <verse eid="1SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 24:13" />Alai kowh maru-uüa tekah mih laiuat en natuk kown mih ang ming. Nami laiuat dow, ‘Lup ngak dow maru ngakuüa kowh lup chekhai,’ pakhai. Naiawng rakowi ang dow mapaw nachang en angak kown nadowi.<verse eid="1SA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 24:14" />“Mia iawng mih kowi chow nasaita kownkow Israel mang uang lawt? Mia iawng mih maru kowi chow en kawikrawi? En kawikrawi kui uak mih bow? Dowdow en kawikrawi kuikli mih bow? <verse eid="1SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 24:15" />CHAKRAMANG dow pacham chet achi tara lah, now aia dow achi pre ia kowi mia chow nga mih kowi pacham ripah lah. Aia dow tawi tangila ang hanow en rut hownia pacham lawng ang lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 24:16" />David kowh lai chur now Sawl tek mih, “Ang chapa David ching bow en?” pakhai. Naiawng tekta now aia dow atün atünma kar khai. <verse eid="1SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 24:17" />Now David kowi aia tek pe mih, “Ang lak-e en lang tachi tanawm khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow khowt ang chang en angak khowk chepaw en dow chang ang aiung khai. <verse eid="1SA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 24:18" />En chang ang angak kown en nau dowi mih achima en tüng ang khai. Ani mih en rut kowi CHAKRAMANG apta ang khowk chepaw en sai ang dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 24:19" />Kowmatia ransu kowi ka khüm kowh tawngpaw changah dowi matchang lawtta mih mia chow uowi? Ani kowh en chang ang aiung mih rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih pacham pe en iungra lah. <verse eid="1SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 24:20" />En naphaw mang ngengche kown mih hai en hownia Israel pren anikma nauowi kown mih kawmat dow ang tuk khowk. <verse eid="1SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 24:21" />Naiawng rakowi ang kung kowi kowh ang kowh krungchakuüa kowi en napiakah dowi kown mih hai ang kowh ming apa kimchakuüa hownia en namata ang dowi kownkow ani mih CHAKRAMANG ming hown ang tut-e takham diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 24:22" />Nahanow David dow nami lawnguan kowi aia tut-e takham khai. Nami kung kowi dow Sawl mih kim prakowi plan mang khai bowt, now David hai aia kowh siphaiuüa dow amatni tapetra akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim kowi kowkowi khai.<verse eid="1SA 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1SA 25" />
  <para style="s">Samuel kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 25:1" />Nami kung kowi dow Samuel mih kowng khai bowt. Nakhowk khe Israeluüa maten dow takua talawmah now Samuel vüi kowi uowila uiting uangtak khai. Amatni dow Samuel kowi Rama marow kowi kowh aia kim re-e dupah khai.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1SA 25:1">Nabal tut-e David kowlü khowng mih</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:1">Nami kung kowi dow David mih Paran süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowkowi khai. <verse eid="1SA 25:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="1SA 25:2-3" />Nami khin khe Maawn marow kowi Kaleb krungchak Nabal pami maru uowi lowk ia; aia dow kurengma chekhai. Tawkche aia dow kunma ngakma hai laiüama chekhai. Aia kowh dow Karmel marow kowi krawng uowi sangrum, rua uowi 3,000 pum, now ruapur paw uowi 1,000 pum chekhai. Aia kowh dow klangiungma hai chanlaima mih masi uowi lowk ia, aming dow Abigail chekhai. Nami mih khin khe Nabal dow Karmel kowi kep ruapur pawi thüm chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 25:2-3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 25:4" />Now Nabal kep ruapur pawi thüm pami satang dow Paran süngrüp süngkangma kowi uowi khe David ta khai. <verse eid="1SA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 25:5" />Naiawng rakowi David mih aia kowh klanguüa hawmh kowi ruiah hamüt ia now tek pe mih, “Karmel marow kowi Nabal tut-e kowkowi büa diah, now ang ming hown aia kowi kowchupah büa diah. <verse eid="1SA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 25:6" />Khowt now enni natek pe kown mih, ‘En, en kimchak hai en kowh uowi mih srui luk kowi iungra pauowi lah. <verse eid="1SA 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 25:7" />Kawmat dow en kep ruapur pawi thüm pami satang ang ta. Anging hown en kowh ruapur thing miuüa tawi uowi mowr dow amatni kowi anging changah angak dowi. Now Karmel marow kowi amatni uowi mowr dow amatni kowh tawng uanh paw tama dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 25:8" />En kowh ruapur thing miuüa kowi lüntaah now nami lawnguan dow en natuk kown taih. Kawmat dow en kowh awmrawm khin chowbowt. Naiawng rakowi ang kowh naruüa kowi hawt changah aiung diah; en ia mowr khowng anging diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh naruüa dow en kowh naruüa iawng chekhai, now ang dow en kowh chapa iawng chekhai,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 25:9" />Now David kowh klanguüa hawmh dow Nabal tut-e kowkowi now David ming hown naiawngün laiklow maten kowtek pe khai. Now tawng chow Nabal natek kown mih kowi chawngah büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 25:10" />Nakhowk khe Nabal klangah mih, “Mia chow nami David? Mia chow Jese kowh chapa? Kawmat khin kowmatia kim iah kowi towla hüah now powt mih nar uowi bümma. <verse eid="1SA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 25:11" />Ang kowh ruapur pawi kep miuüa vüi kawm hown chaknga hai tui uowi chowdiah. Tawkchedow naiawngün chakkham mih ang tukah dowi miuüa kowi mapaw ang nowng pe kown nadowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 25:12" />Nami laiklow tata hanow David kowh klanguüa hawmh dow David tut-e kowplan khai, now naiawngün laiklow maten David kowi kowtek pe büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 25:13" />Naiawng rakowi aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi David tek pe mih, “Enni bowkbowk chowlowkkow kelang kowi uai saidawng büa diah,” pakhai. Nahanow amatni bowkbowk dow chowlowkkow kelang kowi uai saidawng büah khai, now David paw tawi uai khai. Now maru iun 400 ia ngia dow David hown tawi khai, now maru iun 200 ia dow nahawt chawng uanh kownkow ta uowi khai.<verse eid="1SA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 25:14" />Nakhowk khe Nabal kowh masi Abigail kowi anar lowk ia uang tek pe mih, “Anging kowh kim iah kowi nauang chupah kownkow süngrüp süngkangma hownia David uang chin maru sangrum chowdiah. Tawkchedow aia mih naiawngün maru-uüa kowi hawt nangta nak khai. <verse eid="1SA 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 25:15" />Naiawngün maru-uüa dow aiungma chowdiah. Dowm kowi amatni re-e anging tawi thing ruapur khe amatni dow mapaw chang anging angak dowi, now anging kowh tawng iawng mih uanh paw tama dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 25:16" />Amatni tut-e anging tawi thing ruapur mowr dow amatni mih ni chut uar prowt anging riaret kowi tawi uowi khükhü tap iawng hai tawi chawng anging khai. <verse eid="1SA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 25:17" />Naiawng rakowi kawmat mih tawng chow en changah kown mih tatuak kaneu diah. Nadowi now anging kowh kim iah hai aia kowh maru-uüa maten luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown chaw. Tawngplawng kowchow panow anging kowh kim iah dow kunma ngakma chekhai, now maru laiklow paw sünta dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">David tut-e Abigail kowlü lawt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 25:18" />Nami laiklow tata hown krowksang Abigail mih kawm 200 pah, chak pik im hown grep tui pre im, ruapur tanga pum nga, chakkham ngai ia tanga sala ngia, grep uih keu kawm 100 sek, uidut uih keu kawm 200 sek kawrngaramchük luk kowi tangah khai. <verse eid="1SA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 25:19" />Nami kung kowi aia kowh naruüa kowi aia tek pe mih, “Ang pur kowi rik mang büa; enni kung kowi ang krawi ta mang sow,” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw naiawngün laiklow mih ahua Nabal kowi aia tekla pe dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 25:20" />Now kawrngaramchük luk kowi chowmla se hungh hownia Abigail iu sun thüm khe David hai aia kowh siphaiuüa paw alowk mih hungh hownia uang iu sun now aia prakowi uang haimang khai. Naiawng hai Abigail mih David büah hown kowtakrum khai. <verse eid="1SA 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 25:21" />Abigail hown takrum dowi rawn David tatuak mih, “Pai iawngün maru-uüa kowh uanh tawngpaw natama dowi kownkow süngrüp süngkangma kowi ang chawng pe mih aiawnglowma taih. Aia kowi dow ang changah aiung chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw aia dow chang ang angak khai. <verse eid="1SA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 25:22" />Naiawng rakowi tharau uarthowi dowi rawn Nabal hai aia kim kowi kowh uowi mih kachakuüa kowi lowk ia paw lat dowi pat ang nasaiah kown. Ang che saita bowk dowi hanow CHAKRAMANG mih kowng pat pacham rip ang lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 25:23" />Abigail dow David kowi khita now kawrngaramchük luk hownia alenma iu dowm khai, now krawng kowi tabawkah krawm se David kowi aia chupah khai. <verse eid="1SA 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 25:24" />Nami kung kowi dow aia mih David kowi dowk pe khawk khükhü tek pe mih, “Aw ang kowh chakramang, ang hua tawita mata mih aprek ang kur kown towbowt. Sakrauma hown en kowh narma kowi pe tekah lai pre sum nawrchow diah. <verse eid="1SA 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 25:25" />Ang kowh chakramang, Nabal kowh laiklow rakowi hang kunmarau diah. Nabal dow kunma ngakma hai asung uowi dowi mih maru chekhai. Aia dow aia kowh ming uan iawng abualama mih chekhai. En uang chinah mih klanguüa hawmh hown ang tawi takrum dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 25:26" />“Aw ang kowh chakramang, pe sai en maru dowi mih hai en matia rut hown pe paw en lu klai dowi mih dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai. Naiawng rakowi masing CHAKRAMANG ming hai en ming lüklaula se ang takham khowk; en kowh ransu-uüa hai chang en angak kown nau miuüa dow Nabal piak iawng napiak kown. <verse eid="1SA 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 25:27" />Aw ang kowh chakramang, ang dow en kowh narma chowtaih. Kawmat dow en kowh maru-uüa vüi hailawm en vüi ang uang pawla mih awmrawm sung paw ang diah. <verse eid="1SA 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 25:28" />En kowh narma kowh angak mih sakrauma hown lawtta pe diah. CHAKRAMANG dow en kowh krungchakuüa kowi anikma natow en kown taih. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh tasen mih maru chekhai. Kawmat mowr dow en kowh angak mih tawngpaw uowi dowi tak, now pur prakowi paw nauowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="1SA 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 25:29" />Nakowngta kownkow maru kawikrawi en chepaw en kowh asak dow CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai khet en reng pami ang tuk. Nachenganchepaw en kowh ransu-uüa kowh asak dow iaiba hown ap-ah mih huaklu tama iawng CHAKRAMANG namata pe kown. <verse eid="1SA 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 25:30" />CHAKRAMANG dow nachang en aiung kownkow aia kham en mih maten CHAKRAMANG nachang en kown, now Israeluüa luk kowi aia dow nathawp en aluchow kown. <verse eid="1SA 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 25:31" />Nakhowk khe mih alow akan uowi dowi kowi en cham saita maru rakowi hai en cham pawta lu klai rakowi en hang pacham sak nga lah. Aw ang kowh chakramang, ang dow en kowh narma chowdiah. Naiawng CHAKRAMANG pe en iungra khe mih hauang tamata ang diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 25:32" />Nakhowk khe Abigail kowi David tek pe mih, “Ang hown ani nauang takrum kownkow uang chin en mih CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai dow akiow pauowi lah. <verse eid="1SA 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 25:33" />En kowh prengia iung rakowi CHAKRAMANG kowi ang tek pe awmrawm lai. Nasai maru kown mih hownia hai ang matia rut hown napaw lu klai kown mih hownia en uang hen ang khai rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow pacham pe en prasi lah. <verse eid="1SA 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 25:34" />CHAKRAMANG dow ang nachang en angak kown mih hownia henta ang khai. Israeluüa kowh masing Thurai ming hown ang takham khowk, en che alenma ang hown uang takrum dowi panü dow Nabal kim kowi kowh kachakuüa uowi mih maten miapaw tharau uarthowi pat sing dowi tham diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 25:35" />Nami kung kowi dow aia vüi Abigail uang pawla pe mih awmrawm sung David paw pe khai. Now aia tek pe Abigail mih, “Kawmat dow thaulangma hown kim kowi kowplan towbowt. En kowh laiklow maten ang sünta en khowk. En tek iawng ang nachang en kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nabal kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 25:36" />Now Abigail dow Nabal tut-e kowplan khai bowt. Nakhowk khe aia dow mang chang pawi khe kowh iawng Nabal hawt chang pawi mih kowkhi khai. Nakhowk khe Nabal dow kham rak now piaw khai, now lainowmma pua khai. Naiawng rakowi Abigail mih uarthowi dowi mowr Nabal kowi tawngpaw tek pe dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 25:37" />Now rau-e Nabal kowh pua prowng khe dow tawng ngai chow phaw mih Nabal kowi amasi tek pe khai bowt. Nami laiklow tata now Nabal kowh sak dow kowng ngialia phaw khai, now kowpaw huaklu iawng akhawtma own khai. <verse eid="1SA 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 25:38" />Naiawng phaw mih hamüt ni kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ripra Nabal luk kowi uang ting now aia dow kowng khai bowt.<verse eid="1SA 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">David paw Abigail mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 25:39" />Nabal kowng mih satang tata hanow David tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG dow akiow pauowi lah. Nabal klowk ang dowi rakowi ang takcha CHAKRAMANG sat pe aklai mih chekhai. CHAKRAMANG dow ang nachang angak kown mih hownia hen ang khai, now Nabal kowh angak sung dow Nabal kowi aia pe kaah khai,” pakhai. Nami kung kowi dow David mih Abigail kowi aia nachawngah kown mih laiklow nakowtek pe kownkow kowchin maru khai. <verse eid="1SA 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 25:40" />Now David kowh maru-uüa mih Karmel marow kowi Abigail tut-e kowkowiah now kowtek pe mih, “David nachawng en kown nau pe. Naiawng rakowi en tut-e aia uang chin anging mih chowbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 25:41" />Nami laiklow tata hanow krawng kowi tabawkah krawm se Abigail klangah mih, “Ang dow David kowh nar chowtaih. Aia hown tachawng kown mih lainowmma ang awmrawm. Nami klen kowi aia kowh nar nachowng kown mih hai aia kowh naruüa kowi nasau pe khawk kown mih khowm padow ang nau chekhai,” pape khai. <verse eid="1SA 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 25:42" />Naiawng ki tekta now Abigail dow alenma kamrüt khai, now aia kowh narma tanga ia kowi pawla now kawrngaramchük luk kowi chowm se David uang chinah mih maru-uüa kung kowtawi tarü khai. Now David tut-e kowting hanow amatchi dow tachawng khai bowt.<verse eid="1SA 25:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 25:43" />Abigail hown tachawng dowi rawn David mih Jezrel kuachak Ahinoam kowi paw lowk ia khowk chekhai. David kowh masi dow Ahinoam hai Abigail iüah pre ia chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 25:44" />Naiawng phaw mih khin khe David kowh masi chük Mikal kowi dow Palti hown a-pa Sawl mih cham pe tachawngah khai. Palti dow Gallim kuachak Lais kowh chapa chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 25:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1SA 26" />
  <para style="s">Sawl kowi David sanaah iawk mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 26:1" />Akung kowi Zif pami süngrüp süngkangma re-e kowh marowchakuüa mih Gibeah marow kowi Sawl tut-e kowkowi khai. Now kowtek pe Sawl mih, “David tapet mih dow Jesimawn marow re-e kowh Hakila hungh kowi taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 26:2" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Sawl dow kowkrawi cham David kownkow Israel siphaiuüa kowi kloah 3,000 ia khai, now Zif pami süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowkowi büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 26:3" />Now Sawl hai aia kowh siphaiuüa dow Jesimawn marow re-e kowh tiama ria kowi Hakila hungh kowi khup tangbung khai, now David hai aia kowh siphaiuüa khup tangbung mih dow Zif süngrüp süngkangma kowi chekhai. Nakhowk khe David mih aia kowi Sawl uang krawi chamah mih satang ta khai. <verse eid="1SA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 26:4" />Naiawng rakowi aia dow kowchin <char style="w">dumiow</char> hanow Sawl uang kawikrawiah ching pami tuk khai.<verse eid="1SA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 26:5" />Now aia dow Sawl büah kowh tangbung khupra kowi kowkowiah now Sawl hai Ner kowh chapa Abner iüah kowh mawk rah alakchow hownia kowmüla khai. Abner dow Sawl kowh siphai aluchow chekhai. Sawl dow tangbung khupra dawnglang kowi mawk khai, now aia kowh siphaiuüa dow aia ria kowi tapat lut mawk khai.<verse eid="1SA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 26:6" />Now Hit chenchap Ahimelek hai Joab kowh naumow Abisai kowi David tek pe mih, “Paimi tangbung khupra kowi Sawl tut-e ang hown enchi pre ia kowi mia chow tawi kown?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:6">Nakhowk khe Abisai tek pe mih, “Ang tawi sow,” pape khai. Abisai kowh u dow Zerui chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 26:7" />Now David hai Abisai iüah mih uar-e khe Sawl kowh siphaiuüa tangbung khupra kowi kowkowi khai bowt. Nakhowk khe Sawl dow tangbung khupra dawnglang kowi müi khai. Now aia kowh reh dow aia iüaluk prakowi krawng kowi phükta hüah khai. Abner hai siphaiuüa dow aia ria kowi tapat lut tawi mawk khai.<verse eid="1SA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 26:8" />Nami khita now Abisai tek pe David mih, “Ani dow en kowh ransu kowi mih en rut kowi CHAKRAMANG apta en mih chowbowt. Pe ang ana bowt. Ang kowh reh hown akat sawt sang krawng kowi reh tarup hüah pat Sawl kowi ang nasawtah khai; pre kat asawt kla dowi tham,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 26:9" />Nakhowk khe David klangah mih, “Hangkow chang. CHAKRAMANG nümnapah mih maru luk kowi tang rut now aprek uowi dowi mih mia chow uowi? <verse eid="1SA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 26:10" />Masing CHAKRAMANG ming lüklaula se ang tek khowk, CHAKRAMANG matia ngengche aia kowi dow naripah kown taih. Aia dow iawngpa nakowng kown taih, nadowi now tasenra kowi nacham kowng kown taih. <verse eid="1SA 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 26:11" />Tawkchedow CHAKRAMANG mih aia nümnapah mih maru luk kowi natang rut kown mih alow dow hang pacham pe ang lah. Chu, aia iüaluk kowi kowh reh hai tuikawng kowpawla now achi powt towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 26:12" />Naiawng ki tek pe now David mih Sawl iüaluk kowi kowh reh hai tuikawng kowpawla now powt iüah khai. Nakhowk khe naiawng phaw mih dow Sawl kowh siphaiuüa miapaw tuk dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowi dow amüi suma CHAKRAMANG uang changta khai rakowi müi büah bowk chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 26:13" />Nami kung kowi dow David mih powt hanow tangbung khupra hownia alak sangrum mih hungh luk kowi kowiowng khai. <verse eid="1SA 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 26:14" />Now nami hungh luk hownia David mih Sawl kowh siphaiuüa kowi hai Abner kowi hawah khai. David tek pe mih, “Abner, ang kowh laiklow en ta tak bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:14">Now Abner klangah mih, “Mia chow en? Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng mangkri kowi tuk thowrah amüi khai?” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 26:15" />Now David tek pe mih, “En dow tasen akiakma mih siphai nadowi bow? Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi en hown tale mih mia chow uowi? Tawngplawng kowchow ransu-uüa rut hownia en kowh mangkri kowi en lawngah dowi? En kowh mang kowi nasaita kownkow maru uang lowk ia mih en tuk dowi bow? <verse eid="1SA 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 26:16" />Naiawng en chang mih mapaw iung dowi. Masing CHAKRAMANG ming hown ang tek khowk, en hai en kowh maru-uüa kowng tataing chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG nümnapah mih maru kowi ransu-uüa rut hownia en lawngah dowi chekhai. Mang iüaluk kowi kowh reh hai tuikawng tawng kowi chow?” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 26:17" />David kowh laiklow tata now Sawl tek mih, “Ang chapa David ching bow en?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:17">Nakhowk khe David klangah mih, “Ow mangkri, ang chowbowt. <verse eid="1SA 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 26:18" />Tawngplawng kowchow ang kowh mangkri mih aia kowh nar kowi kawi lang krawiah rereng? Tawng chow ang changta khai? Tawng angak chow ang kowh uowi? <verse eid="1SA 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 26:19" />Aw ang kowh mangkri, sakrauma hown kawmat dow en kowh nar kowh laiklow sünta pe diah. Nakingküa ang kown mih saktuak CHAKRAMANG pe en mih chekhai hanow ang kowh uanap mih aia pacham paw ang lah, now aia kowh saktuak mih pacham leta lah. Nachenganchepaw naiawng en chang mih che maru towk en kowh chekhai hanow towk en miuüa luk kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh piati pacham kla lah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa uowi rah hownia prütta ang hanow akeng thuraiuüa kowi nacham chup kown mih tek ang khai. <verse eid="1SA 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 26:20" />Aw ang kowh chakramang, sakrauma hown CHAKRAMANG chupra hownia alakma mih arah kowi hauang pe kowng ang diah. Ang dow kuikli khowt khowm asung uowi dowi mih maru chowtaih. Tawngplawng kowchow hungh kowi maru krawi ap pawngli mih iawng Israel mang kawi lang krawi ang rereng?” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 26:21" />Nakhowk khe Sawl tek pe mih, “Ang changta angak khai. Ang chapa David, uang plan diah. Mapaw ang chang en angak kown nadowi bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en nau panü dow auar khe en ia sai ang kown taih diah. Nachenganchepaw en sai ang dowi chekhai. Maiawng mih lup tawi ang chang mih dow abualama mih maru iawng ang na khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 26:22" />Now David klangah mih, “Aw mangkri, mow en kowh reh! Mami reh uang paw kownkow uang chin maru lowk ia diah. <verse eid="1SA 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 26:23" />CHAKRAMANG dow maru maten kowi kaah sakowmma mih lup hai anowmma mih lup rakowi peah awmrawm sung reng chekhai. Ani mih nasaita en kownkow ang rut kowi CHAKRAMANG apta en khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG nümnapah mih maru luk kowi natang rut kown mih ang nau dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 26:24" />Ani kowh ang tut-e en kowh chownglawng asung uowima iawng dow ang kowh chownglawng paw CHAKRAMANG tut-e asung uowima pauowi lah. Aia dow phih maten hownia pacham lawng ang lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 26:25" />Nakhowk khe Sawl tek pe David mih, “Ang chapa David, en pacham ka prasi lah. En changah mih lup maten nachawn kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:25">Nami kung kowi dow David mih aia kowh siphaiuüa tut-e kowplan khai bowt, now Sawl paw aia kim prakowi plan mang khai bowt.<verse eid="1SA 26:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1SA 27" />
  <para style="s">Filistin pren kowi David powt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 27:1" />Nachenganchepaw David ka tuak mih, “Pani dowi now pani dow Sawl rut kowi ang mih akowng natakla kown lowmow. Naiawng rakowi Filistinuüa pren kowi powt mih ang vüi nalang iung kown. Nahanow Israel pren kowi Sawl mih nakrawi cham ang kown nadowi bowt, now ang paw aia rut hownia naplai kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 27:2" />Naiawng rakowi David mih aia kowh maru-uüa 600 ia kowi pawla now Maawk kowh chapa Akhis tut-e kowpowt khai. Akhis dow Gat marow mang chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 27:3" />Now David hai aia kowh maru-uüa dow Gat marow kowi Akhis tut-e tawi uowi khai bowt. David kowh maru-uüa hown dow amatni chowlowkkow kimchakuüa paw tawi uowi bowk chekhai, now David hown paw aia kowh masi pre ma mih tawi uowi khai. David kowh masi pre ma kowi lowk ia mih dow Jezrel kuachak Ahinoam chekhai, now alowk mih dow Karmel kuachak kowng mih Nabal kowh masi Abigail chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 27:4" />Gat marow kowi David kowpowt khai bowt pami satang tata hanow Sawl dow David kowi nasaiah kownkow krawi chamah dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 27:5" />Pakat khe David tek pe Akhis mih, “Mangkri, en che sak-ih ang khai hanow mami pren kowi ang tawi ia uowila kownkow tawng mih marow kowi chünchü pe ang arah sangrumchow dit snow. Ang dow en kowh nar chowtaih. Naiawng rakowi en hown marow kri kowi pe uowi ang kla dowi,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 27:6" />Naiawng rakowi Akhis mih David kowi Ziklak marow peah khai. Nami hownia bowt now Ziklak marow dow ani mowr pat Juda manguüa krüa kowi uowi reng chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 27:7" />Now David dow Filistinuüa pren kowi paning hown tali la mowr tawi uowi khai.<verse eid="1SA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 27:8" />Filistin pren kowi uowi khe David mih aia kowh maru-uüa kowi pawla now Gesuruüa, Girziuüa hai Amalekuüa kowi krawi senah hanow pawta pe dawngthawnguan bowk khai. Achük alai hownia naiawngün chenchapuüa uowi mih dow Sur pren hai Aigupta pren sünghi mowr kowi kowh uowi mih süng maten kowi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 27:9" />Naiawngün chenchapuüa kowi krawi senah khe David dow kachakuüa hai masiuüa maten kowi saila bowk khai. Nachenganchepaw tawncher hai tawnguat maten dow aia uang pawla reng chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 27:10" />Now Akhis tut-e aia uang plan towng Akhis hawt lüntaah mih, “Ani dow tawng kowi chow en cham tasen?” pakhai. Nakhowk khe David mih, “Juda pren kowi kowh tawngphak pra kowh süng kowi taih,” pakhai, tawngbak khe dow, “Jerameluüa pren kowi kowh tawngphak pra kowh süng kowi taih,” pakhai, now tawngbak khe dow, “Kenuüa pren kowi kowh tawngphak pra kowh süng kowi taih,” pahai daiah reng chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 27:11" />David dow aia cham senah mih marow kowi kowh maru maten kowi saila bowk reng chekhai. Lowk iachow khowm padow Gat marow kowi asing katpaw aia uang pawla dowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow asing che aia towla ne hanow tawng kowi chow aia cham tasen mih Akhis kowi natek pe kown chekhai padow aia ka tuak khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow Filistinuüa pren kowi kowuown uowi hownia naiawng chang reng chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 27:12" />Nachenganchepaw Akhis dow David kowi owmah khai. Aia dow ka tuak mih, “Naiawng David chang reng hanow aia kowi dow aiamat chenchap Israeluüa nasuiah kown towbowt, now aia sing uowi mowr mih ang kowh nar nachowng kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 27:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1SA 28" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowi nasenah kownkow Filistinuüa kamrüt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 28:1" />Ziklak marow kowi David uowi mih khin khe Israeluüa kowi kowsenah kownkow Filistinuüa mih amatni kowh siphaiuüa kowi kuaah lawmah khai. Nakhowk khe mang Akhis tek pe David mih, “En hai en kowh siphaiuüa mih ang hown tawi tarü tasen kown takla pami en natuk ngengche bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 28:2" />Nakhowk khe David klangah mih, “Ow, ang tawi kown taih. Khaleng dow en kowh nar tawng chow nowng chang mih en matia mik hown en nakhi kown,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:2">Akhis tek pe mih, “Lainowmma iung. Chownglawng prat ang kowh chawng mih ang nachangla en kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samuel kowh lümla hown Sawl taklang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 28:3" />Nami dowi rawn khe Samuel dow kowng tüng khowk chekhai. Aia vüi kowi uowila uiting uangtak kung kowi aia kowh uak dow aia uowi rah Rama marow kowi Israeluüa dupah khai. Now kowng miuüa kowh lümla hown nowng taklang miuüa kowi hai lümla ngak hown taklawp taiua miuüa maten kowi dow Samuel kowng dowi rawn khe Israel pren hownia Sawl prütta bowk khowk chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 28:4" />Filistinuüa dow takua talawmah now Sunem marow kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. Now mapra kowi Sawl paw Israeluüa maten kowi kuaah lawmah khai, now Gilboa hungh kowi kowkhup tangbung büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 28:5" />Nakhowk khe Sawl dow Filistin siphai kawm khita now kram lai bowt kowh chür klukluk khai. <verse eid="1SA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 28:6" />Aia dow tawng chow nachang kown mih tuk kown nau kowh CHAKRAMANG kowi lüntaah khai. Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG mih aia kowi dow mapaw klangah dowi chekhai — mang kowi paw klangah dowi, Urim hown paw klangah dowi, now risiuüa hown paw klangah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 28:7" />Nakhowk khe aia kowh maru iukuüa kowi Sawl tek pe mih, “Kowng miuüa kowh lümla hown ia taklang mih masiuüa kowi krawi cham büah lowk ia madiah. Tawng chow ang achang takla mih aia kowi dow ang nalüntaah kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:7">Now aia kowh maru iukuüa tek pe mih, “Endawr marow kowi naiawng mih masiuüa uowi lowk ia,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 28:8" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Sawl mih aia kowh mang tawnguat klüpta now iawngpa mih tawnguat khup khai, now pawla maru pre ia hanow uar-e khe nami masiuüa tut-e kowkowi khai. Nakhowk khe Sawl mih aia dow mang pami itta khai. Now nami masiuüa kowi aia tek pe mih, “Chang mantan now kowng mih maru kowh lümla hown taklang madiah. Ang tek en ming mih maru kowi mami re-e uang pawla madiah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 28:9" />Nakhowk khe nami masiuüa klangah mih, “Naiawng chang mih maru kowi tawng chow Sawl changah mih en tuk kown mih ang ming. Kowng mih maru kowh lümla hown taklowp taklang miuüa kowi hai lümla ngak hown taklawp taiua miuüa kowi Israel pren hownia aia prütta bowk khowk chekhai. Nami en tuk khowk chepaw naiawng en pe chang ang mih dow en pe kowng ang kownkow en chak ang leng mih iawng chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 28:10" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG ming lüklaula se Sawl tek pe mih, “Masing CHAKRAMANG ming hown ang takham khowk; naiawng en chang mih rakowi en naka ripra kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 28:11" />Now Sawl kowi nami masiuüa lüntaah mih, “Naiawng now mia kowi chow ang nauang krüngla en kown?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:11">Now Sawl tek pe mih, “Samuel kowi uang krüngla ang madiah,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 28:12" />Naiawng rakowi nami masiuüa dow Sawl tek pe iawng chang khai bowt. Nachenganchepaw Samuel kowi aia khita now hek se aia tek pe Sawl mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow en tuk kuan ang khai? En chowbowt lownow Saul,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 28:13" />Nakhowk khe Sawl tek pe mih, “Hangkow kram. Tawng chow en khi mih tek ang diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:13">Now nami masiuüa tek pe mih, “Krawng dak hownia thurai iawng mih maru uang lawt lowk mih ang khi,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 28:14" />Sawl lüntaah mih, “Apowm tawng iawng chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Nami masiuüa klangah mih, “Lawngtangma mih maru uang lawt lowk ia. Aia dow kowrmow thawngma mih khupma chekhai,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Nahanow Sawl dow Samuel chowbowt pami tuk khai. Now aia dow krawng kowi tabawkah krawm se chupah khai bowt.<verse eid="1SA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 28:15" />Samuel tek pe Sawl mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow en tuk pusa ang khai? Tawng rakowi chow en uang tuk krüngla ang khai?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:15">Now Sawl tek pe mih, “Lainowmma ang kla phih khai. Paipra kowi Filistinuüa dow uang sen ang khai, now mapra kowi CHAKRAMANG paw cham dangta ang khai. Aia kowi dow ang hawah khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw aia dow klang ang dowi: Mang kowi paw klang ang dowi, now risiuüa hown paw klang ang dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi kawmat tawng chow ang achang takla mih natukla kownkow ang uang haw en mih chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 28:16" />Now Samuel tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG powtta en kowh tawi tangila en dowi bowt now uang lünta ang e tawng chow mrawkra uowi? <verse eid="1SA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 28:17" />Aia dow en tut-e kowh uang pe tek ang mih iawng chang en mih chowbowt. En kowh mangra dow aia rupta en hanow en tainau David kowi peah mih chowbowt. <verse eid="1SA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 28:18" />En dow CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow en chün dowi; Amalekuüa luk kowi kowh aia kunmarau mih en kowh lup hown en tüng pe dowi chekhai. Ani kowh naiawng aia chang en mih dow naiawng rakowi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 28:19" />CHAKRAMANG mih Filistinuüa rut kowi en hai en hown kowh Israeluüa kowi naap enni kown. Tharau hownia dow en hai en kowh chapauüa mih makownguüa uowi rah kowi towbowt ang hown enni nauang tawi uowi kown. Now Israel siphaiuüa kowi paw aia dow Filistinuüa rut kowi naapta bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 28:20" />Samuel kowh laiklow tata now Sawl dow kram lai bowt kowh krawng kowi tateng kan khai. Aia dow ni chut uar prowt tawngpaw cha dowi rakowi lainowmma kow uak khai bowt.<verse eid="1SA 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 28:21" />Nakhowk khe nakowi kowh masiuüa mih lainowmma Sawl kram mih khita khai. Naiawng rakowi Sawl kowi aia tek pe mih, “Mangkri, en kowh narma dow en kowh ana pek chün en khowk chekhai. En tek ang mih lup dow kowng kown mih tuakla dowi kowi ang chang en khai. <verse eid="1SA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 28:22" />Kawmat dow en paw en kowh narma kowh laiklow sünta pe lowkchow diah. En kowh kür nauowila kownkow ang nauang pawla en chakkham ditchow kown. Nami chakkham cha pe ditchow diah. Nahanow mangla kown mih kür en naplan ka kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 28:23" />Nachenganchepaw Sawl tek pe mih, “Ang nau dowi, ang cha kown nadowi,” pape khai. Nachenganchepaw nami masiuüa hai aia kowh siphaiuüa dow nacha ditchow kownkow Sawl kowi tek pe rengreng khai. Naiawng rakowi Sawl mih awr rü hanow <char style="w">salawnma</char> kowi awr chowm khai.<verse eid="1SA 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 28:24" />Nakhowk khe nami masiuüa kowh dow akauchow mih chia iia uowi apum chekhai. Aia dow alenma nami chia iia mih kowngenah hanow eng pe khai, now kawmdi sangrum hown the pe tuah dowi mih kawm thawp pe khai. <verse eid="1SA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 28:25" />Nami kung kowi dow Sawl hai aia kowh siphaiuüa pur kowi nami chakkham mih aia uang then pe khai, now amatni dow nami chakkham cha büah khai bowt. Nami kung kowi dow uariiu reng tak khe nami hownia powt büah khai.<verse eid="1SA 28:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1SA 29" />
  <para style="s">David kowi Filistin kruitown miuüa prütah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 29:1" />Akat khe Filistinuüa mih amatni kowh siphaiuüa maten kowi Aphek pami arah kowi kuaah lawmah khai. Nakhowk khe Israeluüa dow Jezrel lawngrawi kowi kowh tuikuam re-e khup tangbung khai. <verse eid="1SA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 29:2" />Filistinuüa kowh pren kruitown miuüa dow siphai 100 ia hai siphai 1,000 ia kowi pawla now mang iualua khai, now amatni kung kowi dow Akhis hown David mih aia siphaiuüa kowi pawla now tawi tarü khai. <verse eid="1SA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 29:3" />Nami khita now Filistin siphai aluchowuüa tek mih, “Naiawngün Hebraiuüa tawng chow makowi chekhai?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 29:3">Nakhowk khe Akhis tek pe mih, “Mami dow Israel pren mang Sawl kowh nar David chowbowt. Ang tut-e aia uowi mih pre sum ning khowk chekhai. Sawl kowi aia powtta mih ni hownia ani mowr kowi aia kowh aprek dow tawngpaw ang khi pe dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 29:4" />Nachenganchepaw nami laiklow tata now Filistinuüa kowh siphai aluchowuüa dow Akhis luk kowi kunmarau khai. Amatni tek pe Akhis mih, “Nami maru kowi en khowm bowkta mih arah kowi kowchinta prang. Aia dow a-i hown natawi ia tarü tasen kown nadowi. Nadowi now tasenra kowi natawi khowng a-i lak dow natawi sen a-i kown chekhai. Aia kowh mang hown taking tasangra nauowila iawk kownkow a-i kowh lu dung pawla pe khü chiang mih tuk dowi bow? <verse eid="1SA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 29:5" />Nami klen kowi,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 29:5" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 29:5">“‘Saul sai ransu-uüa mih dow athawng athawng ia chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 29:5">David sai ransu-uüa mih dow tasawng tasawng ia chekhai,’ pahai plai se masiuüa hawmh tek meng mih nami David lawnguan kowi chowbowt nadowi bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 29:6" />Naiawng rakowi Akhis tek pe David mih, “Masing CHAKRAMANG ming hown ang takham khowk, en dow kaah sakowmma mih maru pami ang tuk chekhai. Ang hown en tawi tarü tasen kown takla pami ang ka tuak. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en uang uowi mih ni hownia ani mowr en luk kowi tawng iawng mih atawi ama paw ang khi dowi tak. Nachenganchepaw akeng mih kruitown miuüa dow en luk kowi sak-ih dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 29:7" />Naiawng rakowi thaulangma hown kowplan mang diah; Filistin kruitown miuüa nasak-ih en dowi kown mih lup hang chang diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 29:8" />Nakhowk khe David tek pe mih, “Tawng angak chow ang changta khai rakowi naiawng tuk chang ang khai? En tut-e ang uang uowi hownia ani mowr kowi en kowh nar kowh aprek tawng chow en khi mih uowi? Tawngplawng kowchow ang kowh mangkri kowh ransu-uüa hown ang tawi nowng tasen dowi kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 29:9" />Now Akhis klangah mih, “En dow ang tut-e Thurai kowh <char style="w">kramamu</char> iawng aiungma chekhai. Nachenganchepaw ang hown en tawi tarü tasen kown mih Filistin siphai aluchowuüa nauta dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 29:10" />Naiawng rakowi en hai en hown kowh uang tawi miuüa maten tharau uarthowi hown krowksang rü now mang büa diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 29:11" />Naiawng rakowi David hai aia kowh maru-uüa dow murpa awr rü hanow Filistinuüa pren kowi plan mang khai, now Filistin siphaiuüa dow Jezrel prakowi kowtarü khai.<verse eid="1SA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="1SA 30" />
  <para style="s">David kowh masi hawmuüa kowi Amalekuüa khümla mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="1SA 30:1-2" />Filistin pren kruitown miuüa pe tawi tasenah dowi rakowi David hai aia kowh siphaiuüa dow Ziklak marow kowi uang plan khai bowt, now amatni dow sum ni kowh ni khe Ziklak marow kowi uang ting büah khai. Nachenganchepaw nami takra kowi Negeb süng kowi kowh Filistinuüa kowi hai Ziklak marowchakuüa kowi mih Amalekuüa uang ta senah khai. Nakhowk khe Amalekuüa mih Ziklak marow dow hing towkla khai. Amatni dow nakowi kowh maru-uüa maten kowi nachangla nar kownkow lowk iachow paw saiah dowi kowi pawla bowk khai.<verse eid="1SA 30:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 30:3" />David hai aia kowh siphaiuüa dow Ziklak marow kowi uang ting now marow kamnama mih uang khi khai bowt. Now amatni kowh masi chauüa kowi Amalekuüa pawla bowk mih tuk büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 30:4" />Nakhowk khe David hai aia kowh siphaiuüa dow atün atünma kar büah khai. Naiawng amatni kar rakowi achur kowi amatni dow karla kown mih kür khowm padow uowi dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 30:5" />David kowh masi pre ma mih kowi paw Amalekuüa pawla pe khai. David kowh masi lowk ia mih dow Jezrel marow kowi kowh Ahinoam chekhai, now alowk mih dow Karmel marow kowi kowh kowng mih Nabal kowh masi Abigail chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 30:6" />Nakhowk khe David dow lainowmma kla phih khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nakhowk khe mih aia kowh siphaiuüa dow amatni kowh masi chauüa rakowi David luk kowi lainowmma kunmarau khai. Amatni dow hua hown kuakah now David kowi nakowngta kown mih tatek büah khai. Nachenganchepaw David dow CHAKRAMANG aia kowh Thurai luk kowi neplawng nesak khai rakowi plan ka kür khai.<verse eid="1SA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="1SA 30:7-8" />Nakhowk khe Ahimelek kowh chapa uamow Abiathar kowi David tek pe mih, “En kowh ephawd kowrmow uang pe ang madiah,” pakhai. Now nami kowrmow uang pawla kung kowi CHAKRAMANG kowi David lüntaah mih, “Amalekuüa kowi ang kawikrawi kown bow? Amatni kowi ang krawi ia tuk kown bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:7-8">Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG klangah mih, “Ow, kowkawi krawi bowt. Amatni kowi dow en nakrawi ia tuk ngengche kown taih, now amatni khümla mih maten kowi en nakrawi ia lawng kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 30:7-8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="1SA 30:9-10" />Nakhowk khe David mih aia kowh siphai 600 ia kowi pawla now kowkawi krawi Amalekuüa khai. Amatni dow hungma mawngma süng kowi kowh Besawr aw re-e kowting hanow bowm lai bowt rakowi nami re-e maru iun 200 ia kowi ta towla khai. Nami hownia now maru iun 400 ia hown David mih kawikrawi ransu-uüa khai.<verse eid="1SA 30:9-10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 30:11" />Akung kowi David kowh siphaiuüa dow dowm kowi Aigupta maru kowi khi lowk ia khai, now amatni dow nami maru kowi David tut-e kowpawla khai. Now amatni dow nami maru kowi pe chaah chakkham büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 30:12" />Nami klen kowi amatni dow uidut uih keu kawm apah hai grep uih keu pre pawt nami maru kowi pe chaah büah khai. Nami maru dow sum ni sum uar tawngpaw cha dowi kham dowi rakowi kow uakma chekhai. Nachenganchepaw aia dow naiawngün chakkham chata hanow uang awr ching khai.<verse eid="1SA 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 30:13" />Nami maru kowi David lüntaah mih, “Mia maru chow en? Tawng hownia chow en uang?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:13">Nami maru klangah mih, “Ang dow Aigupta maru, Amalekuüa kowh nar taih. Ang arau uowi mih ani hown sum ni khowk. Naiawng rakowi ang kowh kim iah towla ang hüah now mangta ang khai. <verse eid="1SA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 30:14" />Keretuüa pren kowi kowh mrawkphak pra kowh süng kowi, Judauüa kowh süng kowi hai Kalebuüa pren kowi kowh mrawkphak pra kowh süng kowi anging kowkrawi sen mih chowdiah, now Ziklak marow dow anging towkla khai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 30:15" />Now David tek pe mih, “Pai iawngün siphaiuüa tut-e en ia pawla ang kown bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:15">Nami maru klangah mih, “Naiawng now en nakowngta ang dowi kown mih hai ang kowh kim iah tut-e en naap ang dowi kown mih en kowh Thurai ming hown takham diah. Nahanow pai iawngün siphaiuüa tut-e ang nakowpawla en kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="1SA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amalekuüa kowi David nowngta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 30:16" />Now nami lawnguan kowi David takham kung kowi dow nami maru mih Amalekuüa tut-e David kowi kowpawla khai. Nakhowk khe Amalekuüa dow dowm kowi tauet plawt chekhai. Amatni dow cha büah kham büah hanow apiawma uowi büah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Filistin pren hownia hai Judauüa süng hownia amatni kala uanh mih ahuma chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 30:17" />David dow nami ni sat kup hownia auai ni sat kup mowr mih Amalekuüa kowi kowsenah khai. Nami tasen kowi dow ut luk kowi chowm se klanguüa hawmh ia powt 400 ia mih klen kowi miapaw ia plai dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 30:17" /><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="1SA 30:18-19" />David mih Amalekuüa pawla mih tawncher, uanh hai maru maten kowi uang plan kala bowk khai, now aia kowh masi pre ma mih kowi paw uang plan kala khai. Amalekuüa pawla mih maten tawngpaw lat dowi kowi aia dow uang plan pawla bowk chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 30:18-19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 30:20" />Nami klen kowi aia dow Amalekuüa kowh chia hai ruapur maten paw uang pawla pe khai. Naiawngün tawncher kowi dow aia kowh siphaiuüa mih amatni kowh tawncher hawmh pur kowi rik pe mangah khai. Amatni dow tek mih, “Tasenra hownia kaah mih maiawngün uanh maten dow David kowh chekhai,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="1SA 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 30:21" />Now bowm lai kowh Besawr aw kowi David ta towla 200 ia mih siphaiuüa tut-e amatni dow uang plan khai bowt. Nakhowk khe nami 200 ia mih siphaiuüa dow David hai aia tut-e kowh tawi mih siphaiuüa kowi uang krawi chumah khai. Now amatni takrum khe David mih amatni kowi dow pawah satang khai. <verse eid="1SA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 30:22" />Nachenganchepaw nakhowk David hown tawi tarü tasen miuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh tuak ngakma miuüa tek mih, “Tawi tarü tasen dowi miuüa dow a-i uang kala mih uanh hownia tawngpaw tawi ka bak kown nadowi; Amatni kowh masi chauüa kowi krowngchow taih natawi ka büah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1SA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 30:23" />Nakhowk khe David klangah mih, “Ang kowh tainau-uüa low, naiawng nadowi. CHAKRAMANG pe a-i mih uanh luk kowi naiawng hang chang büah. Aia dow lawng a-i khai, now a-i kowh ransu-uüa kowi ap a-i khai. <verse eid="1SA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 30:24" />Naiawng enni tek mih laiklow dow miapaw nauta enni dowi tham. Cham tarü tasen miuüa hai ta chawng uanh miuüa maten paw arisang natawi ka uanh bak kown,” pape khai. <verse eid="1SA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 30:25" />Nami ari dow nami ni hownia naiawng nasunah reng kownkow Israeluüa vüi David tow pe khai. Nami ari dow ani mowr paw Israeluüa chün reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="1SA 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">A-auiuauüa kowi David krawi sa pe awmrawm sung mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 30:26" />Now Ziklak marow kowi uang ting hanow tasenra kowi kowh David kaah mih uanh hownia Juda krungchak kowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi krawi sala pe awmrawm sung ne khai. Naiawng aia krawi sala pe awmrawm sung miuüa dow aia kowh auiuauüa chekhai. Aia dow aia auiuauüa kowi krawi tek pe mih, “Maiawngün awmrawm sung ang krawi sa enni mih dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ransu-uüa hownia ang krawi khünah mih chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="1SA 30:26" /><verse number="27-31" style="v" sid="1SA 30:27-31" />David krawi sa pe awmrawm sung mih aluchowuüa uowi rah dow Bethel marow, Ramawt-Negeb marow, Jattir marow, Aroer marow, Sifmawt marow, Estemua marow, Rakal marow, Jerameluüa kowh marow, Kenuüa kowh marow, Hawrma marow, Bawr-Asan marow, Athak marow hai Hebrawn marow kowi chekhai. Nami klen kowi aia dow aia cham krawi kowiah mih marow maten kowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi paw sala pe <char style="w">awmrawm sung</char> khai.<verse eid="1SA 30:27-31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="1SA 31" />
  <para style="s">Sawl hai achapauüa kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 31:1" />Filistinuüa hown Israeluüa tasen khe Israeluüa dow Filistinuüa pur hownia powt khai. Nakhowk khe tawngbak mih dow Gilboa hungh kowi Filistinuüa rut kowi kowng ne chekhai. <verse eid="1SA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 31:2" />Filistinuüa mih Sawl hai achapauüa kowi kawikrawiah hanow achapa Jonathan, Abinadab hai Malkisua büah kowi saita khai. <verse eid="1SA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 31:3" />Nami kung kowi paw Israeluüa hown Filistinuüa dow lainowmma tasen reng tak chekhai. Nakhowk khe leba dowk mih siphaiuüa mih Sawl kowi khita hanow ap-ah khai.<verse eid="1SA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 31:4" />Nakhowk khe aia kowh rutchün khawkleng uai mih siphai kowi Sawl tek pe mih, “En kowh saidawng hown saita ang bowt. Naiawng nadowi now pai iawngün hiah khampha uanpik dowi mih maru-uüa uangah now nauang saita ang kown chowbowt, now nakhare ang büah kown towbowt,” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw aia kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng uai mih siphai dow naiawng nachang kown mih nauta dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow lainowmma kram khai. Naiawng rakowi Sawl mih aia kowh saidawng howkah now aia matia tasawt khai.<verse eid="1SA 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 31:5" />Now Sawl kowng khai bowt mih khita hanow aia kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng dowk mih siphai paw aiamat kowh saidawng hown aia matia tasawt khai, now aia paw Sawl hown tawi kowng khai. <verse eid="1SA 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 31:6" />Naiawng hai nami ni dow Sawl hai achapa sum ia hown aia kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng uai mih siphai hailawm akeng miuüa paw tawi kowng sangrum khai.<verse eid="1SA 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 31:7" />Naiawng Sawl hai achapauüa kowng mih hown akeng mih Israeluüa powt mih dow Jezrel lawngrawi paipra kowi kowh uowi mih Israeluüa hai Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi kowh Israeluüa khita khai. Nami khita hanow amatni paw amatni kowh marow mih towla hüah hanow powt khai, now naiawngün marow maten dow Filistinuüa uang ta powngta bowk khai.<verse eid="1SA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 31:8" />Now auai ni dow Filistinuüa mih kowng mih Israeluüa kowh uanh maten nauang paw kownkow uang tarü khai bowt. Nakhowk khe amatni dow Gilboa hungh luk kowi Sawl hai achapa sum ia kowh uak takuak hüah mih uang khi büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 31:9" />Amatni dow Sawl kowh lu dungta pe khai, now aia kowh tasen tawnguat hai tasen müa rutchün khawkleng paw klüpla now pawla khai. Now Filistin pren kowi kowh arah maten kowi nami satang nakrawi phowng kownkow amatni kowh arup aren chupra kim kowi hai amatni kowh maru-uüa tut-e krawi chin maru khai. <verse eid="1SA 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 31:10" />Nami kung kowi dow amatni mih Sawl kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng pawla now Astarte thurai chup kim kowi towah büah khai, now aia kowh buk dow Bet-San marow tap kowi tarta hüah khai.<verse eid="1SA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 31:11" />Now Sawl luk kowi naiawng Filistinuüa changah mih satang dow Jabes-Gilead marow kowi kowh maru-uüa mih tawi ta khai bowt. <verse eid="1SA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 31:12" />Naiawng rakowi nakowi kowh tasen akiakma mih siphaiuüa dow uar prowt kowtarü büah hanow Bet-San marow tap hownia Sawl hai achapauüa uak mih kowkla büah khai. Now amatni dow naiawngün uak mih Jabes-Gilead marow kowi uang chengah büah khai. <verse eid="1SA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 31:13" />Nami kung kowi dow naiawngün hut mih nakowi kowh painglang singh tut re-e dupah büah khai. Now amatni uowila uiting uangtak mih natüngla büah kownkow ranit ni mowr khang hawm büah khai.<verse eid="1SA 31:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 31" />
</usx>